(318, 1, 15, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'In value-based selling, why is it crucial to understand the prospect\'s \'previous rejection\' experience?', '[\"To criticize their previous choices\",\"To understand pain tolerance and investment motivation levels\",\"To gather competitive intelligence\",\"To show empathy only\"]', '[1]', 'Pain from past failures increases motivation for current investment - leverage this tactfully.', 'Previous rejection creates emotional pain and increases willingness to invest in professional support.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:04:44', 1, '2025-09-01 18:04:44', 0),
