(335, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'A prospect says \'I\'ve been working on my synopsis for 6 months and got stuck.\' What does this indicate for sales strategy?', '[\"Low motivation\",\"High pain tolerance + time investment = increased willingness to invest in professional completion\",\"Difficulty with research\",\"Needs basic package\"]', '[1]', 'Time investment increases purchase motivation - acknowledge their effort and position service as completion catalyst.', 'Significant time investment creates sunk cost effect and increases willingness to invest in completion.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
