(341, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'When positioning against \'Professor Kumar\'s Research Solutions\' (hypothetical local competitor), what\'s the most effective approach?', '[\"Price comparison\",\"\\\"Individual professor expertise vs. 150+ PhD experts; single point of failure vs. institutional backup\\\"\",\"Service comparison\",\"Timeline comparison\"]', '[1]', 'Institutional scale provides reliability and expertise breadth advantages over individual providers.', 'Highlights scale advantage and risk mitigation compared to individual service providers.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(342, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'For a prospect asking about \'PRISMA compliance for systematic review,\' what does this indicate?', '[\"Basic literature review needs\",\"Advanced systematic literature review requiring specialized methodology and compliance frameworks\",\"Simple research requirements\",\"Standard review paper\"]', '[1]', 'Specialized methodology knowledge demonstrates expertise and justifies premium pricing.', 'PRISMA compliance indicates advanced systematic review requirements with specific methodological standards.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(343, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'A prospect mentions \'My university requires 75+ references.\' What service positioning should you use?', '[\"Standard reference inclusion\",\"\\\"Our 350+ academic library access ensures comprehensive coverage beyond minimum requirements\\\"\",\"Additional reference service\",\"Basic research support\"]', '[1]', 'Turn specific requirements into opportunities to demonstrate superior resources.', 'Positions extensive library access as solution for high reference requirements.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(344, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'When a prospect says \'I\'m comparing you with ThesisHelp India,\' what competitive intelligence should you gather?', '[\"Their pricing only\",\"Their pricing, timeline, expert qualifications, success rates, and support model\",\"Just their services\",\"Nothing - focus on PhDiZone benefits\"]', '[1]', 'Understanding competitor positioning helps identify differentiation opportunities and objection sources.', 'Comprehensive competitive understanding enables effective differentiation and positioning.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(345, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What\'s the advanced sales principle behind offering \'Executive Summary for quick review\' as value addition?', '[\"More deliverables\",\"Addresses time-pressed reviewer needs while adding perceived value at low delivery cost\",\"Shows capability\",\"Increases project scope\"]', '[1]', 'Best value additions solve genuine problems with minimal additional cost.', 'High-value perception add-on that costs little to deliver but solves real client problem.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(346, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'In advanced negotiation, when should you use the \'Volume Commitment\' strategy?', '[\"With all prospects\",\"When price objections arise and prospect has future thesis needs\",\"Only for large clients\",\"During initial contact\"]', '[1]', 'Volume commitments resolve current objections while building future relationship value.', 'Strategic timing addresses price concerns while securing larger commitment and future revenue.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(347, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What\'s the psychological reasoning behind \'95% wish they had started earlier in their PhD journey\'?', '[\"Social proof\",\"Regret aversion + social proof combination to prevent future regret decision-making\",\"Peer pressure\",\"FOMO creation\"]', '[1]', 'Regret aversion is powerful for decision-making - help prospects avoid future regret.', 'Combines multiple psychological principles to motivate immediate action through future regret prevention.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(348, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'For a prospect working on \'AI Ethics in Healthcare,\' which expert background should you emphasize?', '[\"General AI expertise\",\"Healthcare experience only\",\"Cross-domain expertise: AI\\/ML + Medical Sciences + Ethics\\/Philosophy background\",\"Ethics expertise only\"]', '[2]', 'Expert matching to complex topics demonstrates deep understanding and appropriate resource allocation.', 'Interdisciplinary topics require experts with cross-domain knowledge and experience.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(349, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What advanced objection handling technique is used for \'Timeline seems too long\'?', '[\"Defend the timeline\",\"Offer faster delivery\",\"\\\"Quality vs. speed trade-off question: rushed job needing revisions or longer timeline ensuring first-submission approval?\\\"\",\"Explain the process\"]', '[2]', 'Trade-off questions help prospects understand implications and make informed decisions.', 'Reframes timeline as quality investment rather than delay, focusing on outcome rather than process.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(350, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What\'s the strategic value of mentioning \'Mock defense preparation\' in premium packages?', '[\"Additional service\",\"Addresses final stage anxiety and provides end-to-end journey support\",\"Shows completeness\",\"Increases value\"]', '[1]', 'End-to-end support reduces anxiety and justifies premium investment throughout the process.', 'Defense preparation addresses final-stage fears and demonstrates comprehensive journey support.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(351, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'In advanced competitive positioning, how should you handle \'But XYZ offers 100% approval guarantee\'?', '[\"Match the guarantee\",\"\\\"We offer unlimited revisions and 97% success rate - honest approach vs. unrealistic promises that create legal issues\\\"\",\"Criticize competitor guarantees\",\"Ignore the claim\"]', '[1]', 'Sometimes ethical positioning against competitor claims builds more trust than matching claims.', 'Positions honesty and realistic approach as superior to potentially false guarantees.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(352, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What psychological principle underlies the \'Career Progression\' urgency script?', '[\"Time pressure\",\"Opportunity cost amplification - PhD timing affects entire career trajectory\",\"Competition focus\",\"Success motivation\"]', '[1]', 'Broader impact considerations motivate larger investments than immediate concerns alone.', 'Expands impact from immediate to long-term career implications, increasing decision importance.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(353, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'For a prospect saying \'My guide will review your work,\' what positioning builds confidence?', '[\"Guarantee guide approval\",\"\\\"Our experts have worked with supervisors from [their university] and understand exactly what they expect\\\"\",\"Offer to speak with guide\",\"Provide references\"]', '[1]', 'Specific institutional experience provides powerful reassurance for supervisor approval concerns.', 'University-specific experience reduces guide approval concerns and demonstrates relevant expertise.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(354, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'In value-based selling, what\'s the most effective way to justify ₹60,000 investment to a funded research scholar?', '[\"Compare to thesis writing costs\",\"\\\"\\u20b960,000 from \\u20b98 lakh grant ensures strong foundation for entire PhD journey and future research funding\\\"\",\"Show payment plans\",\"Emphasize features\"]', '[1]', 'Percentage reframing makes investments seem smaller while emphasizing disproportionate benefits.', 'Positions investment as small portion of available funds with disproportionate impact on success.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(355, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What\'s the advanced closing psychology in \'Should I reserve that slot for you?\'', '[\"Direct ask\",\"Ownership language + urgency + easy yes response rather than complex purchase decision\",\"Pressure technique\",\"Availability check\"]', '[1]', 'Break complex decisions into smaller, easier commitments for reduced resistance.', 'Simplifies decision to reservation rather than purchase, using ownership language and scarcity.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(356, 1, 16, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'For handling \'I need to discuss with my guide/family,\' what\'s the strategic support offer?', '[\"Wait for their decision\",\"Provide discussion materials: service proposal, domain samples, university references, timeline for informed discussion\",\"Offer to speak directly\",\"Send basic information\"]', '[1]', 'Help prospects sell internally by providing compelling materials and talking points.', 'Enables advocate creation by providing tools for effective internal selling.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 1, '2025-09-01 18:17:52', 0),
(357, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: A PhD student from Anna University (Engineering) has ₹40,000 budget, 3-week deadline, and mentions \'I tried writing myself for 2 months but it\'s not working.\' Strategy?', '[\"Basic package with rush delivery\",\"Professional package (\\u20b930,000-48,000 with 1.2x multiplier) + express delivery, emphasizing time investment recovery\",\"Suggest deadline extension\",\"Premium package with discount\"]', '[1]', 'Multi-factor analysis (budget + domain + timeline + psychology) determines optimal strategy.', 'Budget fits professional range, engineering multiplier applies, express delivery addresses timeline, time investment creates urgency.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(358, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: International student from University of Toronto, Biotech PhD, mentions \'I have supervisor funding\' and needs \'CIHR compliance.\' Approach?', '[\"Basic international package\",\"Premium package with biotechnology multiplier + international compliance expertise\",\"Professional package\",\"Custom quotation\"]', '[1]', 'Funding mentions indicate budget flexibility; specific compliance needs justify premium expertise.', 'Funding availability + high complexity domain + specific compliance needs = premium positioning.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(359, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect says \'ResearchGuru offers the same for ₹18,000.\' Research shows ResearchGuru uses Master\'s degree writers. Response?', '[\"Match the \\u20b918,000 pricing\",\"\'\\u20b918,000-25,000 investment in Master\'s level writing vs. \\u20b935,000 investment in PhD expert - choose your risk level\'\",\"Offer \\u20b920,000 package\",\"Criticize competitor quality\"]', '[1]', 'Quality differentiation with risk implications often justifies premium pricing better than feature lists.', 'Risk-based positioning focuses on expertise differential and potential consequences rather than price matching.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(360, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Social Sciences student, limited budget (₹15,000), 2-month timeline, first-time synopsis. Strategy?', '[\"Refer to competitor\",\"Basic package with Social Sciences 0.9x multiplier (\\u20b910,800-22,500), emphasize beginner support\",\"Professional package with payment plan\",\"Suggest they try writing themselves\"]', '[1]', 'Domain multipliers can create opportunities in lower-complexity fields for budget-conscious clients.', 'Budget fits basic range with favorable domain multiplier; first-time status needs guidance emphasis.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(361, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect mentions \'My previous synopsis was rejected twice.\' What\'s this worth in sales value?', '[\"No additional value\",\"Demonstrates high pain and urgency - justifies premium investment for guaranteed success\",\"Shows difficult client\",\"Indicates unrealistic expectations\"]', '[1]', 'Past failures become powerful motivators for premium investment - use empathetically.', 'Previous rejections create emotional pain and increase motivation for professional support.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(362, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Corporate researcher (not student) needs \'Research paper for IEEE publication.\' How does this change your approach?', '[\"Same as student pricing\",\"Corporate pricing tier + IEEE publication expertise + faster timeline due to industry needs\",\"Refer to business services\",\"Standard research paper service\"]', '[1]', 'Corporate vs. academic client segments require different pricing and service approaches.', 'Corporate clients have different budget capacity, timeline needs, and publication requirements.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(363, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect says \'I\'m comparing 5 different services and creating a decision matrix.\' What does this indicate?', '[\"Analytical buyer - provide detailed comparisons and competitive advantages\",\"Price-focused buyer\",\"Indecisive client\",\"Academic approach\"]', '[0]', 'Analytical buyers need data and comparisons; provide detailed competitive analysis and metrics.', 'Systematic comparison approach indicates analytical decision-making style requiring comprehensive information.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(364, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: \'I have a choice between your Professional package and PremiumPhD\'s Premium package at similar pricing.\' Advanced response?', '[\"Defend PhDiZone features\",\"\'Similar investment, different approaches: our 150+ experts vs. their model. Which provides better odds for first-time approval?\'\",\"Offer additional features\",\"Request competitor details\"]', '[1]', 'Frame competitive decisions around success probability rather than feature comparisons.', 'Focuses on success probability rather than feature comparison, positioning choice as risk management decision.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(365, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: PhD student mentions \'I\'m also considering taking a gap year to focus on synopsis writing.\' Strategic implication?', '[\"No sales relevance\",\"Huge opportunity cost - gap year represents \\u20b95-10 lakh opportunity cost vs. \\u20b940,000 investment\",\"Personal decision\",\"Timeline flexibility\"]', '[1]', 'Opportunity cost amplification makes service investment seem minimal compared to alternatives.', 'Gap year consideration indicates massive opportunity cost that justifies significant service investment.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(366, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: International prospect says \'I\'m choosing between your service and hiring a local PhD graduate for $500.\' Response strategy?', '[\"Match the $500 pricing\",\"\'Individual vs. institutional: backup support, quality processes, timeline guarantees, and ongoing availability\'\",\"Highlight faster delivery\",\"Focus on expertise only\"]', '[1]', 'Institutional advantages often outweigh individual cost savings when properly positioned.', 'Emphasizes systematic advantages and risk mitigation over individual arrangements.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(367, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect has \'₹2 lakh research budget\' and mentions \'I want the absolute best support available.\' Strategy?', '[\"Premium package standard pricing\",\"Premium package + multiple add-ons (statistical analysis, conference presentation, multiple formats)\",\"Professional package to save money\",\"Custom premium solution\"]', '[1]', 'Budget abundance with quality focus creates upselling opportunities - maximize value delivery.', 'High budget + quality focus = comprehensive service opportunity with multiple value additions.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(368, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: \'My supervisor prefers Harvard citation style, but my university requires APA.\' How do you handle this conflict?', '[\"Choose one style\",\"\'We\'ll prepare dual versions: Harvard for supervisor review, APA for official submission\'\",\"Suggest they resolve the conflict\",\"Use hybrid approach\"]', '[1]', 'Solving client dilemmas creates additional value and demonstrates problem-solving expertise.', 'Solution-oriented approach resolves client dilemma while demonstrating flexibility and service value.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(369, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect mentions \'I need this for fellowship application - it\'s my last chance.\' Psychological implication?', '[\"High pressure situation\",\"Maximum pain and urgency - last opportunity creates highest investment motivation\",\"Difficult timeline\",\"Important application\"]', '[1]', 'Final opportunity situations justify premium investment and expedited service.', '\'Last chance\' scenarios create maximum psychological pressure and investment justification.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(370, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: \'My research involves sensitive medical data - are there confidentiality protections?\' Advanced response?', '[\"Standard NDA mention\",\"\'Medical research requires specialized handling: dedicated experts with medical background + enhanced NDA + secure data protocols\'\",\"Basic confidentiality assurance\",\"Refer to legal team\"]', '[1]', 'Industry-specific compliance needs create opportunities for premium positioning and specialized services.', 'Specific industry requirements demonstrate understanding and justify specialized pricing.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(371, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect asks \'What if the expert assigned doesn\'t understand my specific research area?\' Trust-building response?', '[\"Guarantee perfect match\",\"\'Domain-specific assignment process: expert credentials review + past work samples + backup expert availability\'\",\"Promise to change experts\",\"General assurance\"]', '[1]', 'Process explanations build more confidence than simple promises.', 'Process-based assurance with backup planning addresses concerns systematically.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(372, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: \'I\'m concerned about plagiarism because my university uses advanced detection.\' Advanced positioning?', '[\"Standard plagiarism check mention\",\"\'Advanced detection requires advanced prevention: 350+ library access + original research development + multi-stage verification\'\",\"Promise low similarity\",\"Show previous reports\"]', '[1]', 'Match solution sophistication to concern complexity for credibility.', 'Matches concern level with solution sophistication and demonstrates understanding of advanced requirements.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(373, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect mentions \'I have industry experience but struggle with academic writing style.\' What does this indicate?', '[\"Writing skill deficit\",\"Professional background + academic transition = needs academic tone guidance and structural support\",\"Basic writing help needed\",\"Language issues\"]', '[1]', 'Professional backgrounds often indicate higher budgets but specific academic writing needs.', 'Industry professionals need specific help transitioning to academic writing conventions and scholarly tone.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(374, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: \'I need help with both synopsis and research methodology development.\' Service strategy?', '[\"Synopsis service only\",\"Professional synopsis + Statistical Analysis Integration + methodology consultation\",\"Basic synopsis\",\"Custom research service\"]', '[1]', 'Methodology needs often indicate complex research requiring multiple service components.', 'Methodology development indicates empirical research requiring comprehensive statistical and methodological support.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(375, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: International prospect mentions \'I\'m an Indian student studying abroad.\' Cultural positioning advantage?', '[\"No specific advantage\",\"\'Cultural bridge: understanding of both Indian research background and international academic standards\'\",\"Focus on international pricing\",\"Emphasize global experience\"]', '[1]', 'Cultural understanding can be a significant differentiator for diaspora students.', 'Cultural bridge positioning provides unique value for Indian students in international programs.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(376, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect asks \'What happens if I\'m not satisfied with the synopsis quality?\' Risk reversal strategy?', '[\"Promise satisfaction\",\"\'Unlimited revisions within scope + 7-day money-back policy + replacement expert option if needed\'\",\"Show previous work\",\"Explain quality process\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive risk reversal removes purchase barriers and demonstrates quality confidence.', 'Multi-layered risk reversal provides multiple safety nets and demonstrates confidence.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(377, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect mentions \'I need this for multiple university applications.\' Opportunity identification?', '[\"Standard synopsis service\",\"Multiple format versions + university-specific compliance + application strategy consultation\",\"Basic package\",\"Discount for multiple applications\"]', '[1]', 'Identify scope expansion opportunities from casual mentions of additional needs.', 'Multiple applications create opportunities for additional services and comprehensive support.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(378, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: \'My previous service provider disappeared after taking payment.\' Trust-building approach?', '[\"Promise reliability\",\"\'Institutional backing (Elysium Groups) + established operations (2005) + formal agreements prevent such issues\'\",\"Show company credentials\",\"Offer guarantees\"]', '[1]', 'Past bad experiences create trust obstacles requiring systematic credibility building.', 'Addresses reliability concerns with specific institutional and operational evidence.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(379, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect asks \'Can you complete synopsis in 5 days for my Monday submission?\' Advanced negotiation?', '[\"Say impossible\",\"\'Express delivery possible with 40% premium + immediate expert assignment + parallel section development\'\",\"Suggest deadline extension\",\"Offer standard timeline\"]', '[1]', 'Emergency situations justify premium pricing when coupled with concrete delivery solutions.', 'Solution-oriented response addresses urgent needs while explaining premium requirements and delivery approach.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(380, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: PhD student mentions \'I\'m also planning to publish 2-3 papers from this research.\' Strategic response?', '[\"Focus on synopsis only\",\"\'Synopsis + Publication Ready Package (15% discount) sets foundation for entire research publication strategy\'\",\"Mention journal services\",\"Standard synopsis approach\"]', '[1]', 'Future publication plans indicate higher lifetime value and bundle opportunities.', 'Identifies larger opportunity and positions bundled approach with strategic value and cost savings.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(381, 1, 17, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'Scenario: Prospect says \'I\'m worried about AI detection since my university started using AI detection tools.\' Advanced positioning?', '[\"Promise human writing\",\"\'AI detection requires human expertise + original research + authentic academic voice - exactly what PhD experts provide\'\",\"Explain writing process\",\"Show detection reports\"]', '[1]', 'Emerging concerns (like AI detection) create new value propositions for existing services.', 'Positions PhD expert model as natural solution to AI detection concerns while emphasizing authenticity.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 1, '2025-09-01 18:22:24', 0),
(382, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What strategic advantage does PhDiZone\'s \'80+ expert-developed methodologies\' provide in competitive situations?', '[\"Shows experience\",\"Reduces research risk through proven frameworks while competitors rely on individual expertise\",\"Demonstrates capability\",\"Increases credibility\"]', '[1]', 'Proven methodologies provide risk reduction value that justifies premium pricing.', 'Systematic methodology development reduces project risk and ensures repeatable success.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(383, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'In enterprise sales, when targeting \'Academic Institutions,\' what\'s the primary value proposition?', '[\"Cost savings\",\"Scalable expertise for multiple projects + institutional partnerships + volume discounting\",\"Standard services\",\"Research support\"]', '[1]', 'Institutional sales require different value propositions focused on scale and partnership rather than individual support.', 'Institutional clients need scalability, partnership approach, and volume economics.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(384, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What\'s the strategic reasoning behind PhDiZone\'s \'200% tested implementation strategies\'?', '[\"Quality assurance\",\"Over-verification provides competitive advantage in risk-averse academic environment\",\"Marketing claim\",\"Process improvement\"]', '[1]', 'Risk-averse markets value over-verification and redundant quality processes.', 'Academic environment\'s low risk tolerance makes over-verification a compelling competitive advantage.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(385, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'For the target conversion rate of \'70% call-to-proposal,\' what does below-target performance indicate?', '[\"Bad prospects\",\"Needs assessment insufficiency or inappropriate prospect qualification\",\"Pricing issues\",\"Market problems\"]', '[1]', 'Conversion rate problems usually indicate process issues rather than market or pricing problems.', 'Low conversion typically indicates inadequate discovery or poor prospect fit rather than external factors.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(386, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What\'s the strategic value of PhDiZone\'s \'23+ institutional partnerships\'?', '[\"Marketing credibility\",\"Provides academic validation and reduces university resistance to external support\",\"Business development\",\"Network building\"]', '[1]', 'Academic partnerships overcome institutional bias against commercial research support.', 'Institutional partnerships provide third-party academic validation and reduce resistance.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(387, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'In advanced competitive analysis, what\'s PhDiZone\'s sustainable competitive advantage?', '[\"Pricing\",\"Scale of operations (150+ experts + institutional infrastructure + proven methodologies)\",\"Marketing\",\"Customer service\"]', '[1]', 'Sustainable advantages (scale, infrastructure) are harder for competitors to replicate than tactical advantages (pricing, features).', 'Scale advantages create barriers to entry and sustainable differentiation.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(388, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'For \'Journal Publication Support,\' what advanced positioning addresses impact factor concerns?', '[\"Guarantee publication\",\"\'Q1-Q4 Scopus guidance + journal selection strategy + submission optimization for maximum impact factor achievement\'\",\"Promise specific journals\",\"Focus on acceptance rates\"]', '[1]', 'Impact factor strategy provides long-term career value beyond just publication acceptance.', 'Strategic approach to impact factor maximization rather than guarantees provides realistic value.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(389, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What\'s the advanced psychology behind mentioning \'135+ conference involvements\'?', '[\"Shows activity\",\"Demonstrates thought leadership and cutting-edge knowledge access for current research trends\",\"Proves expertise\",\"Marketing benefit\"]', '[1]', 'Thought leadership positioning appeals to scholars wanting cutting-edge approaches.', 'Conference participation indicates access to latest research trends and academic thought leadership.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(390, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'For prospects mentioning \'AI/ML research in Healthcare,\' what cross-domain expertise should you emphasize?', '[\"Just AI expertise\",\"AI\\/ML + Medical Sciences + Healthcare compliance + publication strategy in both domains\",\"Healthcare focus only\",\"Technical implementation\"]', '[1]', 'Cross-domain expertise demonstrates depth and reduces project risk for interdisciplinary research.', 'Interdisciplinary research requires experts with knowledge across multiple domains and publication strategies.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(391, 1, 19, 4, 0, NULL, 0, 'What\'s the strategic advantage of PhDiZone\'s \'Customized project methodology for each assignment\'?', '[\"Shows flexibility\",\"Reduces one-size-fits-all risk and enables premium positioning through personalization\",\"Demonstrates capability\",\"Improves quality\"]', '[1]', 'Customization allows for premium positioning and differentiation from standardized services.', 'Customization provides competitive differentiation and justifies premium pricing through personalized value.', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 1, '2025-09-01 18:34:15', 0),
(392, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the official position title for this role at PhDiZone?', '[\"Sales Support Executive\",\"Closing Sales Support Executive\",\"Sales Closing Manager\",\"Post Sales Executive\"]', '[1]', 'The word \'Closing\' in the title is key - it indicates the role\'s primary focus on finalizing sales transactions.', 'The document clearly states the position is \'Closing Sales Support Executive\' in the Position field. This title emphasizes the role\'s focus on closing sales and providing support during the final stages of the sales process.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(393, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which division does the Closing Sales Support Executive belong to?', '[\"Pre Sales\",\"Post Sales\",\"Customer Service\",\"Business Development\"]', '[1]', 'Post Sales division handles everything after a sale is initiated - documentation, payments, and finalization.', 'According to the document, the Division is specified as \'Post Sales\', indicating this role operates after initial sales activities have occurred, focusing on transaction completion and client onboarding.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(394, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the reporting authority for this position?', '[\"Sales Director\",\"Operations Manager\",\"Sales Team Lead \\/ Sales Manager\",\"Department Head\"]', '[2]', 'Remember the dual reporting possibility - either Team Lead OR Sales Manager depending on organizational structure.', 'The document explicitly states under \'Reporting Authority\' that this position reports to \'Sales Team Lead / Sales Manager\', establishing a clear hierarchical structure within the sales department.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(395, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What level is this position classified as?', '[\"Level 1\",\"Level 2\",\"Level 3\",\"Senior Level\"]', '[1]', 'Level 2 typically indicates you\'re not entry-level but not yet senior management - an intermediate professional role.', 'The job role document clearly specifies this is a \'Level 2\' position, which is mentioned in the context of operational efficiency requirements and indicates an intermediate professional level.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(396, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which grade is assigned to this position?', '[\"Grade III\",\"Grade IV\",\"Grade V\",\"Grade VI\"]', '[2]', 'Grade V aligns with the Level 2 classification, showing consistency in the position\'s hierarchical placement.', 'The document states \'Grade: Grade V\' in the initial job role information section, which corresponds to the position\'s level and compensation structure within the organization.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(397, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What generation classification is assigned to this role?', '[\"Gen 1\",\"Gen 2\",\"Gen 3\",\"Gen 4\"]', '[2]', 'Generation classifications often indicate how evolved or refined a role has become within an organization.', 'The document specifies \'Generation: Gen 3\', which likely represents the evolution or iteration of this role within the organization\'s structure.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(398, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus of the Closing Sales Executive role according to the Job Role Clarity?', '[\"Generating new leads for the sales team\",\"Converting qualified prospects into confirmed clients\",\"Managing customer service requests\",\"Conducting market research\"]', '[1]', 'The key word is \'converting\' - this role bridges the gap between prospect and confirmed client.', 'The Job Role Clarity section explicitly states the role focuses on \'converting qualified prospects into confirmed clients through meticulous documentation, payment coordination, and administrative excellence.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(399, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which company owns the PhDiZone entity?', '[\"PhDiZone Private Limited\",\"Elysium Technology Private Limited\",\"PhDiZone Technologies\",\"Elysium Solutions\"]', '[1]', 'PhDiZone is the entity/brand, while Elysium Technology is the legal company structure.', 'The document states \'Company: Elysium Technology Private Limited\' with \'Entity: PhDiZone\', indicating that PhDiZone operates under the Elysium Technology parent company.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(400, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What are the critical final stages of the sales process that this role manages?', '[\"Lead generation and qualification\",\"Proposal documentation, payment tracking, invoice management, and regulatory compliance\",\"Marketing campaigns and advertising\",\"Product development and testing\"]', '[1]', 'Think of these as the \'paperwork and money\' stages - everything needed to officially close a deal.', 'The document specifically identifies these four critical final stages: proposal documentation, payment tracking, invoice management, and regulatory compliance as the key areas managed by the Closing Sales Executive.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(401, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is described as the \'vital link\' that this position provides?', '[\"Between marketing and sales teams\",\"Between sales activities and successful deal closure\",\"Between clients and product development\",\"Between management and employees\"]', '[1]', 'This role is the bridge that ensures sales efforts actually result in completed, documented deals.', 'The Job Role Clarity explicitly states: \'The position acts as the vital link between sales activities and successful deal closure, managing the critical final stages of the sales process.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(402, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of excellence is emphasized as essential for this role?', '[\"Technical excellence\",\"Administrative excellence\",\"Creative excellence\",\"Strategic excellence\"]', '[1]', 'Administrative excellence means superior attention to detail in paperwork, processes, and documentation.', 'The document emphasizes \'administrative excellence\' as a key requirement for converting prospects into clients, alongside meticulous documentation and payment coordination.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(403, 1, 20, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What organizational objective does this role support according to the Job Role Clarity?', '[\"Market expansion goals\",\"Product innovation objectives\",\"PhDiZone\'s growth objectives\",\"Employee retention targets\"]', '[2]', 'Every operational role should ultimately support growth - this one does so through efficient deal closure.', 'The document states this position is \'essential for maintaining operational efficiency in the sales department while ensuring accurate financial reporting, compliance adherence, and seamless client onboarding processes that support PhDiZone\'s growth objectives.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(404, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first primary responsibility category listed in the document?', '[\"Sales Support & Deal Coordination\",\"Lead & Customer Data Management\",\"Payment Management & Collections\",\"Reporting & Documentation Excellence\"]', '[1]', 'Data management comes first because accurate data is the foundation for all other sales support activities.', 'The document lists seven primary responsibility categories, with \'Lead & Customer Data Management\' appearing as the first category, emphasizing the foundational importance of data accuracy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(405, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What accuracy standard must be maintained for lead tracking sheets?', '[\"Comprehensive updates with current status\",\"Weekly updates only\",\"Monthly summaries\",\"Quarterly reviews\"]', '[0]', 'Comprehensive and current mean the data should always reflect the latest status of every prospect.', 'Under Lead & Customer Data Management, the role requires maintaining \'comprehensive lead tracking sheets with current status updates for all prospects\', ensuring real-time accuracy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(406, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Where must accurate customer information be managed?', '[\"Spreadsheets only\",\"Email systems\",\"CRM systems and records\",\"Paper files\"]', '[2]', 'CRM (Customer Relationship Management) systems are the central hub for all customer data in modern sales operations.', 'The document specifically states the need to \'Ensure accurate customer information management in CRM systems and records\', highlighting the importance of digital customer relationship management tools.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(407, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three types of client information must be monitored and updated?', '[\"Names, addresses, and phone numbers\",\"Contact details, project requirements, and communication history\",\"Purchase history, preferences, and feedback\",\"Credit scores, payment history, and references\"]', '[1]', 'These three elements tell you WHO the client is, WHAT they need, and HOW you\'ve communicated with them.', 'The document explicitly lists these three elements: \'Monitor and update client contact details, project requirements, and communication history\' as part of data management responsibilities.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(408, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What standard must be maintained across all customer touchpoints?', '[\"Communication standards\",\"Data integrity standards\",\"Service level standards\",\"Quality assurance standards\"]', '[1]', 'Data integrity means the information is accurate, consistent, and reliable across all systems and platforms.', 'Under Lead & Customer Data Management, the role requires maintaining \'data integrity standards across all customer touchpoints and systems\', ensuring consistency and accuracy everywhere.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(409, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of documentation support must be provided for client deals?', '[\"Basic documentation\",\"Comprehensive documentation support\",\"Minimal required documentation\",\"Template-based documentation\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive means complete, detailed, and covering all necessary aspects - not just basic paperwork.', 'The Sales Support & Deal Coordination section specifies: \'Provide comprehensive documentation support for client deals and transactions\', emphasizing thoroughness.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(410, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three documents must the role assist in preparing?', '[\"Contracts, agreements, and reports\",\"Proposals, quotations, and invoices\",\"Budgets, forecasts, and analyses\",\"Presentations, brochures, and catalogs\"]', '[1]', 'These three documents represent the journey: proposal (offer), quotation (price), invoice (bill).', 'The document states: \'Assist in preparation of proposals, quotations, and invoices with accuracy and timeliness\', identifying these three critical sales documents.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(411, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which department must the role coordinate with for payment tracking?', '[\"Marketing department\",\"Accounts department\",\"IT department\",\"HR department\"]', '[1]', 'The accounts/finance department handles money matters, making them the natural partner for payment tracking.', 'Under Sales Support & Deal Coordination, the role must \'Coordinate with accounts department for payment tracking and status updates\', establishing a key cross-functional relationship.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(412, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be maintained with clients regarding payment and order status?', '[\"Monthly reports\",\"Clear communication channels\",\"Formal correspondence only\",\"Quarterly meetings\"]', '[1]', 'Clear communication channels mean clients can easily reach you and receive timely updates on their status.', 'The document requires: \'Maintain clear communication channels with clients regarding payment and order status\', emphasizing transparency and accessibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(413, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should pending payments be tracked according to the Payment Management responsibilities?', '[\"Monthly reviews only\",\"Systematically with required follow-ups\",\"On an ad-hoc basis\",\"Quarterly assessments\"]', '[1]', 'Systematically means following a consistent process, not waiting for problems to arise.', 'The Payment Management & Collections section specifies: \'Track pending payments systematically and follow up with clients as required\', indicating a structured, proactive approach.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(414, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently must payment confirmations be updated for the CRE?', '[\"Weekly\",\"Daily\",\"Monthly\",\"As needed\"]', '[1]', 'Daily updates ensure the sales team has current information for client interactions.', 'The document explicitly states: \'Update daily payment confirmations for Customer Relationship Executive (CRE)\', emphasizing the need for real-time payment tracking.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(415, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be done with overdue accounts according to payment management responsibilities?', '[\"Report them to management\",\"Monitor timelines and escalate through proper channels\",\"Send automated reminders only\",\"Wait for client contact\"]', '[1]', 'Escalation means involving higher authority when normal follow-ups don\'t work - follow proper channels, don\'t skip levels.', 'The document states: \'Monitor payment timelines and escalate overdue accounts through proper channels\', indicating a structured escalation process.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(416, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which team must be coordinated with to resolve payment discrepancies?', '[\"Sales team\",\"Finance team\",\"Legal team\",\"Customer service team\"]', '[1]', 'Finance/accounts team has the authority and expertise to handle payment problems and discrepancies.', 'Under Payment Management & Collections, the role requires: \'Coordinate with finance team to resolve payment discrepancies or issues\', establishing this critical relationship.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(417, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What two types of tracking sheets must be maintained accurately on a daily basis?', '[\"Lead and customer tracking sheets\",\"Sales and payment tracking sheets\",\"Project and delivery tracking sheets\",\"Performance and goal tracking sheets\"]', '[1]', 'These two sheets give a complete picture of business flow: what\'s being sold and what\'s being paid.', 'The Reporting & Documentation Excellence section specifies: \'Maintain accurate daily sales and payment tracking sheets\', identifying these as core daily documentation requirements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(418, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be ensured for invoices and payment records?', '[\"Digital storage only\",\"Proper filing and organization\",\"Cloud backup\",\"Monthly archiving\"]', '[1]', 'Proper filing means documents can be quickly retrieved when needed - organization is key for audits and reviews.', 'The document requires: \'Ensure proper filing and organization of invoices and payment records\', emphasizing the importance of systematic record-keeping.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(419, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be monitored for both payments and deals?', '[\"Volume and frequency\",\"Pending approvals and follow-ups\",\"Client satisfaction scores\",\"Revenue generated\"]', '[1]', 'Pending items are bottlenecks - monitoring them ensures smooth flow and timely completion.', 'Under Reporting & Documentation Excellence, the role must: \'Monitor pending approvals and follow-ups for both payments and deals\', ensuring nothing falls through the cracks.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(420, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of trails must be created for audit and management review?', '[\"Simple documentation trails\",\"Comprehensive documentation trails\",\"Digital-only documentation trails\",\"Summary documentation trails\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive trails mean every step is documented so auditors can trace the complete transaction history.', 'The document specifies: \'Create comprehensive documentation trails for audit and management review\', ensuring complete traceability of all transactions.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(421, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of records must be maintained in coordination with the accounts department?', '[\"Sales records\",\"GST records\",\"Employee records\",\"Inventory records\"]', '[1]', 'GST (Goods and Services Tax) compliance is critical for legal operations - accuracy is mandatory.', 'Under Accounts & GST Compliance Support, the role requires: \'Maintain accurate GST records in coordination with accounts department\', highlighting tax compliance responsibilities.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(422, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be reviewed and organized for regulatory compliance?', '[\"Payment receipts\",\"Invoice documentation\",\"Sales contracts\",\"Customer agreements\"]', '[1]', 'Invoice documentation must meet specific regulatory formats and requirements - review ensures compliance.', 'The document states: \'Review and organize invoice documentation for regulatory compliance\', ensuring all billing meets legal requirements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(423, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently must CRE payments be tracked and confirmed?', '[\"Daily\",\"Weekly\",\"Bi-weekly\",\"Monthly\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly tracking creates a rhythm that catches issues quickly while not being overwhelming.', 'The Accounts & GST Compliance Support section specifies: \'Track CRE payments and confirm receipt of payments weekly\', establishing a regular confirmation cycle.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(424, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of accounts reconciliation must be supported?', '[\"Annual accounts reconciliation\",\"Quarterly accounts reconciliation\",\"Monthly accounts reconciliation\",\"Weekly accounts reconciliation\"]', '[2]', 'Monthly reconciliation is standard accounting practice - it ensures books are balanced regularly.', 'The document requires: \'Support monthly accounts reconciliation and compliance reporting\', indicating this is a regular monthly responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(425, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be analyzed to identify improvement opportunities?', '[\"Sales volume patterns\",\"Payment collection patterns\",\"Customer satisfaction patterns\",\"Market trend patterns\"]', '[1]', 'Pattern analysis reveals systemic issues - it\'s about finding trends, not just solving individual problems.', 'Under Performance Analysis & Process Improvement, the role must: \'Analyze payment collection patterns and identify improvement opportunities\', using data to drive better processes.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(426, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be reviewed to suggest enhancements?', '[\"Marketing effectiveness\",\"Lead conversion support effectiveness\",\"Product quality\",\"Customer service quality\"]', '[1]', 'Lead conversion is about turning prospects into clients - reviewing effectiveness means measuring and improving this critical process.', 'The document states: \'Review lead conversion support effectiveness and suggest enhancements\', showing a focus on continuous improvement of the core sales process.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(427, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of reports must be prepared for management review?', '[\"Summary performance reports\",\"Comprehensive performance reports\",\"Executive performance reports\",\"Brief performance reports\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive reports provide full context and details, not just summaries - management needs complete information.', 'Under Performance Analysis & Process Improvement: \'Prepare comprehensive performance reports for management review\', ensuring management has complete information for decision-making.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(428, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should process optimization initiatives be based on?', '[\"Industry best practices\",\"Management directives\",\"Operational insights\",\"Customer feedback\"]', '[2]', 'Operational insights come from doing the work - front-line experience reveals what actually works and what doesn\'t.', 'The document requires: \'Contribute to process optimization initiatives based on operational insights\', emphasizing data-driven improvement from actual experience.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(429, 1, 21, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which three teams must regular coordination be facilitated between?', '[\"Sales, marketing, and IT teams\",\"Sales, accounts, and delivery teams\",\"Sales, HR, and operations teams\",\"Sales, finance, and customer service teams\"]', '[1]', 'These three teams form the complete customer journey: sales (sell), accounts (money), delivery (fulfill).', 'Under Cross-Functional Coordination, the role must: \'Facilitate regular coordination between sales, accounts, and delivery teams\', establishing key cross-functional relationships.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(430, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many Key Result Areas (KRAs) are defined for this position?', '[\"Three\",\"Four\",\"Five\",\"Six\"]', '[2]', 'The five KRAs cover the complete scope: data, sales support, payments, compliance, and efficiency.', 'The document defines five distinct KRAs: Data Management & CRM Excellence, Sales Process Support & Deal Closure, Payment Management & Collections, Compliance & Documentation, and Operational Efficiency & Process Improvement.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(431, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first KRA listed in the document?', '[\"Sales Process Support & Deal Closure\",\"Data Management & CRM Excellence\",\"Payment Management & Collections\",\"Compliance & Documentation\"]', '[1]', 'Data comes first because all other KRAs depend on having accurate, comprehensive information.', 'Data Management & CRM Excellence is listed as the first KRA, emphasizing that accurate data is the foundation for all other activities.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(432, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be ensured for lead and customer data management?', '[\"Basic accuracy\",\"Accurate, comprehensive, and timely management across organizational systems\",\"Monthly updates\",\"Quarterly reviews\"]', '[1]', 'Three qualities define excellent data management: accurate (correct), comprehensive (complete), and timely (current).', 'The Data Management & CRM Excellence KRA requires: \'Ensure accurate, comprehensive, and timely management of all lead and customer data across organizational systems.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(433, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the goal of the Sales Process Support & Deal Closure KRA?', '[\"Generate more leads\",\"Provide exceptional administrative and documentation support to facilitate smooth deal closure\",\"Increase sales volume\",\"Improve customer satisfaction\"]', '[1]', 'This KRA is about removing friction from the closing process through excellent administrative support.', 'The Sales Process Support & Deal Closure KRA states: \'Provide exceptional administrative and documentation support to facilitate smooth deal closure and client onboarding.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(434, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be optimized in the Payment Management & Collections KRA?', '[\"Payment processing speed only\",\"Payment collection processes and maintain accurate financial tracking for improved cash flow management\",\"Invoice generation efficiency\",\"Client payment terms\"]', '[1]', 'Cash flow management is critical for business health - this KRA directly impacts company liquidity.', 'The KRA description states: \'Optimize payment collection processes and maintain accurate financial tracking for improved cash flow management.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(435, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What two things must be maintained according to the Compliance & Documentation KRA?', '[\"Quality standards and customer service\",\"Rigorous compliance with regulatory requirements and comprehensive documentation standards\",\"Team morale and productivity\",\"Technology systems and processes\"]', '[1]', 'Compliance is non-negotiable (regulatory requirements) while documentation proves compliance.', 'The Compliance & Documentation KRA requires: \'Maintain rigorous compliance with regulatory requirements and ensure comprehensive documentation standards.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(436, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should continuous improvement be driven according to the Operational Efficiency KRA?', '[\"Through training programs\",\"Through analysis, reporting, and process optimization initiatives\",\"Through technology upgrades\",\"Through team expansion\"]', '[1]', 'The three-part approach: analyze (understand), report (communicate), optimize (improve) creates a cycle of continuous improvement.', 'The Operational Efficiency & Process Improvement KRA states: \'Drive continuous improvement in sales operations through analysis, reporting, and process optimization initiatives.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(437, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of compliance is emphasized in the Compliance & Documentation KRA?', '[\"Basic compliance\",\"Standard compliance\",\"Rigorous compliance\",\"Minimal compliance\"]', '[2]', 'Rigorous means thorough and strict - there\'s no room for shortcuts in regulatory compliance.', 'The KRA specifically uses the term \'rigorous compliance\', indicating a strict, thorough approach to regulatory requirements rather than minimal adherence.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(438, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What aspect of deal closure is emphasized in the Sales Process Support KRA?', '[\"Speed of closure\",\"Smooth deal closure and client onboarding\",\"Volume of deals\",\"Value of deals\"]', '[1]', 'Smooth means without friction or problems - the goal is a seamless experience for the client.', 'The KRA emphasizes providing support to facilitate \'smooth deal closure and client onboarding\', focusing on quality of the transition rather than just speed or volume.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(439, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the ultimate goal of optimizing payment collection processes?', '[\"Reducing workload\",\"Improved cash flow management\",\"Faster invoice generation\",\"Better client relationships\"]', '[1]', 'Cash flow is the lifeblood of business - collecting payments efficiently ensures the company can operate smoothly.', 'The Payment Management & Collections KRA explicitly states the goal is \'improved cash flow management\', connecting operational activities to business financial health.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(440, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of documentation standards must be ensured?', '[\"Basic documentation standards\",\"Standard documentation standards\",\"Comprehensive documentation standards\",\"Minimal documentation standards\"]', '[2]', 'Comprehensive documentation means every transaction is fully documented from start to finish.', 'The Compliance & Documentation KRA requires ensuring \'comprehensive documentation standards\', indicating thorough and complete documentation practices.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(441, 1, 22, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the scope of data management in the first KRA?', '[\"Individual systems only\",\"CRM system only\",\"Across organizational systems\",\"Sales department only\"]', '[2]', 'Organizational systems means all platforms where data exists - CRM, spreadsheets, accounting software, etc.', 'The Data Management & CRM Excellence KRA specifies management \'across organizational systems\', indicating data integrity must be maintained everywhere, not just in one place.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(442, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the target accuracy rate for CRM and lead sheet updates?', '[\"95%\",\"97%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', '99% allows for minimal human error but still demands near-perfection in data entry and maintenance.', 'Under Data Management & CRM Excellence KRAs, the Data Accuracy Rate KPI requires: \'Maintain 99% accuracy in CRM and lead sheet updates\', setting a very high standard for data quality.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(443, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Within what timeframe must all data entries be completed after transaction occurrence?', '[\"2 hours\",\"4 hours\",\"8 hours\",\"24 hours\"]', '[1]', 'Four hours is less than half a business day - this ensures data is current enough for same-day decisions.', 'The Data Update Timeliness KPI states: \'Complete all data entries within 4 hours of transaction occurrence\', ensuring near real-time data accuracy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(444, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the target synchronization rate between lead sheets, CRM, and payment systems?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\",\"99%\"]', '[2]', '100% synchronization means no discrepancies between systems - what\'s in one place must match everywhere else.', 'The System Integration KPI requires: \'Achieve 100% synchronization between lead sheets, CRM, and payment systems\', demanding perfect integration.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(445, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the turnaround time target for processing proposals and quotations?', '[\"12 hours of request\",\"24 hours of request\",\"48 hours of request\",\"72 hours of request\"]', '[1]', '24-hour turnaround means same-day or next-day response, keeping sales momentum moving.', 'The Documentation Turnaround KPI states: \'Process all proposals and quotations within 24 hours of request\', setting a one-business-day standard.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(446, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of deals should reach closure without documentation delays?', '[\"\\u2265 85%\",\"\\u2265 90%\",\"\\u2265 95%\",\"100%\"]', '[1]', '90% allows for some complex deals that may legitimately take longer, but the vast majority should be smooth.', 'The Deal Closure Support KPI requires: \'Contribute to ≥ 90% of deals reaching closure without documentation delays\', setting a high but achievable target.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(447, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum rating target for client communication quality?', '[\"\\u2265 4.0\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.2\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.8\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', '4.5 out of 5 means excellent (not just good) communication - clients should feel well-informed and supported.', 'The Client Communication Quality KPI requires: \'Maintain ≥ 4.5/5.0 rating for communication clarity and responsiveness\', setting a high standard for client interactions.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(448, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the target on-time payment collection rate?', '[\"\\u2265 88%\",\"\\u2265 90%\",\"\\u2265 92%\",\"\\u2265 95%\"]', '[2]', '92% means the vast majority of payments arrive on time, though some delays are accepted as inevitable.', 'The Payment Collection Efficiency KPI states: \'Achieve ≥ 92% on-time payment collection rate for assigned accounts\', balancing ambition with realism.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(449, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What accuracy rate is required for payment status updates and confirmations?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[3]', 'Payment accuracy cannot tolerate errors - wrong payment information causes serious financial and relationship problems.', 'The Payment Tracking Accuracy KPI requires: \'Maintain 100% accuracy in payment status updates and confirmations\', as payment information must be completely reliable.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(450, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'By what percentage should the average payment outstanding period be reduced annually?', '[\"10%\",\"12%\",\"15%\",\"20%\"]', '[2]', '15% annual reduction is substantial - it shows commitment to steadily improving cash flow year over year.', 'The Outstanding Payment Reduction KPI states: \'Reduce average payment outstanding period by 15% annually\', setting a significant continuous improvement target.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(451, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What accuracy rate is required for GST record keeping and documentation?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[3]', 'GST compliance is legal/regulatory - 100% is mandatory because errors can result in penalties or legal issues.', 'The GST Compliance Rate KPI requires: \'Maintain 100% accuracy in GST record keeping and documentation\', as tax compliance allows no room for error.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(452, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the target audit compliance rate for managed documentation?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\",\"99%\"]', '[2]', '100% audit compliance means every document is properly maintained and can stand up to audit examination.', 'The Audit Readiness KPI states: \'Achieve 100% audit compliance for all managed documentation\', ensuring documentation can withstand scrutiny.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(453, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'When must compliance-related documentation be completed?', '[\"Within suggested deadlines\",\"Within flexible deadlines\",\"Within regulatory deadlines\",\"Within internal deadlines\"]', '[2]', 'Regulatory deadlines are legally binding - missing them can result in penalties, fines, or legal consequences.', 'The Regulatory Updates KPI requires: \'Complete all compliance-related documentation within regulatory deadlines\', emphasizing legal requirements over convenience.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(454, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many operational improvement suggestions should be submitted monthly?', '[\"Minimum 2\",\"Minimum 3\",\"Minimum 4\",\"Minimum 5\"]', '[1]', 'Three per month means finding at least one improvement idea per week - encourages active observation and thinking.', 'The Process Improvement Contributions KPI states: \'Submit minimum 3 operational improvement suggestions monthly\', encouraging continuous innovation.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(455, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What accuracy standard is required for comprehensive and actionable reports?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[3]', 'Reports drive decisions - any inaccuracy could lead to wrong decisions, so 100% accuracy is essential.', 'The Report Quality KPI requires: \'Deliver comprehensive and actionable reports with 100% accuracy\', as management decisions depend on accurate information.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(456, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum satisfaction rating required from internal stakeholders?', '[\"\\u2265 4.0\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.2\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.8\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', 'Internal stakeholder satisfaction is as important as external client satisfaction for operational success.', 'The Cross-functional Collaboration KPI states: \'Achieve ≥ 4.5/5.0 satisfaction rating from internal stakeholders\', showing the importance of team relationships.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(457, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many KPI categories are defined under Data Management & CRM Excellence?', '[\"Two\",\"Three\",\"Four\",\"Five\"]', '[1]', 'The three KPIs cover accuracy (quality), timeliness (speed), and integration (consistency).', 'The Data Management & CRM Excellence section includes three KPIs: Data Accuracy Rate, Data Update Timeliness, and System Integration.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(458, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many KPI categories are defined under Sales Process Support & Deal Closure?', '[\"Two\",\"Three\",\"Four\",\"Five\"]', '[1]', 'These three KPIs measure speed (turnaround), effectiveness (closure rate), and quality (communication).', 'The Sales Process Support & Deal Closure section includes three KPIs: Documentation Turnaround, Deal Closure Support, and Client Communication Quality.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(459, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many KPI categories are defined under Payment Management & Collections?', '[\"Two\",\"Three\",\"Four\",\"Five\"]', '[1]', 'These three KPIs cover collection (effectiveness), tracking (accuracy), and improvement (reduction).', 'The Payment Management & Collections section includes three KPIs: Payment Collection Efficiency, Payment Tracking Accuracy, and Outstanding Payment Reduction.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(460, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many KPI categories are defined under Compliance & Documentation?', '[\"Two\",\"Three\",\"Four\",\"Five\"]', '[1]', 'These three KPIs cover tax compliance, audit readiness, and regulatory timeliness.', 'The Compliance & Documentation section includes three KPIs: GST Compliance Rate, Audit Readiness, and Regulatory Updates.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(461, 1, 23, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many KPI categories are defined under Operational Efficiency & Process Improvement?', '[\"Two\",\"Three\",\"Four\",\"Five\"]', '[1]', 'These three KPIs measure innovation (contributions), accuracy (reports), and teamwork (collaboration).', 'The Operational Efficiency & Process Improvement section includes three KPIs: Process Improvement Contributions, Report Quality, and Cross-functional Collaboration.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(462, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus of the Performance Measurement Framework?', '[\"Sales volume and revenue\",\"Operational excellence, accuracy, and efficiency in sales support functions\",\"Customer satisfaction scores\",\"Market share growth\"]', '[1]', 'This role is measured on how well support functions work, not on direct sales results.', 'The Performance Measurement Framework section states: \'Performance assessment focuses on operational excellence, accuracy, and efficiency in sales support functions.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(463, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently does the Closing Sales Executive undergo daily performance tracking?', '[\"Hourly\",\"Daily\",\"Weekly\",\"Monthly\"]', '[1]', 'Daily tracking provides real-time feedback, while formal evaluations happen weekly for detailed discussion.', 'The document states: \'The Closing Sales Executive undergoes daily performance tracking with formal evaluations conducted weekly and comprehensive reviews monthly.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(464, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently are formal performance evaluations conducted?', '[\"Daily\",\"Weekly\",\"Bi-weekly\",\"Monthly\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly evaluations create a rhythm of accountability and provide regular opportunities for course correction.', 'According to the Performance Measurement Framework, \'formal evaluations conducted weekly\' provide regular structured feedback on performance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(465, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently are comprehensive performance reviews conducted?', '[\"Weekly\",\"Bi-weekly\",\"Monthly\",\"Quarterly\"]', '[2]', 'Monthly comprehensive reviews look at bigger patterns and trends that might not be visible in weekly evaluations.', 'The framework specifies \'comprehensive reviews monthly\', providing detailed analysis of overall performance trends.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(466, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Who does the Closing Sales Executive directly report to?', '[\"Sales Director\",\"Operations Manager\",\"Sales Team Lead \\/ Sales Manager\",\"Department Head\"]', '[2]', 'This dual possibility (Team Lead OR Sales Manager) provides flexibility in organizational structure.', 'Under Reporting Hierarchy, \'Direct Report To: Sales Team Lead / Sales Manager\' establishes the immediate supervisor.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(467, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which three groups have matrix relationships with this position?', '[\"Marketing, IT, and HR\",\"Accounts Team, Finance Department, and Customer Relationship Executives\",\"Operations, Delivery, and Support\",\"Legal, Compliance, and Audit\"]', '[1]', 'Matrix relationships are working partnerships without direct reporting - you collaborate without hierarchical authority.', 'The Reporting Hierarchy states: \'Matrix Relationships: Strong coordination with Accounts Team, Finance Department, and Customer Relationship Executives.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(468, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the support function of this position in relation to the sales team?', '[\"Direct supervision of sales team\",\"Marketing support to sales team\",\"Provides operational support to entire sales team while maintaining independent accountability\",\"Strategic planning for sales team\"]', '[2]', 'Independent accountability means you support the team but are personally responsible for your own results.', 'The document states: \'Support Function: Provides operational support to entire sales team while maintaining independent accountability.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(469, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three items must be included in daily reports?', '[\"Sales volume, revenue, and targets\",\"Lead updates, payment confirmations, and documentation completion status\",\"Client meetings, calls made, and emails sent\",\"Tasks completed, pending, and planned\"]', '[1]', 'These three items give a complete picture of daily progress: leads (pipeline), payments (cash flow), documentation (compliance).', 'Under Reporting Requirements, \'Daily Reports: Lead updates, payment confirmations, and documentation completion status\' defines the daily reporting scope.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(470, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three items must be included in weekly reports?', '[\"Revenue, expenses, and profit margins\",\"Goal achievement tracking, team coordination summaries, and compliance status\",\"Client feedback, satisfaction scores, and retention rates\",\"Market analysis, competitor updates, and trends\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reports zoom out to show goal progress, cross-team collaboration effectiveness, and compliance standing.', 'The Reporting Requirements specify: \'Weekly Reports: Goal achievement tracking, team coordination summaries, and compliance status.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(471, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three items must be included in monthly reports?', '[\"Budget vs. actual, forecasts, and projections\",\"Comprehensive operational analysis, payment collection performance, and process improvement recommendations\",\"Training completed, skills developed, and certifications earned\",\"Client acquisition, retention, and satisfaction metrics\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly reports are strategic - analyzing what happened, how collections performed, and how to improve going forward.', 'Monthly Reports must include: \'Comprehensive operational analysis, payment collection performance, and process improvement recommendations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(472, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the purpose of daily quality checks in the Quality Assurance Framework?', '[\"Team performance evaluation\",\"Self-audit of data entries and documentation accuracy\",\"Client satisfaction monitoring\",\"System performance testing\"]', '[1]', 'Self-audit means taking personal responsibility for quality before others find errors.', 'The Quality Assurance Framework specifies: \'Daily Quality Checks: Self-audit of data entries and documentation accuracy.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(473, 1, 24, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the purpose of weekly team reviews?', '[\"Performance evaluations\",\"Coordination meetings to ensure alignment and address challenges\",\"Sales planning sessions\",\"Training workshops\"]', '[1]', 'These meetings ensure everyone is on the same page and problems get solved quickly through collaboration.', 'Under Quality Assurance Framework: \'Weekly Team Reviews: Coordination meetings to ensure alignment and address challenges.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(474, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the immediate focus period for a new Closing Sales Executive?', '[\"0-3 months\",\"0-6 months\",\"0-9 months\",\"0-12 months\"]', '[1]', 'The first six months are about building a strong foundation in systems, processes, and relationships.', 'The Job Vision section identifies \'Immediate Focus (0-6 months)\' as the first phase, during which operational excellence is established.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(475, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be mastered during the immediate focus period (0-6 months)?', '[\"Sales techniques and client acquisition\",\"CRM systems, payment tracking processes, and regulatory compliance requirements\",\"Management and leadership skills\",\"Strategic planning and analysis\"]', '[1]', 'These three areas form the technical foundation: systems (CRM), processes (payment), and rules (compliance).', 'The Immediate Focus section states the executive will establish operational excellence \'mastering CRM systems, payment tracking processes, and regulatory compliance requirements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(476, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be established during the immediate focus period besides technical skills?', '[\"Client relationships\",\"Market knowledge\",\"Strong working relationships with cross-functional teams\",\"Industry expertise\"]', '[2]', 'Technical skills alone aren\'t enough - building relationships with other teams is crucial for operational success.', 'The document mentions establishing \'strong working relationships with cross-functional teams\' as a key component of the immediate focus period.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(477, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the timeframe for medium-term development?', '[\"3-12 months\",\"6-18 months\",\"6-24 months\",\"12-24 months\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term development bridges the gap between operational competence and senior specialist status.', 'The document defines \'Medium-term Development (6-18 months)\' as the second career phase for this role.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(478, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of specialist should the executive grow into during medium-term development?', '[\"Sales specialist\",\"Senior sales operations specialist\",\"Client relationship specialist\",\"Business development specialist\"]', '[1]', 'Senior operations specialist means deep expertise in how sales operations work, not just executing tasks.', 'The Medium-term Development section states: \'Growth into a senior sales operations specialist with deep knowledge of business processes, compliance requirements, and operational optimization.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(479, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What new responsibilities will the role expand to include during medium-term development?', '[\"Direct sales and client acquisition\",\"Training responsibilities for new team members, process improvement leadership, and advanced analytical contributions\",\"Budget management and financial planning\",\"Marketing campaign development\"]', '[1]', 'These three expanded roles show progression from doer (executing) to leader (training, improving, advising).', 'The document states the role will expand to include \'training responsibilities for new team members, process improvement leadership, and advanced analytical contributions to strategic decision-making.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(480, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the timeframe for long-term career trajectory?', '[\"12+ months\",\"18+ months\",\"24+ months\",\"36+ months\"]', '[1]', 'After 18 months, the focus shifts from development to advancement into new roles.', 'The document defines \'Long-term Career Trajectory (18+ months)\' as the third and final career development phase.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(481, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which three advancement opportunities are mentioned for long-term career trajectory?', '[\"Sales Manager, Director, or VP\",\"Sales Operations Manager, Business Process Analyst, or Customer Success Operations Lead\",\"Account Manager, Regional Manager, or Strategic Accounts\",\"Product Manager, Marketing Manager, or Operations Director\"]', '[1]', 'These three paths represent different specializations: operations management, process analysis, or customer success.', 'The Long-term Career Trajectory section states: \'Advancement opportunities include Sales Operations Manager, Business Process Analyst, or Customer Success Operations Lead.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(482, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of foundation does this position provide for future careers?', '[\"Sales and marketing foundation\",\"Excellent foundation for careers in operations management, business analysis, or specialized roles in sales technology and process optimization\",\"Technical and IT foundation\",\"Finance and accounting foundation\"]', '[1]', 'This role builds transferable skills in operations, analysis, and technology that open diverse career paths.', 'The document states: \'The position provides excellent foundation for careers in operations management, business analysis, or specialized roles in sales technology and process optimization.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(483, 1, 25, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the position directly contribute to according to Organizational Impact?', '[\"Revenue growth and market expansion\",\"Client satisfaction, regulatory compliance, and sustainable business operations\",\"Product development and innovation\",\"Brand awareness and market positioning\"]', '[1]', 'These three contributions show the role\'s value: happy clients, legal compliance, and operational sustainability.', 'The Organizational Impact section states: \'The role directly contributes to client satisfaction, regulatory compliance, and sustainable business operations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(484, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What time slot is dedicated to system checks and priority task review?', '[\"8:00 AM - 9:00 AM\",\"9:00 AM - 9:30 AM\",\"9:30 AM - 10:00 AM\",\"10:00 AM - 10:30 AM\"]', '[1]', 'Starting the day with system checks and priority review ensures you\'re organized and focused on what matters most.', 'The Daily Activities schedule shows: \'9:00 AM - 9:30 AM: System checks and priority task review for the day\', establishing the day\'s starting routine.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(485, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are scheduled from 9:30 AM to 11:00 AM?', '[\"Client meetings and calls\",\"Lead sheet updates and CRM data management activities\",\"Payment tracking and follow-ups\",\"Documentation support\"]', '[1]', 'Morning hours are dedicated to data management when the mind is fresh and focused.', 'The schedule specifies: \'9:30 AM - 11:00 AM: Lead sheet updates and CRM data management activities\' as the morning\'s primary focus.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(486, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus from 11:00 AM to 12:00 PM?', '[\"Team meetings\",\"Payment tracking and follow-up coordination with clients\",\"Report preparation\",\"Training activities\"]', '[1]', 'Late morning is good for client calls - they\'re settled into their day and more receptive.', 'The daily schedule shows: \'11:00 AM - 12:00 PM: Payment tracking and follow-up coordination with clients\', allocating time for collections.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(487, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What time slot is reserved for documentation support for the sales team?', '[\"11:00 AM - 12:00 PM\",\"1:00 PM - 2:30 PM\",\"2:30 PM - 4:00 PM\",\"4:00 PM - 5:00 PM\"]', '[1]', 'Post-lunch hours are dedicated to supporting the sales team with their documentation needs.', 'The schedule allocates: \'1:00 PM - 2:30 PM: Documentation support for sales team including proposals and quotations\', providing afternoon support.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(488, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'When is accounts coordination and GST record maintenance scheduled?', '[\"1:00 PM - 2:30 PM\",\"2:30 PM - 4:00 PM\",\"4:00 PM - 5:00 PM\",\"5:00 PM - 5:30 PM\"]', '[1]', 'This timing allows coordination with accounts team during their active hours.', 'The daily activities show: \'2:30 PM - 4:00 PM: Accounts coordination and GST record maintenance\', allocating afternoon time for compliance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(489, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are scheduled from 4:00 PM to 5:00 PM?', '[\"Client follow-ups\",\"Team meetings\",\"Daily reporting, filing, and system updates\",\"Training and development\"]', '[2]', 'End-of-day is ideal for reporting and filing - you have complete information about the day\'s activities.', 'The schedule specifies: \'4:00 PM - 5:00 PM: Daily reporting, filing, and system updates\', wrapping up the day\'s documentation.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(490, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the purpose of the 5:00 PM - 5:30 PM time slot?', '[\"Team debriefing\",\"Client calls\",\"Next-day planning and task prioritization\",\"System shutdown\"]', '[2]', 'Planning tomorrow today means you start the next day ready to execute, not figuring out what to do.', 'The daily schedule ends with: \'5:00 PM - 5:30 PM: Next-day planning and task prioritization\', ensuring preparation for tomorrow.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(491, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the weekly focus for Monday according to Weekly Focus Areas?', '[\"Payment follow-ups\",\"Weekly planning session and goal setting with sales team\",\"Compliance activities\",\"Report preparation\"]', '[1]', 'Starting the week with planning and goal setting ensures everyone is aligned on weekly priorities.', 'Weekly Focus Areas shows: \'Monday: Weekly planning session and goal setting with sales team\', setting the week\'s direction.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(492, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are prioritized on Tuesday-Wednesday?', '[\"Meetings and coordination\",\"Intensive payment follow-ups and documentation processing\",\"Training and development\",\"Strategic planning\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-week is peak productivity time for intensive follow-ups when clients are most responsive.', 'The document specifies: \'Tuesday-Wednesday: Intensive payment follow-ups and documentation processing\', focusing mid-week on collections and paperwork.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(493, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is Thursday dedicated to according to Weekly Focus Areas?', '[\"Client meetings\",\"Cross-departmental coordination and compliance review activities\",\"Report writing\",\"Training sessions\"]', '[1]', 'Thursday coordination ensures all departments are aligned before the week ends.', 'The schedule shows: \'Thursday: Cross-departmental coordination and compliance review activities\', focusing on teamwork and compliance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(494, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are scheduled for Friday?', '[\"Client visits and presentations\",\"Team building activities\",\"Administrative tasks, weekly reporting, and process improvement activities\",\"Training and skill development\"]', '[2]', 'Friday is for reflection and improvement - completing weekly reports and identifying ways to work better.', 'Weekly Focus Areas indicates: \'Friday: Administrative tasks, weekly reporting, and process improvement activities\', closing out the week.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(495, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of support is provided throughout the week according to Weekly Focus Areas?', '[\"Technical support\",\"Continuous support for urgent sales documentation and payment issues\",\"Customer service support\",\"IT support\"]', '[1]', 'While there\'s a daily structure, urgent issues take priority any day - flexibility is key.', 'The document states: \'Throughout Week: Continuous support for urgent sales documentation and payment issues\', indicating always-available support.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(496, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of Week 1 in the Monthly Cycles?', '[\"Payment collections\",\"Monthly planning and goal setting with comprehensive system reviews\",\"Compliance audits\",\"Performance analysis\"]', '[1]', 'The first week sets the monthly direction and ensures systems are functioning properly.', 'Monthly Cycles shows: \'Week 1: Monthly planning and goal setting with comprehensive system reviews\', starting each month with strategy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(497, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What are the primary activities during Week 2 of the monthly cycle?', '[\"Training and development\",\"Intensive payment collection campaigns and lead conversion support\",\"Client relationship building\",\"Strategic planning\"]', '[1]', 'Week 2 is action-focused - driving collections and supporting conversions when monthly momentum is building.', 'The document specifies: \'Week 2: Intensive payment collection campaigns and lead conversion support\', focusing on core operational activities.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(498, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of Week 3 in the monthly cycle?', '[\"Sales planning\",\"Compliance activities, GST reconciliation, and documentation audits\",\"Client meetings\",\"Team building\"]', '[1]', 'Week 3 ensures all compliance is current before month-end reporting begins.', 'Monthly Cycles indicates: \'Week 3: Compliance activities, GST reconciliation, and documentation audits\', focusing on regulatory requirements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(499, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur during Week 4 of the monthly cycle?', '[\"Client acquisition activities\",\"Performance analysis, reporting preparation, and process optimization planning\",\"Product training\",\"Market research\"]', '[1]', 'Week 4 is reflective - analyzing what worked, preparing reports, and planning improvements for next month.', 'The document shows: \'Week 4: Performance analysis, reporting preparation, and process optimization planning\', closing out the month analytically.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(500, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What critical activities occur at month-end?', '[\"Strategic planning meetings\",\"Intensive payment collection and financial reconciliation activities\",\"Team performance reviews\",\"Training sessions\"]', '[1]', 'Month-end is critical for closing books and collecting payments before the new month begins.', 'Critical Performance Periods identifies: \'Month-End: Intensive payment collection and financial reconciliation activities\' as a crucial period.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(501, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be completed at quarter-end?', '[\"Strategic planning\",\"Comprehensive compliance reporting and audit preparation\",\"Team restructuring\",\"Budget planning\"]', '[1]', 'Quarter-end reporting is typically more detailed than monthly, often requiring audit-level preparation.', 'The document states: \'Quarter-End: Comprehensive compliance reporting and audit preparation\', highlighting quarterly compliance requirements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(502, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'When is increased documentation support required according to Critical Performance Periods?', '[\"Month-end periods\",\"Quarter-end periods\",\"Academic Calendar Peaks (high-volume periods)\",\"Year-end periods\"]', '[2]', 'Academic peaks (like semester starts or application deadlines) drive higher service demand requiring extra support.', 'Critical Performance Periods notes: \'Academic Calendar Peaks: Increased documentation support during high-volume periods\', aligning with PhDiZone\'s business cycle.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(503, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus during audit seasons?', '[\"Sales growth\",\"Enhanced focus on documentation accuracy and regulatory compliance\",\"Team training\",\"Process redesign\"]', '[1]', 'Audit seasons require extra diligence because external auditors will review documentation thoroughly.', 'The document specifies: \'Audit Seasons: Enhanced focus on documentation accuracy and regulatory compliance\', preparing for external scrutiny.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(504, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is continuously monitored in Success Metrics Tracking?', '[\"Customer satisfaction scores\",\"Lead sheets and payment tracking systems\",\"Market trends\",\"Competitor activities\"]', '[1]', 'Real-time monitoring means systems are always current, not updated periodically.', 'Success Metrics Tracking indicates: \'Real-time Monitoring: Continuous updates to lead sheets and payment tracking systems\', emphasizing constant vigilance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(505, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be achieved daily according to Success Metrics Tracking?', '[\"Sales targets\",\"100% completion of assigned documentation and follow-up tasks\",\"Client meetings quota\",\"Training hours\"]', '[1]', '100% daily completion means no tasks carry over - today\'s work gets done today.', 'The document requires: \'Daily Achievement: 100% completion of assigned documentation and follow-up tasks\', setting a completion standard.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(506, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What targets must be achieved weekly?', '[\"Sales volume targets\",\"Payment collection and data management targets\",\"Client meeting targets\",\"Training completion targets\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly targets create accountability checkpoints - you know each week if you\'re on track.', 'Success Metrics Tracking specifies: \'Weekly Performance: Achievement of payment collection and data management targets\', measuring weekly effectiveness.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(507, 1, 26, 5, 0, NULL, 0, 'What level of operational performance must be met monthly?', '[\"Standard operational performance\",\"Comprehensive operational performance meeting all established KPIs\",\"Minimum operational performance\",\"Above-average operational performance\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly excellence means not just hitting some KPIs but achieving all of them comprehensively.', 'The document states: \'Monthly Excellence: Comprehensive operational performance meeting all established KPIs\', setting the monthly standard.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 1, '2025-10-08 14:44:52', 0),
(508, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary entity or brand name under which the Content Writer operates?', '[\"Elysium Technology Private Limited\",\"PhDiZone\",\"Production Department\",\"Content Writing Division\"]', '[1]', 'Remember that PhDiZone is the operational entity, even though Elysium Technology is the parent company.', 'While the company is Elysium Technology Private Limited, the entity specified in the job role document is PhDiZone, which is the brand or division under which content writing services are delivered.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(509, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which department does the Content Writer position belong to?', '[\"Research Department\",\"Academic Services Department\",\"Production Department\",\"Editorial Department\"]', '[2]', 'Think of \'Production\' as the department that produces written content and deliverables.', 'The document clearly states that the Content Writer position is within the Production Department, specifically in the Content Writing Division.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(510, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the reporting authority for this Content Writer position?', '[\"Production Manager\",\"Senior Content Writer\",\"Lead Content Writer \\/ Project Coordinator\",\"Department Head\"]', '[2]', 'The dual title indicates this supervisor handles both content quality and project management aspects.', 'The document specifies that the Content Writer reports directly to the Lead Content Writer / Project Coordinator, establishing a clear hierarchical structure.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(511, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What generation classification is assigned to this Content Writer role?', '[\"Gen 1\",\"Gen 2\",\"Gen 3\",\"Gen 4\"]', '[2]', 'Generation classifications often indicate role maturity and organizational structure evolution.', 'The job role document explicitly states the Generation as Gen 3, which likely indicates the evolution or version of the role structure within the organization.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(512, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the grade level assigned to this Content Writer position?', '[\"Grade IV\",\"Grade V\",\"Grade VI\",\"Grade III\"]', '[1]', 'Higher grade numbers typically indicate more senior positions with greater responsibilities.', 'The position is classified as Grade V, which represents the hierarchical level within the organization\'s grading system.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(513, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'At what level is the Content Writer position classified?', '[\"Level 1\",\"Level 2\",\"Level 3\",\"Level 4\"]', '[1]', 'Level 2 positions typically require proven competency and the ability to work independently with moderate supervision.', 'The document specifies this as a Level 2 position, indicating an intermediate level role with established responsibilities and some autonomy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(514, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which teams does the Content Writer have matrix relationships with?', '[\"Only Editorial Teams\",\"Editorial, Design, Research, and Technical Development Teams\",\"Only Production and Quality Teams\",\"Management and Administrative Teams\"]', '[1]', 'Matrix relationships mean cross-functional collaboration without direct reporting lines.', 'The document specifies regular collaboration with Editorial Teams, Design Teams, Research Teams, and Technical Development Teams as matrix relationships.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(515, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of content creation professional is the Content Writer described as?', '[\"General content writer\",\"Technical writer\",\"Specialized content creation professional\",\"Marketing content specialist\"]', '[2]', 'The specialization emphasizes academic research expertise rather than general content writing.', 'The job clarity section explicitly describes the Content Writer as \'a specialized content creation professional\' who develops high-quality written materials for academic research and publishing services.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(516, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus of the Content Writer\'s service delivery?', '[\"Marketing and advertising materials\",\"Academic research and publishing services\",\"Corporate communications\",\"Social media content\"]', '[1]', 'Academic focus requires rigorous standards, accuracy, and scholarly presentation.', 'The role clarity explicitly states that the Content Writer develops materials that support PhDiZone\'s academic research and publishing services.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(517, 1, 27, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is emphasized as fundamental to this Level 2, Grade V position?', '[\"Revenue generation\",\"Team management\",\"Service delivery quality and client satisfaction\",\"Market expansion\"]', '[2]', 'Quality and client satisfaction are central KPIs that define success in this role.', 'The document states this role is fundamental to PhDiZone\'s service delivery quality, directly impacting client satisfaction, academic credibility, and content quality.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(518, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first category of primary responsibilities for the Content Writer?', '[\"Quality Assurance\",\"Research & Content Development\",\"Writing & Editorial Excellence\",\"Team Development\"]', '[1]', 'Research comes first because quality content depends on thorough research foundations.', 'The document lists Research & Content Development as the first primary responsibility category, emphasizing the foundational research work required.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(519, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of content topics should the Content Writer suggest?', '[\"Trending topics only\",\"Innovative content topics\",\"Previously published topics\",\"Client-specified topics only\"]', '[1]', 'Innovation in topic selection demonstrates thought leadership and adds strategic value.', 'The responsibilities include suggesting innovative content topics through project discussions and strategic planning sessions, showing expectation for creative contribution.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(520, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of research must the Content Writer conduct for content preparation?', '[\"Basic internet research\",\"Comprehensive data collection and research\",\"Survey-based research only\",\"Secondary research only\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive research ensures academic credibility and content accuracy.', 'The document explicitly requires conducting comprehensive data collection and research for content preparation and accuracy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(521, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must the Content Writer verify to ensure academic credibility?', '[\"Writing style and grammar\",\"Content length and formatting\",\"Content sources and references\",\"Client satisfaction levels\"]', '[2]', 'Source verification prevents plagiarism and maintains academic integrity.', 'A key responsibility is to verify content sources and references to ensure academic credibility and relevance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(522, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of in-depth research is expected for specialized content?', '[\"Quick overview research\",\"Research for technical and long-form content requiring specialized knowledge\",\"Market research only\",\"Competitive analysis only\"]', '[1]', 'Technical content requires deeper subject matter expertise and domain knowledge.', 'The responsibilities include performing in-depth research specifically for technical and long-form content that requires specialized knowledge.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(523, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer prepare before creating various content types?', '[\"Final drafts immediately\",\"Client presentations\",\"Detailed outlines and structured drafts\",\"Marketing summaries\"]', '[2]', 'Outlines ensure logical flow and comprehensive coverage before full writing begins.', 'Under Writing & Editorial Excellence, the responsibilities include preparing detailed outlines and structured drafts for various content types and formats.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(524, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What content types should the Content Writer be able to write, edit, and proofread?', '[\"Only blog posts\",\"Internal documents, blogs, articles, and research materials\",\"Only research papers\",\"Marketing materials only\"]', '[1]', 'Versatility across multiple content formats is essential for this role.', 'The document specifies the ability to write, edit, and proofread content for internal documents, blogs, articles, and research materials.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(525, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'On what basis should the Content Writer perform corrections and revisions?', '[\"Personal judgment only\",\"Feedback from reviewers and stakeholders\",\"Industry standards only\",\"Client requests without review\"]', '[1]', 'Integrating feedback demonstrates collaboration and commitment to quality improvement.', 'The responsibilities include performing corrections and revisions based on feedback from reviewers and stakeholders.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(526, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer prepare for journal publishing?', '[\"Marketing materials\",\"Comprehensive summaries for journal publishing and final submission requirements\",\"Author biographies only\",\"Cover letters only\"]', '[1]', 'Journal submissions have strict formatting and content requirements that must be followed precisely.', 'A specific responsibility is to prepare comprehensive summaries that meet journal publishing and final submission requirements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(527, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of calls should the Content Writer attend for collaborative content production?', '[\"Client sales calls\",\"Technical and production calls related to content deliverables\",\"Administrative meetings only\",\"Training sessions only\"]', '[1]', 'These calls ensure alignment on technical requirements and project timelines.', 'Under Collaborative Content Production, attending technical and production calls related to content deliverables and project coordination is specified.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(528, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'With whom should the Content Writer coordinate for integrated content solutions?', '[\"Only direct supervisors\",\"Editors, reviewers, designers, and developers\",\"Only other content writers\",\"Only clients\"]', '[1]', 'Integration requires understanding how different roles contribute to the final product.', 'The document specifies coordinating effectively with editors, reviewers, designers, and developers for integrated content solutions.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(529, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What feedback should the Content Writer incorporate into content improvements?', '[\"Only positive feedback\",\"Reviewer Comments (RC) and stakeholder feedback\",\"Only supervisor feedback\",\"Only peer feedback\"]', '[1]', 'RC integration shows responsiveness and commitment to meeting quality standards.', 'A key collaborative responsibility is to incorporate Reviewer Comments (RC) and stakeholder feedback into content improvements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(530, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'How quickly should the Content Writer respond to content-related queries?', '[\"Within 24 hours\",\"Within one week\",\"Promptly when required\",\"At the end of each day\"]', '[2]', 'Prompt responses maintain project momentum and demonstrate professional reliability.', 'The responsibilities include responding promptly to queries and providing content-related clarifications when required.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(531, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer track daily for quality assurance?', '[\"Personal productivity metrics\",\"Content submissions and organized file management systems\",\"Email responses only\",\"Meeting attendance\"]', '[1]', 'Systematic tracking prevents missed deadlines and ensures accountability.', 'Under Quality Assurance & Process Management, tracking daily content submissions and maintaining organized file management systems is required.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(532, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of handover should the Content Writer ensure for smooth processes?', '[\"Quick verbal handover\",\"Smooth content handover for review, editing, and production processes\",\"Email notification only\",\"Partial handover with follow-up\"]', '[1]', 'Smooth handovers include complete documentation and clear communication of status.', 'Ensuring smooth content handover for review, editing, and production processes is a specific quality assurance responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(533, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should the Content Writer prioritize tasks to meet requirements?', '[\"By personal preference\",\"Strategically to meet daily deadlines and production requirements\",\"By content type only\",\"By client seniority only\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic prioritization balances urgency, importance, and resource availability.', 'The responsibilities specify prioritizing tasks strategically to meet daily deadlines and production requirements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(534, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer review and update in existing content?', '[\"Only grammar and spelling\",\"Accuracy, consistency, and relevance\",\"Only formatting\",\"Only citations\"]', '[1]', 'Regular content audits ensure information remains current and maintains quality standards.', 'A quality assurance responsibility is to review and update existing content for accuracy, consistency, and relevance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(535, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer plan weekly in coordination with others?', '[\"Personal development goals\",\"Content schedules with production leads and project managers\",\"Team social activities\",\"Training sessions only\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly planning ensures alignment with broader project timelines and resource allocation.', 'Under Strategic Planning & Innovation, planning weekly content schedules in coordination with production leads and project managers is specified.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(536, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of content approaches should the Content Writer explore?', '[\"Only traditional approaches\",\"Innovative content approaches and new formats for improved value delivery\",\"Only tested approaches\",\"Only client-specified approaches\"]', '[1]', 'Innovation distinguishes exceptional performance and adds competitive advantage.', 'The responsibilities include exploring innovative content approaches and suggesting new formats for improved value delivery.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(537, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer conduct for new projects and content initiatives?', '[\"Client interviews\",\"Possibility checks\",\"Market surveys\",\"Competitor analysis\"]', '[1]', 'Possibility checks assess feasibility, resources needed, and potential challenges before commitment.', 'Conducting possibility checks for new projects and content initiatives is listed as a strategic planning responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(538, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer analyze and suggest improvements for?', '[\"Team dynamics\",\"Content output metrics\",\"Budget allocations\",\"Client satisfaction surveys\"]', '[1]', 'Data-driven insights enable continuous improvement and demonstrate strategic thinking.', 'The responsibilities include analyzing content output metrics and suggesting strategic improvements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(539, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What workflow elements should the Content Writer document for quality tracking?', '[\"Personal time management\",\"Content workflow, approvals, and revision processes\",\"Team meeting notes only\",\"Client communications only\"]', '[1]', 'Process documentation enables quality audits and continuous improvement initiatives.', 'Under Documentation & Compliance Management, documenting content workflow, approvals, and revision processes for quality tracking is required.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(540, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer track for reference and process improvement?', '[\"Personal performance only\",\"Reviewer Comments and changes\",\"Meeting attendance\",\"Training completion\"]', '[1]', 'Tracking RC patterns helps identify common issues and training opportunities.', 'Tracking Reviewer Comments and changes for reference and process improvement is a specific documentation responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(541, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What standards should the Content Writer ensure adherence to?', '[\"Only grammar standards\",\"Internal style guides, templates, and compliance standards\",\"Only citation standards\",\"Only formatting standards\"]', '[1]', 'Consistency across all content strengthens brand identity and professional presentation.', 'Ensuring adherence to internal style guides, templates, and compliance standards is a key compliance management responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(542, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What records should the Content Writer maintain comprehensively?', '[\"Personal work logs only\",\"Content development and approval processes\",\"Email correspondence only\",\"Meeting minutes only\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive records support quality audits, dispute resolution, and process analysis.', 'Maintaining comprehensive records of content development and approval processes is specified as a documentation responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(543, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'Whom should the Content Writer mentor in team development activities?', '[\"Only new hires\",\"Junior writers and interns\",\"Peer-level writers only\",\"Senior writers\"]', '[1]', 'Mentoring develops leadership skills and ensures knowledge continuity within the team.', 'Under Team Development & Knowledge Transfer, mentoring junior writers and interns in research methodologies and writing best practices is required.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(544, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of feedback should the Content Writer provide to improve team quality?', '[\"Only positive feedback\",\"Constructive feedback\",\"Only critical feedback\",\"No feedback unless requested\"]', '[1]', 'Constructive feedback focuses on improvement opportunities while acknowledging strengths.', 'The responsibilities include providing constructive feedback to improve overall team content quality.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(545, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Content Writer conduct training sessions on?', '[\"Only software tools\",\"Writing techniques and internal tools\",\"Only research methods\",\"Only time management\"]', '[1]', 'Training builds team capability and standardizes quality across all content production.', 'Conducting training sessions on writing techniques and internal tools is a specified team development responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(546, 1, 28, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What knowledge should the Content Writer share with the team?', '[\"Only personal experiences\",\"Content development processes and organizational resources\",\"Only technical skills\",\"Only client feedback\"]', '[1]', 'Knowledge sharing accelerates team learning and reduces dependency on individual experts.', 'Sharing knowledge of content development processes and organizational resources is the final listed responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(547, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many Key Result Areas (KRAs) are defined for the Content Writer position?', '[\"Three KRAs\",\"Four KRAs\",\"Five KRAs\",\"Six KRAs\"]', '[2]', 'The five KRAs provide a balanced framework covering quality, research, collaboration, efficiency, and innovation.', 'The document lists five distinct KRAs: Content Quality & Academic Excellence, Research & Information Management, Collaboration & Production Coordination, Process Efficiency & Organization, and Innovation & Strategic Contribution.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(548, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first Key Result Area for the Content Writer?', '[\"Research & Information Management\",\"Content Quality & Academic Excellence\",\"Process Efficiency & Organization\",\"Innovation & Strategic Contribution\"]', '[1]', 'Quality always comes first in academic and research content creation.', 'Content Quality & Academic Excellence is listed as the first KRA, emphasizing that delivering exceptional content is the primary focus of the role.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(549, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum Content Quality Score must be achieved?', '[\"\\u2265 4.0\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.8\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 5.0\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', '4.8/5.0 represents excellence, leaving minimal room for quality shortfalls.', 'The KPI specifies achieving ≥ 4.8/5.0 average quality rating from reviewers and stakeholders as the Content Quality Score target.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(550, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum required Accuracy Rate for research content?', '[\"\\u2265 95%\",\"\\u2265 96%\",\"\\u2265 97%\",\"\\u2265 98%\"]', '[3]', 'Near-perfect accuracy is non-negotiable in academic and research contexts.', 'The KPI requires maintaining ≥ 98% accuracy in research citations, references, and factual content.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(551, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the required Revision Efficiency timeframe?', '[\"Complete content revisions within 12 hours 95% of the time\",\"Complete content revisions within 24 hours 95% of the time\",\"Complete content revisions within 48 hours 95% of the time\",\"Complete content revisions within 24 hours 90% of the time\"]', '[1]', 'Quick turnaround on revisions maintains project momentum and demonstrates responsiveness.', 'The Revision Efficiency KPI requires completing content revisions within 24 hours of receiving feedback 95% of the time.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(552, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of assigned content projects must complete comprehensive research verification?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\",\"90%\"]', '[2]', 'No exceptions on research verification ensures consistent quality and credibility.', 'The Research Depth KPI requires completing comprehensive research verification for 100% of assigned content projects.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(553, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What types of sources must be utilized for academic content according to Source Quality KPI?', '[\"Any available sources\",\"Only peer-reviewed sources\",\"Credible, peer-reviewed, and authoritative sources\",\"Only government sources\"]', '[2]', 'Source credibility directly impacts the academic integrity of all content produced.', 'The Source Quality KPI specifies utilizing only credible, peer-reviewed, and authoritative sources for academic content.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(554, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum required Content Relevance approval rate on first submission?', '[\"\\u2265 90%\",\"\\u2265 93%\",\"\\u2265 95%\",\"\\u2265 98%\"]', '[2]', 'High first-submission approval rates indicate strong understanding of requirements.', 'The Content Relevance KPI requires achieving ≥ 95% content approval rate on first submission to reviewers.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(555, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum Team Collaboration effectiveness rating is required?', '[\"\\u2265 4.0\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.6\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.8\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', 'Strong collaboration skills are essential for integrated content production.', 'The Team Collaboration KPI requires achieving ≥ 4.6/5.0 collaboration effectiveness rating from cross-functional teams.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
(556, 1, 29, 6, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the required Response Time for content-related queries during business hours?', '[\"Within 1 hour\",\"Within 2 hours\",\"Within 4 hours\",\"Same business day\"]', '[1]', 'Two-hour response windows maintain project flow without demanding immediate responses.', 'The Response Time KPI requires responding to content-related queries and clarifications within 2 hours during business hours.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 1, '2025-10-08 14:47:30', 0),
