(613, 1, 32, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary function of the Customer Relationship Executive according to the job role clarity?', '[\"Managing internal team operations\",\"Serving as primary liaison between PhDiZone and clients throughout service delivery lifecycle\",\"Developing new business strategies\",\"Conducting quality assurance audits\"]', '[1]', 'The liaison function means being the communication bridge - understanding both client needs and internal capabilities.', 'The Job Role Clarity section explicitly states that the CRE \'serves as the primary liaison between PhDiZone and its clients throughout the service delivery lifecycle\', emphasizing the bridging function of this role.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(614, 1, 32, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which key aspect is emphasized as essential for maintaining PhDiZone\'s reputation?', '[\"Cost reduction strategies\",\"Responsive, professional, and solution-oriented customer support\",\"Aggressive marketing campaigns\",\"Technology infrastructure development\"]', '[1]', 'The three pillars of customer support excellence are being responsive (timely), professional (standard-driven), and solution-oriented (problem-solving focused).', 'The document emphasizes that providing \'responsive, professional, and solution-oriented customer support\' is essential for maintaining PhDiZone\'s reputation for excellence in academic research services.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(615, 1, 32, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'According to the role clarity, the CRE acts as whose voice within PhDiZone?', '[\"The management\'s voice\",\"The technical team\'s voice\",\"The customer\'s voice\",\"The competitor\'s voice\"]', '[2]', 'Being the customer\'s voice means representing client perspectives, needs, and concerns in internal discussions and decision-making.', 'The document states that \'The Customer Relationship Executive acts as the voice of the customer within PhDiZone\', highlighting the advocacy role for client interests internally.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(616, 1, 32, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three core capabilities does the position require according to the role description?', '[\"Sales skills, technical knowledge, and marketing expertise\",\"Strong communication skills, problem-solving abilities, and project coordination expertise\",\"Financial analysis, strategic planning, and leadership skills\",\"Research capabilities, writing skills, and analytical thinking\"]', '[1]', 'These three capabilities work together: communication for interaction, problem-solving for challenges, and coordination for seamless execution.', 'The document explicitly states that the position requires \'strong communication skills, problem-solving abilities, and project coordination expertise\' to effectively manage customer relationships and service delivery.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(617, 1, 32, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'How does this Level 2, Grade V position impact the organization?', '[\"Only affects individual project outcomes\",\"Directly impacts client satisfaction, retention rates, and PhDiZone\'s market reputation\",\"Primarily influences internal process efficiency\",\"Mainly affects cost structure\"]', '[1]', 'Customer-facing roles at this level have multiplier effects - one CRE\'s performance affects multiple clients and overall brand perception.', 'The document states that this position \'directly impacts client satisfaction, retention rates, and PhDiZone\'s market reputation\', emphasizing the strategic importance of the role.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(618, 1, 32, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What commitment does the CRE represent when interacting with clients?', '[\"Cost efficiency commitment\",\"Technology innovation commitment\",\"Commitment to academic excellence and professional service delivery\",\"Market expansion commitment\"]', '[2]', 'Academic excellence and professional service delivery are PhDiZone\'s core brand promises that every CRE must embody.', 'The role description states that the CRE represents \'the company\'s commitment to academic excellence and professional service delivery\' when dealing with customers.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(619, 1, 32, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What organizational mission does this role support?', '[\"Expanding into new geographic markets\",\"Providing comprehensive research support that meets the highest academic standards\",\"Developing proprietary research methodologies\",\"Building the largest customer database\"]', '[1]', 'Understanding the mission helps CREs make better decisions - every action should ultimately support high-quality academic research delivery.', 'The document states the role supports \'the organization\'s mission to provide comprehensive research support that meets the highest academic standards\', linking individual performance to organizational purpose.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(620, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which communication channels must the CRE monitor for customer queries?', '[\"Only email and phone calls\",\"Calls, emails, and WhatsApp\",\"Social media platforms only\",\"In-person meetings only\"]', '[1]', 'Modern customer service requires omnichannel presence - be prepared to switch seamlessly between communication platforms.', 'The primary responsibility explicitly states that CREs must \'Respond promptly to customer queries across multiple channels including calls, emails, and WhatsApp\', indicating a multi-channel communication requirement.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(621, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the expected frequency for conducting customer follow-ups?', '[\"Weekly follow-ups\",\"Monthly follow-ups\",\"Systematic daily follow-ups\",\"Follow-ups only when customers request\"]', '[2]', 'Daily follow-ups don\'t mean contacting every customer daily, but rather having a systematic schedule ensuring no customer goes too long without touchpoints.', 'The document specifies that CREs must \'Conduct systematic daily follow-ups to maintain consistent client engagement\', emphasizing the importance of daily proactive communication.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(622, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What types of customer concerns must CREs address in issue resolution?', '[\"Only technical service issues\",\"Plagiarism checks, confidentiality agreements, and project clarifications\",\"Only billing and payment issues\",\"Only delivery timeline concerns\"]', '[1]', 'These three concern types reflect the academic integrity, data security, and clarity needs that are paramount in research services.', 'The Issue Resolution responsibility specifically mentions addressing \'customer concerns related to plagiarism checks, confidentiality agreements, and project clarifications\', highlighting the academic and professional nature of the concerns.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(623, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should CREs do when facing complex or unresolved customer issues?', '[\"Wait for the customer to escalate\",\"Handle it independently regardless of complexity\",\"Escalate complex or unresolved issues to appropriate departments for expert resolution\",\"Close the issue and move to the next customer\"]', '[2]', 'Knowing when to escalate is as important as knowing how to resolve - don\'t let pride prevent proper issue resolution.', 'The document clearly states CREs should \'Escalate complex or unresolved issues to appropriate departments for expert resolution\', recognizing that not all issues can be resolved at the CRE level.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(624, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which teams must CREs coordinate with for service delivery?', '[\"Only the customer service team\",\"Content and journal specialists\",\"Only the technical delivery team\",\"Only the quality assurance team\"]', '[1]', 'Content teams handle the research work while journal specialists manage publication processes - both are critical for academic research services.', 'The Service Delivery Coordination responsibility specifies that CREs \'Allocate and coordinate tasks with internal teams including content and journal specialists\', identifying the key internal stakeholders.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(625, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What quality aspect must CREs ensure through proactive monitoring?', '[\"Cost efficiency\",\"Team productivity\",\"Deliverable quality and timeline adherence\",\"System uptime\"]', '[2]', 'Quality and timeliness are both essential - a perfect deliverable that\'s late or an on-time deliverable with quality issues both represent failure.', 'The document states CREs must \'Ensure deliverable quality and timeline adherence through proactive monitoring\', emphasizing both quality standards and punctuality.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(626, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should CREs maintain customer relationships throughout the project lifecycle?', '[\"Only at project initiation and completion\",\"Conduct scheduled follow-ups to maintain strong customer relationships throughout project lifecycle\",\"Only when customers reach out with concerns\",\"Through automated email updates only\"]', '[1]', 'Schedule follow-ups at key project milestones to show consistent attention and catch potential issues early.', 'The Customer Relationship Building & Retention section specifies that CREs should \'Conduct scheduled follow-ups to maintain strong customer relationships throughout project lifecycle\', emphasizing proactive, continuous engagement.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(627, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of meetings should CREs organize between teams and customers?', '[\"Only virtual meetings\",\"Technical meetings\",\"Only project kickoff meetings\",\"Monthly review meetings\"]', '[1]', 'Technical meetings bridge the gap between academic requirements and practical execution - prepare thoroughly to facilitate productive discussions.', 'The responsibility list includes \'Organize and participate in technical meetings between teams and customers\', recognizing the need for detailed discussions about project methodologies and requirements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(628, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should customer feedback be collected according to the responsibilities?', '[\"Only through online forms\",\"Through calls and structured surveys\",\"Only at project completion\",\"Through third-party agencies\"]', '[1]', 'Calls provide qualitative insights and relationship building, while structured surveys enable quantitative analysis and trend identification.', 'The document specifies that CREs should \'Collect and document customer feedback through calls and structured surveys\', indicating a dual approach combining personal interaction and systematic data collection.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(629, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should CREs do to strengthen relationship bonds with customers?', '[\"Offer discounts on every project\",\"Celebrate customer milestones and achievements\",\"Send generic promotional materials\",\"Focus only on problem resolution\"]', '[1]', 'Celebrating PhD completions, paper acceptances, or degree awards shows you care about their success beyond just service delivery.', 'The responsibilities include \'Celebrate customer milestones and achievements to strengthen relationship bonds\', recognizing the emotional and motivational aspects of customer relationships in academic contexts.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(630, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must CREs maintain in CRM systems according to Data Management responsibilities?', '[\"Only customer contact information\",\"Accurate customer communication logs\",\"Only project timelines\",\"Only payment records\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive communication logs serve as institutional memory and protect both the customer and organization in case of disputes.', 'The Data Management & Compliance section requires CREs to \'Maintain accurate customer communication logs in CRM systems\', ensuring all interactions are properly documented.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(631, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'How often should CREs validate CRM entries for accuracy?', '[\"Weekly\",\"Monthly\",\"On a daily basis\",\"Quarterly\"]', '[2]', 'Daily validation prevents data quality issues from accumulating and ensures decisions are based on current, accurate information.', 'The document specifies that CREs must \'Validate CRM entries for completeness and accuracy on daily basis\', emphasizing the importance of real-time data accuracy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(632, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of reports must CREs prepare for management review?', '[\"Only financial reports\",\"Comprehensive reports for management review and strategic planning\",\"Only customer satisfaction reports\",\"Only technical delivery reports\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive reports should synthesize operational data, customer insights, and strategic recommendations to support decision-making.', 'The Data Management responsibilities include \'Prepare comprehensive reports for management review and strategic planning\', indicating a broad reporting scope beyond operational metrics.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(633, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must CREs obtain from customers before project closure?', '[\"Payment confirmation\",\"Customer approvals of deliverables\",\"Future project commitments\",\"Referral contacts\"]', '[1]', 'Formal customer approval protects both parties and provides clear closure - never assume satisfaction without explicit confirmation.', 'The Quality Assurance & Continuous Improvement section states that CREs must \'Verify deliverables and obtain customer approvals before project closure\', ensuring formal acceptance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(634, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should CREs collect to support marketing initiatives?', '[\"Customer financial information\",\"Testimonials and Google reviews\",\"Competitor information\",\"Technical project details\"]', '[1]', 'Request testimonials when customer satisfaction is highest - typically right after successful project completion or milestone achievement.', 'The Quality Assurance responsibilities include \'Collect testimonials and Google reviews to support marketing initiatives\', recognizing the importance of social proof in business development.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(635, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should CREs document for process improvement?', '[\"Only customer complaints\",\"Case studies and lessons learned\",\"Only successful projects\",\"Only technical specifications\"]', '[1]', 'Both successes and failures provide valuable lessons - focus on extracting actionable insights that can improve future performance.', 'CREs are responsible to \'Document case studies and lessons learned for process improvement\', creating organizational knowledge from individual experiences.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(636, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should CREs suggest based on customer feedback?', '[\"Price reductions\",\"Enhancements based on recurring customer concerns and feedback\",\"Staff changes\",\"Service discontinuation\"]', '[1]', 'Track patterns in customer feedback - recurring themes indicate systematic issues or opportunities for improvement.', 'The document states that CREs should \'Suggest enhancements based on recurring customer concerns and feedback\', positioning them as contributors to service evolution.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(637, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What role do CREs play in team development?', '[\"Only attend training sessions\",\"Participate actively in training and workshops, share best practices, and support new team member development\",\"Focus only on their own skill development\",\"Conduct performance reviews\"]', '[1]', 'Knowledge sharing creates a learning organization - your experience becomes more valuable when it multiplies through others.', 'The Team Development & Knowledge Sharing responsibilities include multiple activities: participating in training, sharing best practices, supporting new team members, and contributing to organizational learning.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(638, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first Key Result Area (KRA) listed for this position?', '[\"Data Management & Operational Compliance\",\"Customer Support Excellence & Responsiveness\",\"Service Delivery Coordination\",\"Issue Resolution & Customer Satisfaction Management\"]', '[1]', 'The order of KRAs often reflects their relative importance - customer support excellence is the foundation of this role.', 'The document lists \'Customer Support Excellence & Responsiveness\' as the first KRA, emphasizing its primary importance in delivering exceptional customer service through prompt and professional communication.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(639, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which KRA focuses on resolving problems while maintaining customer satisfaction?', '[\"Customer Support Excellence & Responsiveness\",\"Issue Resolution & Customer Satisfaction Management\",\"Service Delivery Coordination & Project Management\",\"Quality Assurance & Continuous Improvement\"]', '[1]', 'Effective issue resolution isn\'t just about solving problems - it\'s about solving them in ways that maintain or enhance customer satisfaction.', 'The second KRA is specifically titled \'Issue Resolution & Customer Satisfaction Management\' and focuses on ensuring rapid and effective resolution of customer issues while maintaining high satisfaction levels.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(640, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Service Delivery Coordination KRA primarily facilitate?', '[\"Customer feedback collection\",\"Seamless coordination between internal teams and customers for timely, quality deliverable completion\",\"Marketing and sales activities\",\"Financial management\"]', '[1]', 'Coordination is about orchestrating multiple parties toward a common goal - think of yourself as the conductor of a project orchestra.', 'The third KRA describes Service Delivery Coordination as facilitating \'seamless coordination between internal teams and customers to ensure timely, quality deliverable completion\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(641, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of the Customer Relationship Development & Retention KRA?', '[\"Acquiring new customers only\",\"Building and maintaining strong customer relationships that drive loyalty, retention, and positive brand advocacy\",\"Reducing customer service costs\",\"Automating customer interactions\"]', '[1]', 'Loyalty leads to retention, and retention leads to advocacy - each stage builds on the previous one in the customer relationship journey.', 'This KRA explicitly focuses on building and maintaining relationships that drive three outcomes: loyalty, retention, and positive brand advocacy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(642, 1, 33, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Data Management & Operational Compliance KRA ensure?', '[\"Customer satisfaction scores\",\"Accurate customer data and compliance with organizational processes and regulatory requirements\",\"Marketing effectiveness\",\"Technical delivery quality\"]', '[1]', 'Data accuracy and compliance aren\'t just administrative tasks - they\'re foundational to trust and legal protection.', 'The fifth KRA focuses on maintaining \'accurate customer data and ensure compliance with organizational processes and regulatory requirements\', emphasizing both data quality and compliance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(643, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the response time target for customer queries during business hours?', '[\"Within 1 hour\",\"Within 2 hours\",\"Within 4 hours\",\"Within 24 hours\"]', '[1]', 'Two hours is a reasonable balance between immediate response and workload management - prioritize urgent queries within this timeframe.', 'The KPI for Response Time specifically states that CREs must \'Respond to customer queries within 2 hours during business hours\', setting a clear expectation for prompt response.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(644, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum customer rating must CREs maintain for communication effectiveness?', '[\"\\u2265 4.0\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.8\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 5.0\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', '4.8/5.0 means nearly perfect communication - consistently meet expectations and occasionally exceed them to maintain this rating.', 'The Communication Quality KPI requires maintaining \'≥ 4.8/5.0 customer rating for communication effectiveness\', which is a very high standard indicating excellence.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(645, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the required completion rate for scheduled daily follow-ups?', '[\"85%\",\"90%\",\"95%\",\"100%\"]', '[3]', '100% completion requires excellent organizational skills and discipline - use reminders and scheduling tools to ensure nothing falls through cracks.', 'The Follow-up Compliance KPI explicitly states \'Achieve 100% completion of scheduled daily follow-ups\', leaving no room for missed follow-ups.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(646, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of customer issues should be resolved within 24 hours of initial contact?', '[\"75%\",\"80%\",\"85%\",\"90%\"]', '[2]', 'Focus on resolving simple issues immediately to meet the 85% target, while properly handling complex issues that require more time.', 'The Resolution Rate KPI specifies \'Resolve 85% of customer issues within 24 hours of initial contact\', indicating that most issues should be handled quickly.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(647, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum overall customer satisfaction rating must CREs maintain?', '[\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.6\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.7\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.8\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', 'Overall satisfaction encompasses all aspects of service - one weak area can pull down the score, so maintain consistency across all touchpoints.', 'The Customer Satisfaction Score KPI requires maintaining \'≥ 4.7/5.0 overall customer satisfaction rating\', which is a high standard but slightly lower than the communication rating.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(648, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the compliance requirement for escalated issues resolution?', '[\"90% resolved within defined timelines\",\"95% resolved within defined timelines\",\"100% resolved within defined timelines\",\"85% resolved within defined timelines\"]', '[false]', 'Escalated issues are critical - track them rigorously until resolution and never assume someone else is handling them.', 'The Escalation Management KPI states \'Ensure 100% of escalated issues are resolved within defined timelines\', indicating that escalated issues require complete follow-through.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(649, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum on-time delivery rate must be achieved for coordinated projects?', '[\"\\u2265 90%\",\"\\u2265 92%\",\"\\u2265 95%\",\"\\u2265 98%\"]', '[2]', 'Build buffer time into project plans and monitor progress continuously to maintain 95%+ on-time delivery.', 'The Project Timeline Adherence KPI requires \'Achieve ≥ 95% on-time delivery rate for coordinated projects\', setting a high bar for punctuality.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(650, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum customer approval rate must be maintained for delivered work?', '[\"\\u2265 95%\",\"\\u2265 96%\",\"\\u2265 97%\",\"\\u2265 98%\"]', '[3]', '98% approval means almost no rework - ensure quality checks before delivery rather than relying on customer feedback to catch issues.', 'The Deliverable Quality KPI specifies \'Maintain ≥ 98% customer approval rate for delivered work\', which is an extremely high standard indicating near-perfect quality.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(651, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What rating should CREs achieve from internal teams for coordination support?', '[\"\\u2265 4.4\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.6\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.7\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', 'Internal team satisfaction is as important as customer satisfaction - poor internal relationships will eventually impact customer service quality.', 'The Team Coordination Effectiveness KPI requires \'Achieve ≥ 4.6/5.0 rating from internal teams for coordination support\', indicating that internal stakeholder satisfaction is also measured.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(652, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum customer retention rate target for assigned accounts?', '[\"\\u2265 92%\",\"\\u2265 94%\",\"\\u2265 96%\",\"\\u2265 98%\"]', '[2]', 'Retention is more cost-effective than acquisition - focus on consistent service excellence to minimize customer churn.', 'The Customer Retention Rate KPI states \'Maintain ≥ 96% customer retention rate for assigned accounts\', emphasizing the importance of keeping existing customers.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(653, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many customer testimonials must CREs secure monthly?', '[\"Minimum 2\",\"Minimum 3\",\"Minimum 4\",\"Minimum 5\"]', '[1]', 'Ask for testimonials when customers are most satisfied - right after successful completion or when they express appreciation.', 'The Testimonial Collection KPI specifies \'Secure minimum 3 customer testimonials monthly\', ensuring regular collection of positive customer feedback.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(654, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What rating should CREs achieve for customer relationship strength?', '[\"\\u2265 4.3\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.4\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.6\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', 'Relationship strength goes beyond satisfaction - it reflects trust, rapport, and long-term partnership potential.', 'The Relationship Health Score KPI requires \'Achieve ≥ 4.5/5.0 customer relationship strength rating\', measuring the depth and quality of customer relationships.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(655, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What accuracy level must be maintained in customer communication logging?', '[\"95%\",\"97%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', '99% accuracy means only 1 error per 100 entries - double-check critical information before logging it in the CRM.', 'The CRM Data Accuracy KPI states \'Maintain 99% accuracy in customer communication logging\', indicating that data quality is critical with minimal tolerance for error.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(656, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the compliance target for oath form maintenance and regulatory requirements?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\",\"90%\"]', '[2]', 'Compliance is non-negotiable - create checklists and verification processes to ensure 100% compliance at all times.', 'The Compliance Rate KPI requires \'Achieve 100% compliance in oath form maintenance and regulatory requirements\', indicating zero tolerance for compliance violations.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(657, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the deadline adherence requirement for monthly reports?', '[\"90% of the time\",\"95% of the time\",\"98% of the time\",\"100% of the time\"]', '[3]', 'Start report preparation early in the reporting period and maintain ongoing documentation to ensure timely, error-free submission.', 'The Reporting Quality KPI specifies \'Submit error-free monthly reports within deadline 100% of the time\', requiring perfect punctuality and accuracy.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(658, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three aspects does the performance measurement framework emphasize?', '[\"Cost, speed, and volume\",\"Customer satisfaction outcomes, operational efficiency, and service quality metrics\",\"Revenue, profit, and market share\",\"Technology, innovation, and automation\"]', '[1]', 'These three dimensions are interconnected - efficiency without quality or satisfaction is hollow, while quality without efficiency isn\'t sustainable.', 'The Performance Measurement Framework section states that evaluation emphasizes \'customer satisfaction outcomes, operational efficiency, and service quality metrics\', providing a balanced scorecard approach.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(659, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'Through what mechanisms does the CRE undergo continuous performance monitoring?', '[\"Annual reviews only\",\"Customer feedback, internal quality assessments, and measurable service delivery outcomes\",\"Supervisor observations only\",\"Peer reviews only\"]', '[1]', 'Multiple evaluation sources provide a comprehensive performance picture - excel in all three areas for optimal career development.', 'The document specifies that monitoring occurs \'through customer feedback, internal quality assessments, and measurable service delivery outcomes\', indicating multiple evaluation sources.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(660, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of reports are required on a daily basis?', '[\"Comprehensive customer relationship analysis\",\"Customer interaction summaries, issue resolution status, and project coordination updates\",\"Financial performance reports\",\"Strategic planning documents\"]', '[1]', 'Daily reports should be concise but complete - capture key activities and outcomes without excessive detail.', 'Daily Reports are described as including \'Customer interaction summaries, issue resolution status, and project coordination updates\', focusing on operational activities.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(661, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What content is included in weekly reports?', '[\"Only customer satisfaction scores\",\"Customer satisfaction metrics, project delivery status, and team coordination effectiveness\",\"Only financial metrics\",\"Only technical delivery metrics\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reports should show trends and patterns that daily reports might miss - aggregate and analyze data for insights.', 'Weekly Reports contain \'Customer satisfaction metrics, project delivery status, and team coordination effectiveness\', providing a broader view than daily reports.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(662, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the monthly report focus on?', '[\"Daily operational details\",\"Comprehensive customer relationship analysis, service quality assessment, and process improvement recommendations\",\"Only customer complaints\",\"Only team performance metrics\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly reports should be strategic, not just operational summaries - include insights and recommendations for improvement.', 'Monthly Reports are described as \'Comprehensive customer relationship analysis, service quality assessment, and process improvement recommendations\', taking a strategic perspective.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(663, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What tool is used for real-time monitoring of customer interactions?', '[\"Email tracking systems\",\"CRM dashboard\",\"Social media analytics\",\"Phone systems\"]', '[1]', 'Use CRM dashboards proactively to identify issues before they escalate, not just to record what already happened.', 'The Customer Success Metrics Tracking section specifies \'Real-time Monitoring: CRM dashboard tracking for customer interactions and satisfaction indicators\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(664, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently are performance reviews conducted for customer feedback analysis?', '[\"Daily\",\"Weekly\",\"Monthly\",\"Quarterly\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reviews allow for timely course corrections while providing enough data for meaningful analysis.', 'The document specifies \'Weekly Performance Reviews: Customer feedback analysis and service delivery quality assessment\', indicating a weekly review cadence.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(665, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is covered in monthly strategic reviews?', '[\"Only operational metrics\",\"Customer portfolio health evaluation and relationship development planning\",\"Only financial performance\",\"Only technical delivery metrics\"]', '[1]', 'Portfolio health goes beyond individual customer satisfaction - it examines the overall composition, risk, and growth potential of your customer base.', 'Monthly Strategic Reviews include \'Customer portfolio health evaluation and relationship development planning\', focusing on the strategic health of the customer base.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(666, 1, 34, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is evaluated in quarterly excellence reviews?', '[\"Only individual performance\",\"Comprehensive customer success contribution and career development planning\",\"Only customer satisfaction scores\",\"Only operational efficiency\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly reviews are opportunities for career development conversations - prepare examples of your contributions and discuss growth goals.', 'Quarterly Excellence Reviews focus on \'Comprehensive customer success contribution and career development planning\', linking performance to career progression.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(667, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus during the immediate objectives phase (0-6 months)?', '[\"Advanced customer success program development\",\"Establishing excellence in customer service delivery and mastering PhDiZone\'s service portfolio\",\"Taking on leadership responsibilities\",\"Developing new business strategies\"]', '[1]', 'The first six months are about building a strong foundation - focus on mastering the basics before attempting advanced responsibilities.', 'The Immediate Objectives state that the CRE will \'establish excellence in customer service delivery, mastering PhDiZone\'s service portfolio, customer communication protocols, and internal coordination processes\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(668, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What role evolution is expected in the medium-term development phase (6-18 months)?', '[\"Transition to technical specialist\",\"Evolution into a customer success specialist\",\"Move to sales role\",\"Shift to operations management\"]', '[1]', 'Customer success specialist status requires both breadth (understanding various customer needs) and depth (expertise in academic research processes).', 'The Medium-term Development section describes evolution \'into a customer success specialist with deep understanding of academic research processes and customer business models\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(669, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What expanded responsibilities are mentioned for the medium-term development phase?', '[\"Financial management only\",\"Key account management, customer success program development, and leadership in customer experience optimization\",\"Technical delivery only\",\"Human resources management\"]', '[1]', 'This progression shows increasing strategic responsibility - from executing processes to designing and leading customer success initiatives.', 'The document states that the role will expand to include \'key account management responsibilities, customer success program development, and leadership in customer experience optimization initiatives\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(670, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What advancement opportunities are mentioned for long-term career progression (18+ months)?', '[\"Technical architect or senior developer\",\"CRE Lead, Customer Success Manager, or Customer Experience Manager positions\",\"Financial controller or CFO\",\"Marketing director or CMO\"]', '[1]', 'These career paths show both depth (CRE Lead) and breadth (Customer Success/Experience Manager) options based on your strengths and interests.', 'Long-term Career Progression specifies advancement opportunities including \'CRE Lead, Customer Success Manager, or Customer Experience Manager positions\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(671, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What foundation does this role provide for specialized careers?', '[\"Technical development careers\",\"Careers in customer success operations, client management, or specialized roles in academic services customer experience design\",\"Marketing and sales careers\",\"Finance and accounting careers\"]', '[1]', 'This role builds transferable skills in relationship management while offering specialization opportunities in the academic services niche.', 'The document states the role \'provides excellent foundation for careers in customer success operations, client management, or specialized roles in academic services customer experience design\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(672, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the strategic business contribution of this position according to the document?', '[\"Revenue generation only\",\"Reputation management and client retention strategy through exceptional service delivery\",\"Cost reduction initiatives\",\"Technology development\"]', '[1]', 'Your daily work has strategic impact - every customer interaction either builds or diminishes PhDiZone\'s reputation and retention rates.', 'The Strategic Business Contribution section emphasizes that the position is \'vital for PhDiZone\'s reputation management and client retention strategy, ensuring that exceptional service delivery creates strong customer advocacy\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(673, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What time slot is designated for customer priority review and daily planning?', '[\"8:00 AM - 9:00 AM\",\"9:00 AM - 9:30 AM\",\"9:30 AM - 10:00 AM\",\"10:00 AM - 10:30 AM\"]', '[1]', 'Starting the day with priority review ensures you focus on what matters most rather than reacting to whatever comes first.', 'The Daily Customer-Centric Activities schedule shows \'9:00 AM - 9:30 AM: Customer priority review and daily planning based on project urgency\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(674, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activity is scheduled between 9:30 AM and 11:30 AM?', '[\"CRM updates and documentation\",\"Customer query response and proactive communication management\",\"Team coordination meetings\",\"Report preparation\"]', '[1]', 'This two-hour block during peak business hours is when customers are most active - minimize distractions during this critical period.', 'The schedule indicates \'9:30 AM - 11:30 AM: Customer query response and proactive communication management\', allocating prime morning hours to customer interaction.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(675, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur between 11:30 AM and 12:30 PM?', '[\"Lunch break\",\"Issue resolution activities and escalation management\",\"Training sessions\",\"Customer calls only\"]', '[1]', 'Having dedicated time for complex issue resolution ensures they receive proper attention rather than being squeezed between other tasks.', 'The schedule shows \'11:30 AM - 12:30 PM: Issue resolution activities and escalation management\', dedicating this time to problem-solving.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(676, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus during the 1:30 PM - 3:00 PM time slot?', '[\"Individual customer calls only\",\"Project coordination with internal teams and customer update calls\",\"Administrative work only\",\"Break time\"]', '[1]', 'Afternoon is ideal for coordination as it allows morning progress updates and provides time for teams to address any issues raised.', 'The schedule specifies \'1:30 PM - 3:00 PM: Project coordination with internal teams and customer update calls\', showing the bridging function between internal and external stakeholders.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(677, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are scheduled from 3:00 PM to 4:30 PM?', '[\"New customer acquisition calls\",\"CRM updates, documentation, and customer follow-up activities\",\"Team training sessions\",\"Strategic planning meetings\"]', '[1]', 'Don\'t skip documentation at day\'s end when tired - quality data entry is crucial for continuity and analysis.', 'The schedule shows \'3:00 PM - 4:30 PM: CRM updates, documentation, and customer follow-up activities\', ensuring data is current and follow-ups are completed.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(678, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the purpose of the 4:30 PM - 5:30 PM time slot?', '[\"Personal time\",\"Daily reporting, task allocation coordination, and next-day preparation\",\"Customer calls only\",\"Team building activities\"]', '[1]', 'Effective next-day preparation in the evening prevents chaotic mornings and enables strategic rather than reactive work.', 'The schedule ends with \'4:30 PM - 5:30 PM: Daily reporting, task allocation coordination, and next-day preparation\', ensuring closure and planning.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(679, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the weekly customer success focus on Mondays?', '[\"Customer feedback collection\",\"Weekly customer portfolio review and strategic relationship planning\",\"Technical meetings\",\"Training sessions\"]', '[1]', 'Monday portfolio reviews set the week\'s priorities and ensure no customer is neglected or overemphasized.', 'The Weekly Customer Success Focus shows \'Monday: Weekly customer portfolio review and strategic relationship planning\', starting the week with strategic planning.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(680, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are focused on Tuesday and Wednesday each week?', '[\"Administrative work\",\"Intensive customer interaction and issue resolution activities\",\"Internal team meetings only\",\"Training and development\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-week is when most customer issues arise and need resolution before week\'s end - block sufficient time for deep engagement.', 'The schedule indicates \'Tuesday-Wednesday: Intensive customer interaction and issue resolution activities\', dedicating mid-week to heavy customer engagement.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(681, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Thursday weekly focus?', '[\"Customer acquisition activities\",\"Technical meetings, deliverable verification, and team coordination\",\"Report writing only\",\"Training sessions only\"]', '[1]', 'Thursday coordination ensures any issues can be addressed before Friday, preventing weekend delays.', 'Thursday\'s focus is \'Technical meetings, deliverable verification, and team coordination\', emphasizing quality assurance and internal alignment.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(682, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are prioritized on Fridays?', '[\"Starting new projects\",\"Customer feedback collection, satisfaction surveys, and performance analysis\",\"Team social activities\",\"Strategic planning for next month\"]', '[1]', 'End-of-week feedback collection catches issues while they\'re fresh and sets the stage for continuous improvement.', 'Friday is designated for \'Customer feedback collection, satisfaction surveys, and performance analysis\', closing the week with evaluation.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(683, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What continuous activity occurs throughout the entire week?', '[\"Training sessions\",\"Continuous project monitoring and proactive customer communication\",\"Administrative paperwork\",\"Team meetings\"]', '[1]', 'While the schedule provides structure, customer needs don\'t follow rigid schedules - remain flexible and responsive throughout the week.', 'The schedule notes \'Throughout Week: Continuous project monitoring and proactive customer communication\', indicating ongoing activities beyond scheduled tasks.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(684, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What monthly excellence initiative occurs in Week 1?', '[\"Budget planning\",\"Monthly customer satisfaction assessment and relationship health evaluation\",\"Team performance reviews\",\"Service delivery analysis only\"]', '[1]', 'Month-start evaluation provides baseline for the month ahead and identifies customers needing attention.', 'Week 1 focuses on \'Monthly customer satisfaction assessment and relationship health evaluation\', starting the month with evaluation.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(685, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus during Week 2 of monthly excellence initiatives?', '[\"Financial reporting\",\"Service delivery analysis and customer success story documentation\",\"New customer acquisition\",\"Technical training\"]', '[1]', 'Success stories serve multiple purposes - learning tools, marketing materials, and morale boosters for the team.', 'Week 2 is dedicated to \'Service delivery analysis and customer success story documentation\', capturing and learning from successful engagements.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(686, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are planned for Week 3 of the monthly cycle?', '[\"Budget reviews\",\"Customer milestone celebrations and loyalty program activities\",\"Technical audits\",\"Recruitment activities\"]', '[1]', 'Milestone celebrations show customers you care about their success beyond just project delivery - personalize these recognitions.', 'Week 3 involves \'Customer milestone celebrations and loyalty program activities\', strengthening emotional bonds with customers.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(687, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens during Week 4 of monthly excellence initiatives?', '[\"Year-end reviews\",\"Monthly reporting, process improvement planning, and strategic preparation\",\"Team building retreats\",\"Customer acquisition campaigns\"]', '[1]', 'Month-end reviews should feed forward into next month\'s plans - identify patterns and adjust strategies accordingly.', 'Week 4 is designated for \'Monthly reporting, process improvement planning, and strategic preparation\', closing the month strategically.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(688, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What defines the daily achievement milestone for customer success?', '[\"Completing all scheduled tasks\",\"All customer communications addressed within service level agreements\",\"Logging all CRM entries\",\"Attending all meetings\"]', '[1]', 'Meeting SLAs daily builds trust and consistency - track response times throughout the day to ensure compliance.', 'The Daily Achievement is defined as \'All customer communications addressed within service level agreements\', setting a clear daily success criterion.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(689, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What constitutes weekly excellence according to customer success milestones?', '[\"Completing all reports on time\",\"Customer satisfaction targets met and project coordination completed effectively\",\"Attending all team meetings\",\"Logging all customer interactions\"]', '[1]', 'Effective coordination means projects progress smoothly without surprises - proactive communication prevents firefighting.', 'Weekly Excellence is achieved when \'Customer satisfaction targets met and project coordination completed effectively\', focusing on outcomes rather than activities.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(690, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'How is monthly success defined in the customer success milestones?', '[\"Completing all assigned tasks\",\"Customer retention goals achieved and comprehensive relationship health maintained\",\"Submitting all reports on time\",\"Meeting all individual KPIs\"]', '[1]', 'Retention is a lagging indicator of relationship health - by the time a customer leaves, it\'s often too late to fix the relationship.', 'Monthly Success is defined as \'Customer retention goals achieved and comprehensive relationship health maintained\', emphasizing long-term relationship quality.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(691, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What defines quarterly leadership in customer success milestones?', '[\"Highest sales in the quarter\",\"Customer success contribution recognized and career development goals advanced\",\"Perfect attendance record\",\"Completing most projects\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly reviews are career development opportunities - document your contributions and discuss growth paths with your manager.', 'Quarterly Leadership is achieved when \'Customer success contribution recognized and career development goals advanced\', linking performance to career growth.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(692, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What peak service delivery period involves thesis submissions and journal deadlines?', '[\"Project Delivery Peaks\",\"Academic Seasons\",\"Customer Onboarding\",\"Issue Resolution Periods\"]', '[1]', 'Track academic calendars and anticipate peak periods - proactive planning prevents being overwhelmed during busy seasons.', 'Academic Seasons are described as requiring \'Enhanced support during thesis submission periods, journal deadline seasons, and academic conference preparation times\'.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(693, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'When do Project Delivery Peaks occur?', '[\"At project initiation\",\"During final deliverable stages and customer approval processes\",\"Mid-project reviews\",\"During planning phases\"]', '[1]', 'Final stages are when quality issues emerge and customer anxiety peaks - increase communication frequency during this period.', 'Project Delivery Peaks are defined as \'Intensive coordination during final deliverable stages and customer approval processes\', when most attention and precision are needed.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(694, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What characterizes Customer Onboarding peak periods?', '[\"Minimal customer interaction\",\"Focused attention during new customer integration and initial service delivery phases\",\"Reduced communication frequency\",\"Automated processes only\"]', '[1]', 'Onboarding sets the tone for the entire relationship - over-invest in communication and support during this critical phase.', 'Customer Onboarding involves \'Focused attention during new customer integration and initial service delivery phases\', recognizing that first impressions are critical.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(695, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What defines Issue Resolution Periods as peak service times?', '[\"Routine maintenance activities\",\"Dedicated support during complex problem resolution requiring customer communication and internal coordination\",\"Regular reporting cycles\",\"Scheduled system updates\"]', '[1]', 'Complex issues require undivided attention - block time for deep work on difficult problems rather than multitasking.', 'Issue Resolution Periods require \'Dedicated support during complex problem resolution requiring customer communication and internal coordination\', emphasizing intensity of problem-solving.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(696, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Immediate Response excellence standard entail?', '[\"Responding within 24 hours\",\"Real-time customer support with proactive communication and anticipatory service\",\"Automated responses only\",\"Scheduled callback system\"]', '[1]', 'Anticipatory service means predicting needs before customers ask - track patterns to anticipate common questions or concerns.', 'Immediate Response is described as \'Real-time customer support with proactive communication and anticipatory service\', going beyond reactive response.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(697, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is emphasized in the Quality Assurance excellence standard?', '[\"Meeting minimum quality thresholds\",\"Continuous monitoring of service delivery quality and customer satisfaction indicators\",\"Periodic spot checks only\",\"Customer complaint tracking only\"]', '[1]', 'Continuous monitoring catches issues early when they\'re easier to fix - don\'t wait for quarterly reviews to identify problems.', 'Quality Assurance involves \'Continuous monitoring of service delivery quality and customer satisfaction indicators\', emphasizing ongoing vigilance.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(698, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What defines Relationship Excellence in the excellence standards framework?', '[\"Maintaining minimum contact\",\"Building long-term customer loyalty through exceptional experience and consistent value delivery\",\"Meeting contractual obligations only\",\"Responding to customer requests\"]', '[1]', 'Loyalty comes from consistently exceeding expectations over time, not from one-time heroic efforts.', 'Relationship Excellence is about \'Building long-term customer loyalty through exceptional experience and consistent value delivery\', focusing on sustained excellence.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(699, 1, 35, 7, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Professional Development excellence standard require?', '[\"Annual training completion\",\"Ongoing skill enhancement to maintain customer service excellence and career advancement readiness\",\"Degree completion\",\"Certification collection\"]', '[1]', 'Continuous learning isn\'t just about formal training - learn from every customer interaction, feedback, and challenge you encounter.', 'Professional Development requires \'Ongoing skill enhancement to maintain customer service excellence and career advancement readiness\', linking learning to performance and career growth.', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 1, '2025-10-08 14:56:33', 0),
(700, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary entity for which this Developer position exists?', '[\"Elysium Technology Private Limited\",\"PhDiZone\",\"Production Department\",\"Development Division\"]', '[1]', 'Remember that PhDiZone is the entity name, while Elysium Technology Private Limited is the parent company.', 'PhDiZone is identified as the entity within Elysium Technology Private Limited. While the company is Elysium Technology, the specific operational entity for this role is PhDiZone, which focuses on academic research and publishing services.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(701, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which level and grade combination describes this Developer position?', '[\"Level 1, Grade IV\",\"Level 2, Grade V\",\"Level 3, Grade V\",\"Level 2, Grade IV\"]', '[1]', 'Level 2 with Grade V suggests this is an intermediate position with growth potential.', 'The document explicitly states the position is Level 2 and Grade V, indicating a mid-level technical position within the organizational hierarchy.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(702, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'To whom does the Developer directly report?', '[\"Production Manager\",\"Development Division Head\",\"Tech Lead \\/ Project Coordinator\",\"Senior Developer\"]', '[2]', 'The dual title \'Tech Lead / Project Coordinator\' indicates the role may report to either position depending on project structure.', 'The Reporting Authority is clearly specified as Tech Lead / Project Coordinator, establishing the direct line of management for this position.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(703, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'What generation classification is assigned to this Developer role?', '[\"Gen 1\",\"Gen 2\",\"Gen 3\",\"Gen 4\"]', '[2]', 'Generation classifications often reflect role evolution; Gen 3 suggests a well-established, mature position.', 'The position is classified as Generation 3 (Gen 3), which likely indicates the evolution or maturity level of the role within PhDiZone\'s organizational structure.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(704, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which department houses this Developer position?', '[\"Technology Department\",\"Research Department\",\"Production Department\",\"Operations Department\"]', '[2]', 'Technical roles in service companies may sit in Production departments to align with service delivery operations.', 'Despite the technical nature of the role, it is positioned within the Production Department, specifically in the Development Division, showing how technical work integrates with service delivery.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(705, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus of PhDiZone\'s technology infrastructure that the Developer supports?', '[\"E-commerce platforms\",\"Academic research and publishing services\",\"Financial systems\",\"Social media applications\"]', '[1]', 'Understanding the academic research context is crucial for aligning technical decisions with user needs.', 'The job role clarity explicitly states that the Developer maintains technology systems that support academic research and publishing services, defining the domain context for all technical work.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(706, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which combination of skills does this position primarily require?', '[\"Marketing and sales expertise\",\"Software development and operational excellence\",\"Academic research and writing\",\"Financial analysis and accounting\"]', '[1]', 'This dual focus means strong coding skills alone aren\'t sufficient—operational awareness is equally important.', 'The role explicitly combines software development expertise with operational excellence to ensure reliable, secure, and efficient technology solutions.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
