(708, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Developer\'s role in maintaining PhDiZone\'s competitive advantage?', '[\"Reducing operational costs only\",\"Managing marketing campaigns\",\"Ensuring technology excellence that impacts service quality and efficiency\",\"Handling customer complaints\"]', '[2]', 'Every technical decision should be evaluated against its impact on service delivery and competitive positioning.', 'The role is described as essential for maintaining PhDiZone\'s competitive advantage through technology excellence, directly impacting service quality, operational efficiency, and the ability to deliver cutting-edge research support tools.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(709, 1, 36, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which teams does the Developer have matrix relationships with?', '[\"Only the Development Division\",\"Content, Research, Sales, and Customer Relationship Teams\",\"Only Sales and Marketing Teams\",\"External vendor teams only\"]', '[1]', 'Success in this role requires strong collaboration skills across multiple business functions.', 'The reporting structure specifies close collaboration with Content Teams, Research Teams, Sales Teams, and Customer Relationship Teams, indicating a highly cross-functional role.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(710, 1, 37, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'What system uptime percentage must the Developer maintain?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"99.9%\",\"100%\"]', '[3]', '100% uptime is an aspirational target requiring proactive monitoring and rapid response to any issues.', 'Under System Reliability & Infrastructure Management, the Developer must monitor systems to ensure 100% system uptime, representing an extremely high availability requirement.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
(711, 1, 37, 8, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should the Developer handle immediate system issues?', '[\"Wait for scheduled maintenance windows\",\"Resolve through proactive monitoring\",\"Escalate all issues to senior management\",\"Document and resolve next day\"]', '[1]', 'Proactive monitoring tools and alerting systems are essential for catching issues before they impact users.', 'The role explicitly requires resolving immediate bugs, performance issues, and system failures through proactive monitoring, emphasizing preventive rather than reactive approaches.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 1, '2025-10-08 15:13:03', 0),
