(879, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Weekly Strategic Focus of the Leadership Excellence Framework?', '[\"Weekly financial reviews\",\"Comprehensive team development and operational optimization\",\"Weekly marketing analysis\",\"Weekly technology updates\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly focus balances people development with operational optimization.', 'Weekly Strategic Focus emphasizes comprehensive team development and operational optimization, ensuring continuous improvement at the weekly level.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(880, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What characterizes Monthly Innovation in the Leadership Excellence Framework?', '[\"Monthly budget reviews\",\"Strategic improvements and business development initiatives\",\"Monthly client reports\",\"Monthly team events\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly innovation means systematic implementation of strategic improvements and growth initiatives.', 'Monthly Innovation focuses on strategic improvements and business development initiatives, driving growth and innovation monthly.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(881, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is emphasized in Quarterly Vision of the Leadership Excellence Framework?', '[\"Quarterly financial statements\",\"Long-term strategic planning and organizational capability building\",\"Quarterly performance bonuses\",\"Quarterly client surveys\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly vision is about the big picture—strategic direction and building lasting capabilities.', 'Quarterly Vision emphasizes long-term strategic planning and organizational capability building, maintaining long-term perspective.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(882, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What periods see intensive coordination according to Academic Publishing Cycles?', '[\"January and July\",\"Quarterly and special issue publication periods\",\"Monthly deadlines\",\"Weekly submission windows\"]', '[1]', 'Academic publishing has natural cycles—plan intensive efforts around quarterly and special publications.', 'Journal Publication Deadlines require intensive coordination during quarterly and special issue publication periods, aligning with academic cycles.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(883, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'When is enhanced management required according to Academic Publishing Cycles?', '[\"During summer months\",\"During peak review periods and academic conference submission deadlines\",\"At fiscal year end\",\"During holiday periods\"]', '[1]', 'Academic conferences drive submission peaks—anticipate and prepare for these busy periods.', 'Peer Review Seasons require enhanced management during peak review periods and academic conference submission deadlines.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(884, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities intensify during Indexing Periods in the academic cycle?', '[\"Marketing campaigns\",\"Focused activities during indexing application and renewal cycles\",\"Financial planning\",\"Team recruitment\"]', '[1]', 'Indexing cycles are strategic windows—prepare thoroughly for applications and renewals.', 'Indexing Periods require focused activities during indexing application and renewal cycles, critical for journal visibility and credibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(885, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens during Academic Conference Seasons?', '[\"Internal team training\",\"Strategic relationship building during major academic conferences and professional gatherings\",\"Budget planning\",\"Technology upgrades\"]', '[1]', 'Conferences are networking goldmines—use them strategically for relationship building.', 'Academic Conference Seasons focus on strategic relationship building during major academic conferences and professional gatherings.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(886, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What defines Operational Leadership in Performance Excellence Standards?', '[\"Meeting minimum standards\",\"Daily demonstration of excellence in team coordination and manuscript quality management\",\"Weekly reporting compliance\",\"Monthly target achievement\"]', '[1]', 'Excellence must be demonstrated daily—it\'s not occasional but consistent behavior.', 'Operational Leadership requires daily demonstration of excellence in team coordination and manuscript quality management, setting high daily standards.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(887, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Strategic Contribution emphasize in Performance Excellence Standards?', '[\"Short-term tactical wins\",\"Continuous advancement of PhDiZone\'s position in academic publishing markets\",\"Individual performance\",\"Cost reduction\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic contribution is about market position—continuously advance PhDiZone\'s standing.', 'Strategic Contribution focuses on continuous advancement of PhDiZone\'s position in academic publishing markets, driving long-term competitive advantage.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(888, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What characterizes Quality Excellence in Performance Excellence Standards?', '[\"Meeting minimum quality thresholds\",\"Unwavering commitment to academic publishing standards and ethical compliance\",\"Occasional quality audits\",\"Basic compliance checking\"]', '[1]', 'Quality commitment must be unwavering—no shortcuts or compromises on standards or ethics.', 'Quality Excellence requires unwavering commitment to academic publishing standards and ethical compliance, showing non-negotiable quality standards.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(889, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Innovation Leadership drive in Performance Excellence Standards?', '[\"Technology vendor relationships\",\"Proactive development of processes and relationships that drive organizational growth and market leadership\",\"Cost-saving initiatives\",\"Employee satisfaction\"]', '[1]', 'Innovation leadership is proactive—don\'t wait for problems, actively create improvements.', 'Innovation Leadership emphasizes proactive development of processes and relationships that drive organizational growth and market leadership.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(890, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the immediate leadership objective for 0-6 months?', '[\"Expand journal portfolio\",\"Establish operational excellence while building cohesive, high-performing team culture\",\"Develop new markets\",\"Implement new technology\"]', '[1]', 'First six months: focus on operational excellence and team culture foundation.', 'The immediate 0-6 month objective is establishing operational excellence in journal management while building a cohesive, high-performing team culture.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(891, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What areas of focus are included in immediate leadership objectives?', '[\"Market expansion and revenue growth\",\"Optimizing manuscript workflows, implementing quality standards, and developing team capabilities\",\"Technology modernization\",\"Client acquisition strategies\"]', '[1]', 'Three initial priorities: workflows, standards, and people—build strong operational foundations.', 'Focus areas include optimizing manuscript workflows, implementing quality standards, and developing team capabilities that support PhDiZone\'s reputation.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(892, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What role evolution occurs in medium-term development (6-18 months)?', '[\"Transition to financial management\",\"Evolution into strategic journal operations leader with expertise in publishing trends and technology innovation\",\"Move to marketing leadership\",\"Shift to client services management\"]', '[1]', '6-18 months: transition from operational to strategic leadership with deep expertise.', 'Medium-term development involves evolution into a strategic journal operations leader with deep expertise in academic publishing trends, technology innovation, and market development.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(893, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What expands during medium-term strategic development?', '[\"Team size and budget\",\"Role expands to include strategic partnership negotiations and advanced quality management systems\",\"Office locations\",\"Service pricing\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term expansion: add strategic partnerships and advanced quality systems to responsibilities.', 'The role expands to include strategic partnership negotiations, advanced quality management systems, and contribution to PhDiZone\'s positioning as a leader.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(894, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What career advancement opportunities exist long-term (18+ months)?', '[\"Lateral moves to other departments\",\"Progression to Journal Manager, Publishing Operations Director, or Academic Services Director positions\",\"Transition to consulting roles\",\"International assignments\"]', '[1]', 'Long-term career path: upward progression to Director-level positions in academic publishing.', 'Long-term progression opportunities include Journal Manager, Publishing Operations Director, or Academic Services Director positions.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(895, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What foundation does this role provide for future careers?', '[\"Technology management expertise\",\"Foundation for senior leadership in academic publishing, editorial management, or specialized roles in scholarly communication\",\"Financial management skills\",\"Marketing and sales experience\"]', '[1]', 'This role builds a strong foundation for senior academic publishing leadership careers.', 'The role provides excellent foundation for senior leadership in academic publishing, editorial management, or specialized roles in scholarly communication and research publication strategy.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(896, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is fundamental about this position\'s organizational impact?', '[\"It generates the highest revenue\",\"It ensures PhDiZone maintains competitive edge through operational excellence, quality leadership, and innovation\",\"It has the largest team\",\"It manages the biggest budget\"]', '[1]', 'This role is strategically fundamental—it directly maintains PhDiZone\'s competitive advantage.', 'The position is fundamental to PhDiZone\'s core competency in academic publishing, ensuring the organization maintains its competitive edge through operational excellence, quality leadership, and innovation.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(897, 1, 42, 9, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does this role directly influence in the academic community?', '[\"Research funding decisions\",\"PhDiZone\'s reputation while supporting sustainable growth in publishing services\",\"Academic hiring decisions\",\"University rankings\"]', '[1]', 'Reputation impact is direct—every action affects how the academic community views PhDiZone.', 'The role directly influences PhDiZone\'s reputation in the academic community and supports sustainable growth in publishing services.', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 1, '2025-10-08 15:32:48', 0),
(898, 1, 27, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the official company name for PhDiZone\'s parent organization?', '[\"PhDiZone Technology Limited\",\"Elysium Technology Private Limited\",\"Elysium Publishing Services\",\"PhDiZone Academic Services\"]', '[1]', 'Remember that PhDiZone is the entity/brand name, while Elysium Technology is the legal company structure.', 'According to the job role document, PhDiZone operates under the parent company Elysium Technology Private Limited, as stated in the company field of the document header.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(899, 1, 27, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which department does the Journal Coordinator position belong to?', '[\"Editorial Management Department\",\"Internal Management Department\",\"Publishing Operations Department\",\"Quality Assurance Department\"]', '[1]', 'Focus on the organizational hierarchy: Company → Entity → Department → Division → Position.', 'The position is explicitly stated to be within the Internal Management Department, specifically in the Journal Division, as shown in the document header.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(900, 1, 27, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the grade level assigned to the Journal Coordinator position?', '[\"Grade III\",\"Grade IV\",\"Grade V\",\"Grade VI\"]', '[2]', 'Grade V positions typically represent mid-level operational roles with significant responsibility.', 'The document clearly states that the Journal Coordinator position is classified as Grade V, which corresponds to Level 2 in the organizational structure.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(901, 1, 27, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'To whom does the Journal Coordinator directly report?', '[\"Editorial Manager\",\"Journal Coordinator Team Lead or Journal Manager\",\"Internal Management Director\",\"Quality Assurance Manager\"]', '[1]', 'Understanding reporting lines is crucial for knowing escalation paths and accountability structures.', 'The reporting authority section explicitly states that the Journal Coordinator reports to either the Journal Coordinator Team Lead or the Journal Manager.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(902, 1, 27, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What generation classification is assigned to this role?', '[\"Gen 1\",\"Gen 2\",\"Gen 3\",\"Gen 4\"]', '[2]', 'Generation classifications often indicate role complexity and evolution within organizational structures.', 'The document identifies this position as Generation 3 (Gen 3), indicating its place in the organizational evolution or role maturity framework.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(903, 1, 27, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which division specifically houses the Journal Coordinator role?', '[\"Editorial Division\",\"Publication Division\",\"Journal Division\",\"Manuscript Division\"]', '[2]', 'The division name directly relates to the primary focus area of the role\'s responsibilities.', 'The document explicitly states that the position is within the Journal Division of the Internal Management Department.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(904, 1, 27, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the level designation for the Journal Coordinator position?', '[\"Level 1\",\"Level 2\",\"Level 3\",\"Senior Level\"]', '[1]', 'Level 2 typically indicates an experienced operational role with moderate autonomy and accountability.', 'The document clearly indicates that this is a Level 2 position, which correlates with its Grade V classification and operational responsibilities.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(905, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary function of the Journal Coordinator role?', '[\"Managing author relationships exclusively\",\"Managing day-to-day operations of journal manuscript processing, editorial coordination, and publication workflows\",\"Conducting peer reviews of manuscripts\",\"Marketing journal publications\"]', '[1]', 'The role is fundamentally operational and coordination-focused, not editorial or marketing-focused.', 'The job role clarity section explicitly defines the Journal Coordinator as responsible for managing daily operations across manuscript processing, editorial coordination, and publication workflows.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(906, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which activity is NOT part of the Manuscript Processing & Quality Management responsibilities?', '[\"Checking formatting compliance\",\"Conducting plagiarism checks\",\"Writing peer reviews\",\"Updating manuscript status on software platforms\"]', '[2]', 'Distinguish between coordination activities (what coordinators do) and content creation activities (what experts do).', 'While the role involves coordinating peer reviews, actually writing reviews is the responsibility of reviewers, not the Journal Coordinator. The coordinator checks compliance, conducts plagiarism verification, and updates status.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(907, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the target processing accuracy for manuscript formatting verification?', '[\"95% accuracy\",\"98% accuracy\",\"99% accuracy\",\"100% accuracy\"]', '[2]', '99% accuracy allows for minimal human error while maintaining exceptionally high quality standards.', 'The KPI for Processing Accuracy explicitly states: \'Achieve 99% accuracy in manuscript formatting verification and initial quality assessments.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(908, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Within what timeframe should initial manuscript processing be completed 95% of the time?', '[\"24 hours\",\"48 hours\",\"72 hours\",\"96 hours\"]', '[1]', 'The 48-hour window balances quality verification needs with author expectations for prompt processing.', 'The Processing Speed KPI states: \'Complete initial manuscript processing within 48 hours of submission 95% of the time.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(909, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'How quickly should reviewer assignments be completed after manuscript acceptance?', '[\"Within 12 hours\",\"Within 24 hours\",\"Within 48 hours\",\"Within 72 hours\"]', '[1]', 'Quick reviewer assignment is critical to maintaining competitive publication timelines.', 'The Editorial Efficiency KPI specifies: \'Complete reviewer assignments within 24 hours of manuscript acceptance for review.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(910, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the target response time for author and stakeholder queries during business days?', '[\"2 hours\",\"4 hours\",\"6 hours\",\"8 hours\"]', '[1]', 'Four-hour response time demonstrates professionalism while allowing time for thorough research if needed.', 'The Response Time KPI clearly states: \'Respond to author and stakeholder queries within 4 hours during business days.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(911, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum author satisfaction rate must be maintained with submission and revision processes?', '[\"85%\",\"90%\",\"95%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', 'High author satisfaction directly impacts journal reputation and submission rates.', 'The Author Satisfaction KPI specifies: \'Maintain ≥ 95% author satisfaction rate with submission and revision processes.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(912, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which compliance standard must achieve 100% adherence?', '[\"Formatting standards only\",\"Academic publishing ethics and plagiarism prevention standards\",\"Communication protocols only\",\"Reporting deadlines only\"]', '[1]', 'Ethical compliance is non-negotiable in academic publishing and must be absolute.', 'The Ethical Compliance KPI states: \'Achieve 100% compliance with academic publishing ethics and plagiarism prevention standards.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(913, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the required pass rate for internal and external quality audits?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\",\"99%\"]', '[2]', 'Perfect audit compliance ensures organizational credibility and process reliability.', 'The Quality Audits KPI explicitly requires: \'Pass 100% of internal and external quality audits for manuscript processing procedures.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(914, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What average turnaround time should be achieved for initial peer reviews?', '[\"\\u2264 7 days\",\"\\u2264 10 days\",\"\\u2264 14 days\",\"\\u2264 21 days\"]', '[2]', 'Two-week review cycles balance thorough evaluation with competitive publication timelines.', 'The Review Timeline Management KPI specifies: \'Achieve ≤ 14 days average turnaround time for initial peer reviews.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(915, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What reviewer response rate must be maintained for assigned reviews?', '[\"85%\",\"90%\",\"95%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', 'High reviewer engagement requires strategic selection, clear communication, and relationship management.', 'The Reviewer Coordination KPI states: \'Maintain 95% reviewer response rate and engagement in assigned reviews.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(916, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of journal-specific formatting requirements must be maintained?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[3]', 'Complete compliance with formatting standards is essential for publication readiness and professional presentation.', 'The Quality Standards KPI requires: \'Maintain 100% compliance with journal-specific formatting and submission requirements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(917, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which responsibility involves conducting plagiarism checks?', '[\"Editorial & Reviewer Coordination\",\"Manuscript Processing & Quality Management\",\"Author & Stakeholder Communication\",\"Process Coordination & Workflow Management\"]', '[1]', 'Plagiarism verification is a fundamental quality control step in manuscript processing.', 'The document explicitly lists \'Conduct plagiarism checks and ensure originality verification for all submitted manuscripts\' under Manuscript Processing & Quality Management responsibilities.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(918, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Who does the Journal Coordinator assign manuscripts to during the review process?', '[\"Only editors\",\"Only peer reviewers\",\"Appropriate editors and peer reviewers based on expertise and availability\",\"Production team members\"]', '[2]', 'Matching expertise to manuscript content ensures quality reviews and efficient processing.', 'The Editorial & Reviewer Coordination section states: \'Assign manuscript submissions to appropriate editors and peer reviewers based on expertise and availability.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(919, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of reporting must be maintained with 100% accuracy?', '[\"Monthly performance reports\",\"Quarterly strategic reports\",\"Daily manuscript tracking and status reporting\",\"Annual compliance reports\"]', '[2]', 'Daily accuracy prevents compounding errors and ensures reliable operational data.', 'The Documentation Accuracy KPI specifies: \'Maintain 100% accuracy in daily manuscript tracking and status reporting.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(920, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the annual target for workflow efficiency improvement?', '[\"5% improvement\",\"10% improvement\",\"15% improvement\",\"20% improvement\"]', '[1]', 'Continuous 10% annual improvement demonstrates meaningful operational advancement.', 'The Workflow Efficiency KPI states: \'Contribute to 10% improvement in overall journal processing efficiency annually.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(921, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'How often should comprehensive weekly and monthly reports be delivered?', '[\"90% on time\",\"95% on time\",\"100% on time\",\"As needed\"]', '[2]', 'Timely reporting is critical for management decision-making and operational transparency.', 'The Reporting Quality KPI requires: \'Deliver comprehensive, accurate weekly and monthly reports 100% on time.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(922, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which activity is part of Quality Control & Compliance Management?', '[\"Assigning reviewers to manuscripts\",\"Ensuring ethical compliance including proper attribution and conflict of interest disclosure\",\"Coordinating with production teams\",\"Building relationships with indexing agencies\"]', '[1]', 'Ethical compliance encompasses multiple dimensions including attribution, conflicts, and research conduct.', 'The Quality Control & Compliance Management section explicitly includes: \'Ensure ethical compliance including proper attribution, conflict of interest disclosure, and research ethics.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(923, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Journal Coordinator provide to authors regarding revisions?', '[\"Brief status updates only\",\"Clear guidance on revision requirements and publication processes\",\"Technical editing services\",\"Peer review content\"]', '[1]', 'Clear guidance reduces author confusion and improves manuscript quality through proper revisions.', 'The Author & Stakeholder Communication section states: \'Provide clear guidance to authors on revision requirements and publication processes.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(924, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of meetings should the Journal Coordinator participate in actively?', '[\"Monthly board meetings\",\"Weekly team review meetings and collaborative planning sessions\",\"Quarterly strategic planning sessions\",\"Annual performance reviews\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly participation ensures continuous alignment and collaborative problem-solving.', 'The Process Coordination & Workflow Management section specifies: \'Participate actively in weekly team review meetings and collaborative planning sessions.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(925, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be documented and maintained for audit compliance?', '[\"Only final publication versions\",\"Workflow processes and organized filing systems\",\"Author contact information only\",\"Financial records only\"]', '[1]', 'Organized documentation enables audit readiness and process improvement analysis.', 'The Documentation & Reporting section states: \'Document workflow processes and maintain organized filing systems for audit compliance.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(926, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'With which teams should the Journal Coordinator coordinate for publication scheduling?', '[\"Marketing teams\",\"Production teams\",\"Finance teams\",\"IT teams\"]', '[1]', 'Production coordination ensures manuscripts move smoothly from acceptance to publication.', 'The Process Coordination & Workflow Management section specifies: \'Coordinate with production teams for upcoming publication scheduling and resource planning.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(927, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of relationship building is part of the coordinator\'s responsibilities?', '[\"Building relationships only with authors\",\"Building professional relationships with authors, reviewers, editors, and indexing agencies\",\"Building relationships only with management\",\"No relationship building required\"]', '[1]', 'Multi-stakeholder relationships create a robust network that supports journal quality and growth.', 'The Relationship Management & Portfolio Development section states: \'Build and maintain professional relationships with authors, reviewers, editors, and indexing agencies.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(928, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the coordinator contribute to regarding PhDiZone\'s publishing network?', '[\"Financial planning\",\"Marketing campaigns\",\"Stakeholder relationship building that enhances PhDiZone\'s publishing network\",\"IT infrastructure\"]', '[2]', 'Network building expands opportunities for collaboration and portfolio growth.', 'The Relationship Management section includes: \'Contribute to stakeholder relationship building that enhances PhDiZone\'s publishing network.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(929, 1, 43, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of standards must the coordinator maintain comprehensive formatting for?', '[\"General academic standards only\",\"Journal-specific requirements\",\"Personal preference standards\",\"Industry generic standards\"]', '[1]', 'Each journal has unique formatting requirements that must be rigorously followed.', 'The Manuscript Processing section states: \'Maintain comprehensive formatting standards and ensure adherence to journal-specific requirements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(930, 1, 44, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many Key Result Areas (KRAs) are defined for the Journal Coordinator role?', '[\"3\",\"4\",\"5\",\"6\"]', '[2]', 'The five KRAs cover the full spectrum of responsibilities from processing to relationship management.', 'The document lists exactly five KRAs: Manuscript Quality & Processing Excellence, Editorial Coordination & Review Management, Communication & Customer Service Excellence, Compliance & Quality Assurance, and Process Efficiency & Workflow Optimization.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(931, 1, 44, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus of the \'Manuscript Quality & Processing Excellence\' KRA?', '[\"Building author relationships\",\"Ensuring exceptional quality in manuscript processing while maintaining efficient workflows\",\"Managing financial resources\",\"Marketing journal publications\"]', '[1]', 'This KRA balances quality and efficiency, both critical to publication success.', 'The KRA description states: \'Ensure exceptional quality in manuscript processing while maintaining efficient workflows that support timely publication outcomes.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(932, 1, 44, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the goal of the \'Editorial Coordination & Review Management\' KRA?', '[\"Write editorial content\",\"Facilitate smooth coordination between authors, editors, and reviewers to optimize peer review and timelines\",\"Manage subscription services\",\"Design journal layouts\"]', '[1]', 'Coordination efficiency directly impacts publication speed and stakeholder satisfaction.', 'The KRA explicitly states: \'Facilitate smooth coordination between authors, editors, and reviewers to optimize the peer review process and publication timelines.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(933, 1, 44, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What satisfaction rating target must be achieved for communication quality?', '[\"\\u2265 4.0\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.5\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 4.8\\/5.0\",\"\\u2265 5.0\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', 'A 4.8/5.0 rating represents consistently excellent communication with minimal room for dissatisfaction.', 'The Communication Quality KPI specifies: \'Achieve ≥ 4.8/5.0 satisfaction rating for communication clarity and professionalism.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(934, 1, 44, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the objective of the \'Compliance & Quality Assurance\' KRA?', '[\"Increase submission volume\",\"Maintain rigorous adherence to academic publishing standards, ethical guidelines, and quality requirements\",\"Reduce operational costs\",\"Expand journal portfolio\"]', '[1]', 'Compliance is non-negotiable in academic publishing and protects institutional integrity.', 'The KRA description states: \'Maintain rigorous adherence to academic publishing standards, ethical guidelines, and quality requirements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(935, 1, 44, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the \'Process Efficiency & Workflow Optimization\' KRA aim to support?', '[\"Revenue generation\",\"Continuous improvement in journal operations through effective documentation, reporting, and process coordination\",\"Marketing effectiveness\",\"Staffing efficiency\"]', '[1]', 'Continuous improvement requires systematic documentation and analysis of processes.', 'The KRA states: \'Support continuous improvement in journal operations through effective documentation, reporting, and process coordination.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(936, 1, 44, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the target for maintaining adherence to citation standards?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[3]', 'Citation and formatting standards must be perfect to ensure publication credibility.', 'The Standards Adherence KPI requires: \'Maintain 100% adherence to citation standards and academic formatting requirements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(937, 1, 44, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which KRA specifically addresses author experience and stakeholder satisfaction?', '[\"Manuscript Quality & Processing Excellence\",\"Editorial Coordination & Review Management\",\"Communication & Customer Service Excellence\",\"Process Efficiency & Workflow Optimization\"]', '[2]', 'Customer service excellence in academic publishing centers on clear, professional communication.', 'The \'Communication & Customer Service Excellence\' KRA is described as: \'Provide outstanding communication and support services that enhance author experience and stakeholder satisfaction.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(938, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is included in daily reports that the Journal Coordinator must maintain?', '[\"Financial summaries\",\"Manuscript processing updates, submission status tracking, and critical issue notifications\",\"Marketing metrics\",\"IT system performance\"]', '[1]', 'Daily reports focus on operational status and urgent issues requiring immediate attention.', 'The Daily Reports requirement states: \'Manuscript processing updates, submission status tracking, and critical issue notifications.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(939, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should weekly reports include?', '[\"Annual strategic plans\",\"Editorial coordination summaries, author communication logs, and workflow performance metrics\",\"Budget forecasts\",\"Hiring recommendations\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reports provide mid-level oversight of coordination effectiveness and workflow trends.', 'The Weekly Reports section specifies: \'Editorial coordination summaries, author communication logs, and workflow performance metrics.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(940, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the content focus of monthly reports?', '[\"Daily operational issues\",\"Comprehensive operational analysis, quality metrics assessment, and process improvement recommendations\",\"Individual performance reviews\",\"Technology upgrades\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly reports provide strategic insight and drive continuous improvement initiatives.', 'The Monthly Reports requirement states: \'Comprehensive operational analysis, quality metrics assessment, and process improvement recommendations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(941, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which teams does the Journal Coordinator have collaborative relationships with?', '[\"Only Editorial Teams\",\"Editorial Teams, Production Teams, Quality Assurance, and Client Service Teams\",\"Only Management Teams\",\"Only Production Teams\"]', '[1]', 'Cross-functional collaboration ensures seamless manuscript flow from submission to publication.', 'The Collaborative Relationships section explicitly lists: \'Regular coordination with Editorial Teams, Production Teams, Quality Assurance, and Client Service Teams.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(942, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the coordinator\'s level of operational accountability?', '[\"Partial responsibility for assigned tasks\",\"Full responsibility for assigned manuscript portfolios and editorial coordination activities\",\"Shared accountability with team members\",\"No direct accountability\"]', '[1]', 'Full accountability means the coordinator owns outcomes for their assigned work.', 'The Operational Accountability section states: \'Full responsibility for assigned manuscript portfolios and editorial coordination activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(943, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the performance measurement framework focused on?', '[\"Revenue generation only\",\"Operational excellence, quality standards, and stakeholder satisfaction\",\"Cost reduction only\",\"Marketing effectiveness only\"]', '[1]', 'Performance is holistically measured across operations, quality, and relationships.', 'The Performance Measurement Framework states: \'Performance evaluation focuses on operational excellence, quality standards, and stakeholder satisfaction.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(944, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'How is performance monitoring conducted?', '[\"Annual reviews only\",\"Continuous monitoring through manuscript processing metrics, author feedback, and editorial coordination effectiveness\",\"Quarterly surveys only\",\"Peer reviews only\"]', '[1]', 'Continuous monitoring enables real-time performance adjustment and improvement.', 'The document states: \'The Journal Coordinator undergoes continuous performance monitoring through manuscript processing metrics, author feedback, and editorial coordination effectiveness assessments.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(945, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Quality Excellence Framework include for daily standards?', '[\"Monthly review cycles\",\"Consistent adherence to manuscript processing quality and editorial coordination excellence\",\"Annual strategic goals\",\"Quarterly planning sessions\"]', '[1]', 'Daily standards ensure consistent quality delivery regardless of workload fluctuations.', 'The Daily Standards section states: \'Consistent adherence to manuscript processing quality and editorial coordination excellence.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(946, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is assessed in weekly reviews according to the Quality Excellence Framework?', '[\"Financial performance\",\"Regular assessment of workflow efficiency and stakeholder satisfaction\",\"Marketing effectiveness\",\"Technology adoption\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly assessments catch issues early and enable rapid course correction.', 'The Weekly Reviews section specifies: \'Regular assessment of workflow efficiency and stakeholder satisfaction.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(947, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does monthly analysis in the Quality Excellence Framework evaluate?', '[\"Individual task completion only\",\"Comprehensive evaluation of process improvements and professional development progress\",\"Budget adherence only\",\"Technology system uptime\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly analysis links operational improvements to professional growth trajectory.', 'The Monthly Analysis section states: \'Comprehensive evaluation of process improvements and professional development progress.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(948, 1, 45, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of quarterly planning in the Quality Excellence Framework?', '[\"Daily task management\",\"Strategic contribution to journal operations optimization and career advancement planning\",\"Immediate issue resolution\",\"Weekly scheduling\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly planning balances organizational needs with individual career development.', 'The Quarterly Planning section specifies: \'Strategic contribution to journal operations optimization and career advancement planning.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(949, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the timeline for Immediate Development Objectives?', '[\"0-3 months\",\"0-6 months\",\"0-9 months\",\"0-12 months\"]', '[1]', 'The first six months focus on mastering core systems and building foundational relationships.', 'The document explicitly states \'Immediate Development Objectives (0-6 months)\' as the timeframe for establishing initial expertise.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(950, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus during the 0-6 month period?', '[\"Leadership development\",\"Establishing expertise in academic publishing operations while building proficiency in manuscript management systems\",\"Strategic planning\",\"Mentoring others\"]', '[1]', 'Initial months prioritize technical proficiency and process mastery.', 'The Immediate Development Objectives state: \'The Journal Coordinator will establish expertise in academic publishing operations while building proficiency in manuscript management systems and editorial coordination processes.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(951, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the timeframe for Medium-term Growth objectives?', '[\"3-12 months\",\"6-18 months\",\"12-24 months\",\"18-36 months\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term growth spans one to one-and-a-half years of progressive development.', 'The document clearly states \'Medium-term Growth (6-18 months)\' as the timeframe for evolution into senior specialist status.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(952, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What role evolution is expected during medium-term growth?', '[\"Transition to management\",\"Evolution into a senior journal operations specialist with advanced expertise and mentoring responsibilities\",\"Lateral move to different department\",\"Reduction in responsibilities\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term growth adds mentorship and specialization to core competencies.', 'The Medium-term Growth section states: \'Evolution into a senior journal operations specialist with advanced expertise in editorial processes and stakeholder management. The role will expand to include mentoring responsibilities for new coordinators, specialized knowledge in specific academic disciplines, and contribution to process improvement initiatives.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(953, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'When do Long-term Career Advancement opportunities begin?', '[\"After 12 months\",\"After 15 months\",\"After 18 months\",\"After 24 months\"]', '[2]', 'Long-term advancement requires demonstrating sustained excellence beyond the initial 18 months.', 'The document states \'Long-term Career Advancement (18+ months)\' indicating opportunities begin after 18 months.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(954, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which positions are mentioned as potential progression opportunities?', '[\"Senior Editor or Publisher\",\"Journal Coordinator Team Lead, Editorial Manager, or Academic Publishing Manager\",\"Marketing Manager or Sales Director\",\"IT Manager or Systems Administrator\"]', '[1]', 'Career paths lead toward leadership roles within editorial and publishing management.', 'The Long-term Career Advancement section states: \'Progression opportunities include Journal Coordinator Team Lead, Editorial Manager, or Academic Publishing Manager positions.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(955, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What career foundation does this role provide?', '[\"Technical IT careers\",\"Marketing and sales careers\",\"Careers in academic publishing, editorial management, or specialized roles in scholarly communication\",\"Finance and accounting careers\"]', '[2]', 'This role builds specialized expertise valuable across the academic publishing industry.', 'The document states: \'The role provides excellent foundation for careers in academic publishing, editorial management, or specialized roles in scholarly communication and research publication.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(956, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What time is designated for daily manuscript queue review?', '[\"8:00 AM - 9:00 AM\",\"9:00 AM - 9:30 AM\",\"9:30 AM - 10:00 AM\",\"10:00 AM - 10:30 AM\"]', '[1]', 'Starting the day with queue review ensures proper prioritization of tasks.', 'The Daily Editorial Operations schedule shows: \'9:00 AM - 9:30 AM: Daily manuscript queue review and priority setting.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(957, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'When does new manuscript processing occur in the daily schedule?', '[\"9:00 AM - 11:00 AM\",\"9:30 AM - 11:30 AM\",\"10:00 AM - 12:00 PM\",\"11:00 AM - 1:00 PM\"]', '[1]', 'The morning period is allocated for detail-intensive manuscript processing work.', 'The schedule states: \'9:30 AM - 11:30 AM: New manuscript processing including formatting checks and plagiarism verification.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(958, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur from 11:30 AM to 12:30 PM?', '[\"Quality control activities\",\"Editorial and reviewer coordination including assignments and follow-ups\",\"Documentation updates\",\"Team meetings\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-day coordination ensures reviewers and editors receive timely communications.', 'The schedule specifies: \'11:30 AM - 12:30 PM: Editorial and reviewer coordination including assignments and follow-ups.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(959, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'When are author communication activities scheduled?', '[\"Morning sessions only\",\"1:30 PM - 3:00 PM\",\"3:00 PM - 4:30 PM\",\"End of day only\"]', '[1]', 'Afternoon slots for author communication allow for processing of morning submissions.', 'The Daily Editorial Operations schedule shows: \'1:30 PM - 3:00 PM: Author communication activities including queries, revisions, and status updates.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(960, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the designated time for quality control activities?', '[\"Morning\",\"Midday\",\"3:00 PM - 4:30 PM\",\"End of day\"]', '[2]', 'Late afternoon quality control ensures all day\'s work meets standards before close.', 'The schedule states: \'3:00 PM - 4:30 PM: Quality control activities including manuscript review and compliance checking.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(961, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'When does documentation and reporting occur daily?', '[\"Start of day\",\"Mid-morning\",\"Mid-afternoon\",\"4:30 PM - 5:30 PM\"]', '[3]', 'End-of-day documentation captures the complete daily operational picture.', 'The schedule shows: \'4:30 PM - 5:30 PM: Documentation updates, system maintenance, and daily reporting.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(962, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus on Mondays according to Weekly Operational Excellence?', '[\"Quality control\",\"Weekly planning and team coordination meetings for manuscript workflow optimization\",\"Reporting activities\",\"Author communication\"]', '[1]', 'Mondays set the strategic direction and priorities for the entire week.', 'The Weekly Operational Excellence section states: \'Monday: Weekly planning and team coordination meetings for manuscript workflow optimization.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(963, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities dominate Tuesday and Wednesday?', '[\"Strategic planning sessions\",\"Intensive manuscript processing and editorial coordination activities\",\"Training sessions\",\"Performance reviews\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-week days focus on high-volume operational execution.', 'The document states: \'Tuesday-Wednesday: Intensive manuscript processing and editorial coordination activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(964, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is Thursday\'s primary focus?', '[\"New manuscript processing\",\"Team meetings\",\"Quality control focus including compliance reviews and process improvement activities\",\"Strategic planning\"]', '[2]', 'Thursday\'s quality focus ensures weekly work meets all standards and identifies improvements.', 'The schedule specifies: \'Thursday: Quality control focus including compliance reviews and process improvement activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(965, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens on Fridays in the weekly schedule?', '[\"New project starts\",\"Reporting activities, stakeholder updates, and weekly performance analysis\",\"Training sessions\",\"Team building activities\"]', '[1]', 'Friday reporting closes the week\'s loop and informs next week\'s planning.', 'The document states: \'Friday: Reporting activities, stakeholder updates, and weekly performance analysis.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(966, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What occurs throughout the entire week according to the schedule?', '[\"Strategic planning only\",\"Continuous author support and real-time manuscript status management\",\"Training sessions only\",\"External meetings only\"]', '[1]', 'Ongoing author support maintains satisfaction regardless of other scheduled activities.', 'The schedule explicitly states: \'Throughout Week: Continuous author support and real-time manuscript status management.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(967, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What occurs during Week 1 of Monthly Strategic Activities?', '[\"Team building\",\"Monthly performance analysis and quality audit activities\",\"Budget planning\",\"Strategic planning\"]', '[1]', 'Month-start analysis establishes baseline performance for the monthly cycle.', 'The Monthly Strategic Activities section states: \'Week 1: Monthly performance analysis and quality audit activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(968, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of Week 2 in monthly activities?', '[\"Quality audits\",\"Process improvement implementation and workflow optimization projects\",\"Performance reviews\",\"Budget analysis\"]', '[1]', 'Week 2 implements improvements identified in Week 1 analysis.', 'The document specifies: \'Week 2: Process improvement implementation and workflow optimization projects.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(969, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens during Week 3 of monthly activities?', '[\"Quality control only\",\"Stakeholder relationship building and professional development activities\",\"Manuscript processing only\",\"Reporting only\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-month focus on relationships and development balances operational and growth activities.', 'The schedule shows: \'Week 3: Stakeholder relationship building and professional development activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(970, 1, 31, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of Week 4 in monthly strategic activities?', '[\"New project initiation\",\"Team building events\",\"Comprehensive reporting, portfolio analysis, and strategic planning support\",\"Training programs\"]', '[2]', 'Month-end activities synthesize the month\'s work and inform future planning.', 'The document states: \'Week 4: Comprehensive reporting, portfolio analysis, and strategic planning support.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(971, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'When do Submission Peak Periods occur?', '[\"During summer months\",\"During academic calendar peak submission seasons\",\"During holiday periods\",\"Year-round uniformly\"]', '[1]', 'Academic calendars drive submission patterns, requiring flexible capacity management.', 'The Journal Publication Cycles section states: \'Submission Peak Periods: Enhanced capacity during academic calendar peak submission seasons.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(972, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What characterizes Review Coordination Seasons?', '[\"Reduced review activities\",\"Intensive editorial coordination during peer review cycles\",\"Marketing focus\",\"Administrative tasks only\"]', '[1]', 'Review seasons require heightened coordinator engagement to maintain timelines.', 'The document specifies: \'Review Coordination Seasons: Intensive editorial coordination during peer review cycles.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(973, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens during Publication Deadlines periods?', '[\"Relaxed schedules\",\"Reduced quality standards\",\"Focused workflow management during journal publication preparation periods\",\"External outsourcing\"]', '[2]', 'Publication deadlines demand intense focus and coordination to meet publication dates.', 'The Publication Deadlines section states: \'Focused workflow management during journal publication preparation periods.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(974, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is Conference Integration focused on?', '[\"Attending conferences only\",\"Strategic manuscript coordination during academic conference and symposium seasons\",\"Organizing conferences\",\"Conference marketing\"]', '[1]', 'Conferences generate submission spikes requiring proactive coordination planning.', 'The document states: \'Conference Integration: Strategic manuscript coordination during academic conference and symposium seasons.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(975, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the foundation of the Professional Excellence Framework?', '[\"Financial performance\",\"Editorial Integrity - consistent adherence to academic publishing ethics and quality standards\",\"Marketing effectiveness\",\"Technology adoption\"]', '[1]', 'Editorial integrity is the cornerstone of credibility in academic publishing.', 'The Professional Excellence Framework lists first: \'Editorial Integrity: Consistent adherence to academic publishing ethics and quality standards.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(976, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Author Partnership in the Professional Excellence Framework emphasize?', '[\"Strict formal relationships only\",\"Building supportive relationships that enhance author experience and publication success\",\"Minimal communication\",\"Automated interactions only\"]', '[1]', 'Author partnerships transform transactional interactions into collaborative relationships.', 'The Author Partnership section states: \'Building supportive relationships that enhance author experience and publication success.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(977, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Process Excellence focus on in the Professional Excellence Framework?', '[\"Maintaining existing processes unchanged\",\"Continuous improvement in editorial operations that advances PhDiZone\'s publishing capabilities\",\"Reducing operational activities\",\"Outsourcing processes\"]', '[1]', 'Process excellence requires ongoing refinement and innovation in operations.', 'The Process Excellence section specifies: \'Continuous improvement in editorial operations that advances PhDiZone\'s publishing capabilities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(978, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the aim of Academic Community Contribution?', '[\"Financial contributions\",\"Professional engagement that supports scholarly research advancement and publication excellence\",\"Marketing campaigns\",\"Technology development\"]', '[1]', 'Community contribution extends impact beyond individual manuscripts to broader scholarly advancement.', 'The Academic Community Contribution states: \'Professional engagement that supports scholarly research advancement and publication excellence.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(979, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the document version number?', '[\"Version 0.5\",\"Version 1.0\",\"Version 1.5\",\"Version 2.0\"]', '[1]', 'Version 1.0 indicates this is the first official release of this job role document.', 'The document footer clearly states: \'Document Version: 1.0.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(980, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'When is the next document review scheduled?', '[\"30 days from creation\",\"60 days from creation\",\"90 days from creation\",\"180 days from creation\"]', '[2]', 'Quarterly reviews ensure job role documents remain current and accurate.', 'The document footer states: \'Next Review Date: [90 days from creation].\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(981, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the role\'s strategic contribution focus on?', '[\"Short-term operational tasks only\",\"Ensuring manuscript processing meets highest professional standards while providing exceptional support to authors and the academic community\",\"Revenue generation only\",\"Technology implementation only\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic impact encompasses both operational excellence and stakeholder support.', 'The Strategic Contribution to Academic Excellence section states: \'This position is vital for PhDiZone\'s reputation in academic publishing, ensuring that manuscript processing meets the highest professional standards while providing exceptional support to authors and the academic community.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(982, 1, 46, 10, 0, NULL, 0, 'How does the role contribute to scholarly research?', '[\"By conducting research\",\"By directly contributing to advancing scholarly research through efficient, quality-focused editorial operations\",\"By funding research\",\"By teaching researchers\"]', '[1]', 'Quality editorial operations enable faster, better research dissemination.', 'The document states the role \'directly contributes to advancing scholarly research through efficient, quality-focused editorial operations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 1, '2025-10-08 16:09:46', 0),
(983, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus of the Postsales Executive role at PhDiZone?', '[\"Acquiring new clients through cold calling\",\"Nurturing and expanding relationships with existing clients\",\"Managing the technical delivery of research projects\",\"Handling administrative and financial tasks\"]', '[1]', 'Remember that \'postsales\' inherently means working with existing clients, not acquiring new ones.', 'The job description explicitly states that the Postsales Executive is responsible for nurturing and expanding relationships with existing PhDiZone clients, ensuring their continued satisfaction while identifying opportunities for service expansion and revenue growth.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0),
(984, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'To whom does the Postsales Executive directly report?', '[\"Chief Executive Officer\",\"Sales Team Lead or Sales Manager\",\"Research Team Lead\",\"Finance Department Head\"]', '[1]', 'Check the \'Reporting Authority\' section for clear hierarchical relationships.', 'The document clearly indicates under \'Reporting Authority\' that the Postsales Executive reports to the Sales Team Lead / Sales Manager.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0),
(985, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the grade level of the Postsales Executive position?', '[\"Grade III\",\"Grade IV\",\"Grade V\",\"Grade VI\"]', '[2]', 'Grade levels typically indicate seniority and compensation bands within an organization.', 'The document specifies that the Postsales Executive position is classified as Grade V within the organizational structure.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(986, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which generation classification does this position belong to?', '[\"Gen 1\",\"Gen 2\",\"Gen 3\",\"Gen 4\"]', '[2]', 'Generation classifications often indicate the evolution or maturity stage of a role within a company.', 'The job role document clearly states that this position is classified as Generation 3 (Gen 3).', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0),
(987, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the level classification of the Postsales Executive position?', '[\"Level 1\",\"Level 2\",\"Level 3\",\"Level 4\"]', '[1]', 'Level 2 positions typically have moderate autonomy and strategic importance.', 'The document specifies that this is a Level 2 position, which is critical to PhDiZone\'s revenue sustainability and growth strategy.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0),
(988, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which department does the Postsales Executive belong to?', '[\"Research Department\",\"Sales Department\",\"Customer Success Department\",\"Operations Department\"]', '[1]', 'The department indicates broad organizational function, while division shows specific focus area.', 'The job role document clearly identifies the department as the Sales Department, with the division being Postsales.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0),
(989, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the specific division within the department for this role?', '[\"Presales\",\"Postsales\",\"Business Development\",\"Account Management\"]', '[1]', 'Postsales divisions focus on retention and expansion rather than acquisition.', 'The position specifically belongs to the Postsales division within the Sales Department, focusing on existing client relationships.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0),
(990, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of company is Elysium Technology Private Limited?', '[\"A research institution\",\"An academic university\",\"A technology company providing research services\",\"A government research agency\"]', '[2]', 'The company name includes \'Technology\' which indicates its industry classification.', 'Elysium Technology Private Limited is identified as the parent company, with PhDiZone as its entity focused on academic research services.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0),
