(995, 1, 32, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of PhDiZone\'s sustainable growth model?', '[\"Aggressive new client acquisition\",\"Customer lifetime value maximization rather than pure acquisition\",\"Geographic market expansion\",\"Product diversification\"]', '[1]', 'Customer lifetime value (CLV) strategies prioritize long-term relationships over quick wins.', 'The Strategic Business Impact section states that PhDiZone\'s sustainable growth model focuses on customer lifetime value maximization rather than pure acquisition.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:07', 0),
