(1006, 1, 33, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Postsales Executive identify during client conversations?', '[\"Client budget limitations\",\"Premium services, add-ons, and service upgrades\",\"Competitor weaknesses\",\"Internal team inefficiencies\"]', '[1]', 'Upselling works best when presented as solutions to client needs, not just additional products.', 'The Revenue Growth Through Upselling responsibility specifies identifying and pitching premium services, add-ons, and service upgrades during client conversations.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
