(1046, 1, 47, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of metrics are combined for performance evaluation?', '[\"Only quantitative metrics\",\"Only qualitative assessments\",\"Quantitative revenue metrics with qualitative relationship management assessments\",\"Only client satisfaction scores\"]', '[2]', 'Balanced evaluation prevents overemphasis on numbers at the expense of relationship quality.', 'The Performance Measurement Framework states that evaluation \'combines quantitative revenue metrics with qualitative relationship management assessments.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1047, 1, 47, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does continuous performance monitoring involve?', '[\"Annual reviews only\",\"Formal reviews monthly and comprehensive evaluations quarterly\",\"Weekly check-ins\",\"Self-assessments only\"]', '[1]', 'Regular monitoring prevents surprises and allows for timely interventions.', 'The document specifies \'continuous performance monitoring with formal reviews conducted monthly and comprehensive evaluations quarterly.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1048, 1, 47, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What do daily reports include?', '[\"Revenue figures only\",\"Client interaction summaries, upselling activities, and pipeline updates\",\"Time logs\",\"Expense reports\"]', '[1]', 'Daily reports provide real-time visibility into activities and progress.', 'The Daily Reports requirement specifies including \'client interaction summaries, upselling activities, and pipeline updates.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1049, 1, 47, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What do weekly reports cover?', '[\"Training activities\",\"Client satisfaction metrics, revenue performance, and competitive observations\",\"Personal development goals\",\"Team collaboration activities\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reports provide enough data for meaningful trend analysis while remaining actionable.', 'Weekly Reports are specified to include \'client satisfaction metrics, revenue performance, and competitive observations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1050, 1, 47, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What do monthly reports include?', '[\"Daily activity logs\",\"Comprehensive account reviews, retention analysis, and strategic recommendations\",\"Expense summaries\",\"Training completion records\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly reports provide strategic perspective beyond day-to-day activities.', 'Monthly Reports are described as including \'comprehensive account reviews, retention analysis, and strategic recommendations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1051, 1, 47, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What do real-time monitoring systems track?', '[\"Employee location\",\"CRM dashboard for daily activities and client touchpoints\",\"Competitor websites\",\"Social media mentions\"]', '[1]', 'Real-time dashboards enable immediate visibility and rapid response to issues.', 'Real-time Monitoring is described as \'CRM dashboard tracking for daily activities and client touchpoints.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1052, 1, 47, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What do weekly performance reviews assess?', '[\"Long-term career goals\",\"Progress against KPIs with immediate course correction\",\"Compensation levels\",\"Team dynamics\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly KPI reviews prevent small issues from becoming major problems.', 'Weekly Performance Reviews are described as \'progress assessment against KPIs with immediate course correction.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1053, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first phase of career development for this role?', '[\"Immediate Objectives (0-6 months)\",\"Short-term Goals (0-3 months)\",\"Orientation Period (0-1 month)\",\"Probation Period (0-6 months)\"]', '[0]', 'The first six months focus on establishing foundational skills and credibility.', 'The Job Vision section identifies \'Immediate Objectives (0-6 months)\' as the first development phase.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1054, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be established during the 0-6 month period?', '[\"Senior leadership presence\",\"Trusted client advocate and revenue growth catalyst status\",\"Team management capabilities\",\"Strategic planning expertise\"]', '[1]', 'Being seen as both advocate and catalyst requires balancing client needs with business goals.', 'The immediate objectives state that the Postsales Executive \'will establish themselves as a trusted client advocate and revenue growth catalyst.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1055, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What are the focus areas during the first 6 months?', '[\"Strategic planning and market analysis\",\"Mastering client relationship management, achieving upselling targets, and learning service portfolio\",\"Team leadership and mentoring\",\"Process redesign and optimization\"]', '[1]', 'Initial focus is on personal effectiveness before expanding to broader strategic responsibilities.', 'The document specifies focus areas include \'mastering client relationship management techniques, achieving consistent upselling targets, and building comprehensive knowledge of PhDiZone\'s complete service portfolio.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1056, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the development timeline for medium-term objectives?', '[\"3-12 months\",\"6-18 months\",\"12-24 months\",\"18-36 months\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term development bridges initial competency building with long-term career advancement.', 'The Job Vision section identifies \'Medium-term Development (6-18 months)\' as the second development phase.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1057, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What role evolution occurs in the medium-term?', '[\"Transition to sales manager\",\"Evolution into strategic account manager with deep expertise\",\"Move to operations role\",\"Promotion to director level\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic account management requires understanding not just services but client business contexts.', 'The medium-term development describes \'evolution into a strategic account manager with deep expertise in academic research cycles and client business models.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1058, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What new responsibilities emerge in the 6-18 month period?', '[\"Budget management and hiring\",\"Key account management, client success program leadership, and mentoring\",\"Market expansion and partnerships\",\"Technology implementation\"]', '[1]', 'Adding mentoring responsibilities indicates readiness for leadership roles.', 'The document states the role \'will expand to include key account management responsibilities, client success program leadership, and mentoring of junior postsales team members.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1059, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the timeline for long-term career pathway?', '[\"12+ months\",\"18+ months\",\"24+ months\",\"36+ months\"]', '[1]', 'Long-term pathways typically require demonstrating sustained high performance over multiple review cycles.', 'The Job Vision identifies \'Long-term Career Pathway (18+ months)\' as the third development phase.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1060, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What advancement roles are mentioned in the long-term pathway?', '[\"Regional Manager or Director of Sales\",\"Senior Account Manager, Client Success Manager, or Business Development Manager\",\"VP of Operations or Chief Customer Officer\",\"Research Team Lead or Technical Manager\"]', '[1]', 'Multiple pathway options allow individuals to pursue roles aligned with their strengths and interests.', 'The long-term pathway lists \'advancement opportunities include Senior Account Manager, Client Success Manager, or Business Development Manager roles.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1061, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What areas can the position provide foundation for specialization in?', '[\"Technical research or financial analysis\",\"Key account management, client success operations, or consultative sales leadership\",\"Marketing strategy or product development\",\"Human resources or legal compliance\"]', '[1]', 'Current role competencies directly translate to these advancement areas.', 'The document states the position \'provides foundation for specialization in key account management, client success operations, or transition into consultative sales leadership.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1062, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the strategic business focus that makes this position fundamental?', '[\"Market expansion and acquisition\",\"Customer lifetime value maximization rather than pure acquisition\",\"Cost reduction and efficiency\",\"Technology innovation\"]', '[1]', 'CLV focus aligns with recurring revenue models and sustainable growth strategies.', 'The Strategic Business Impact section states the position is \'fundamental to PhDiZone\'s sustainable growth model, focusing on customer lifetime value maximization rather than pure acquisition.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1063, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What time does the daily schedule begin?', '[\"8:00 AM\",\"8:30 AM\",\"9:00 AM\",\"9:30 AM\"]', '[2]', 'Starting with portfolio review ensures strategic prioritization of the day\'s activities.', 'The Daily Activities section shows the schedule begins at \'9:00 AM - 9:30 AM\' with portfolio review.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1064, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first activity in the daily schedule?', '[\"Client calls\",\"Email review\",\"Review client portfolio and prioritize daily outreach activities\",\"Team meeting\"]', '[2]', 'Beginning with prioritization ensures high-impact activities receive appropriate attention.', 'The schedule shows \'9:00 AM - 9:30 AM: Review client portfolio and prioritize daily outreach activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1065, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'When are client relationship calls scheduled?', '[\"8:00 AM - 10:00 AM\",\"9:30 AM - 11:30 AM\",\"10:00 AM - 12:00 PM\",\"11:00 AM - 1:00 PM\"]', '[1]', 'Morning hours are often best for client calls when executives are typically available.', 'The daily schedule shows \'9:30 AM - 11:30 AM: Client relationship calls and satisfaction check-ins.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1066, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur from 11:30 AM to 12:30 PM?', '[\"Lunch break\",\"New client onboarding and welcome sessions\",\"Internal meetings\",\"Report writing\"]', '[1]', 'Dedicated onboarding time ensures new clients receive proper attention and setup.', 'The schedule specifies \'11:30 AM - 12:30 PM: New client onboarding and welcome sessions.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1067, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'When are upselling conversations scheduled?', '[\"Morning hours\",\"1:30 PM - 3:00 PM\",\"3:00 PM - 4:00 PM\",\"Late afternoon\"]', '[1]', 'Afternoon slots allow time to research client needs and prepare customized upsell proposals.', 'The daily schedule shows \'1:30 PM - 3:00 PM: Upselling conversations and proposal follow-ups.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1068, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is scheduled from 3:00 PM to 4:00 PM?', '[\"Client calls\",\"Team meetings\",\"CRM updates and client issue documentation\",\"Training activities\"]', '[2]', 'Dedicated CRM time ensures data accuracy and prevents end-of-day backlog.', 'The schedule specifies \'3:00 PM - 4:00 PM: CRM updates and client issue documentation.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1069, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'When does delivery team coordination occur?', '[\"Morning\",\"Lunchtime\",\"4:00 PM - 5:00 PM\",\"End of day\"]', '[2]', 'End-of-day coordination ensures delivery teams have updated information for the next day.', 'The daily schedule shows \'4:00 PM - 5:00 PM: Delivery team coordination and daily reporting.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1070, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the final scheduled activity of the day?', '[\"Client follow-ups\",\"CRM updates\",\"Self-assessment and skill development activities\",\"Team debriefs\"]', '[2]', 'Ending with self-assessment promotes continuous improvement and learning reflection.', 'The schedule ends with \'5:00 PM - 5:30 PM: Self-assessment and skill development activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1071, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Monday weekly priority?', '[\"Client calls\",\"Portfolio review and weekly planning with sales team lead\",\"Administrative tasks\",\"Training sessions\"]', '[1]', 'Starting the week with planning ensures alignment and clear priorities.', 'The Weekly Priorities section lists \'Monday: Portfolio review and weekly planning with sales team lead.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1072, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What are Tuesday-Wednesday priorities focused on?', '[\"Internal meetings and training\",\"Intensive client relationship management and upselling activities\",\"Administrative and reporting tasks\",\"Strategic planning\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-week focus on client activities maximizes engagement when clients are typically most available.', 'The schedule shows \'Tuesday-Wednesday: Intensive client relationship management and upselling activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1073, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Thursday priority?', '[\"Client calls only\",\"Cross-functional team collaboration and competitive research\",\"Report preparation\",\"Training delivery\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-to-late week collaboration ensures insights from client interactions can be shared while fresh.', 'Thursday is designated for \'Cross-functional team collaboration and competitive research.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1074, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are scheduled for Friday?', '[\"Client acquisition activities\",\"Administrative tasks, performance analysis, and knowledge sharing sessions\",\"Team building events\",\"Strategic planning meetings\"]', '[1]', 'Ending the week with analysis and knowledge sharing facilitates learning and preparation for the next week.', 'Friday is designated for \'Administrative tasks, performance analysis, and knowledge sharing sessions.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1075, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What occurs throughout the entire week?', '[\"Team meetings\",\"Training programs\",\"Continuous client support and opportunity identification\",\"Strategic planning\"]', '[2]', 'Ongoing client support ensures responsiveness regardless of scheduled activities.', 'The schedule notes \'Throughout Week: Continuous client support and opportunity identification.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1076, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What occurs in Week 1 of the monthly cycle?', '[\"Month-end reporting\",\"Client portfolio analysis and strategic account planning\",\"Upselling campaigns\",\"Performance reviews\"]', '[1]', 'Starting the month with analysis ensures strategic focus for the upcoming period.', 'Monthly Commitments show \'Week 1: Client portfolio analysis and strategic account planning.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1077, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of Week 2 in monthly commitments?', '[\"Client retention activities\",\"Intensive upselling campaigns and proposal follow-ups\",\"Training and development\",\"Competitive analysis\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-month focus on upselling allows time for deals to close before month-end.', 'Week 2 is designated for \'Intensive upselling campaigns and proposal follow-ups.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1078, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens in Week 3 monthly?', '[\"Month-end closing activities\",\"Budget planning\",\"Client success initiatives and testimonial collection\",\"Team performance reviews\"]', '[2]', 'Testimonial collection mid-to-late month allows time to identify success stories from recent completions.', 'Week 3 focuses on \'Client success initiatives and testimonial collection.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1079, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is scheduled for Week 4 of each month?', '[\"New client onboarding\",\"Upselling campaigns\",\"Performance evaluation, process improvement documentation, and strategic planning\",\"Team training sessions\"]', '[2]', 'Month-end reflection ensures learnings are captured and inform next month\'s planning.', 'Week 4 includes \'Performance evaluation, process improvement documentation, and strategic planning.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1080, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'When are Peak Academic Periods?', '[\"January-March, June-August, October-December\",\"August-September, December-January, March-May\",\"September-November, February-April, June-July\",\"Year-round with no seasonal variation\"]', '[1]', 'Academic cycles drive client activity patterns in the research services industry.', 'Peak Academic Periods are listed as \'August-September, December-January, March-May\' with increased client communication frequency.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1081, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the priority during Academic Break Periods?', '[\"Vacation time for the executive\",\"Focus on relationship building, long-term planning, and strategic upselling\",\"Reduced work hours\",\"New client acquisition only\"]', '[1]', 'Break periods provide opportunity for strategic work without the urgency of active projects.', 'Academic Break Periods focus on \'relationship building, long-term planning, and strategic upselling for upcoming academic sessions.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1082, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus at End of Financial Quarters?', '[\"Vacation planning\",\"New service development\",\"Intensive focus on revenue closure and client retention initiatives\",\"Team reorganization\"]', '[2]', 'Quarter-end focus drives achievement of revenue targets and maintains business momentum.', 'End of Financial Quarters require \'intensive focus on revenue closure and client retention initiatives.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1083, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the daily performance milestone?', '[\"Complete all scheduled calls\",\"All client communications responded to within 4 hours during business days\",\"Achieve daily revenue target\",\"Update CRM for all interactions\"]', '[1]', 'Four-hour response time demonstrates responsiveness while remaining realistic for a busy schedule.', 'The Daily milestone states \'All client communications responded to within 4 hours during business days.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1084, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the weekly performance milestone?', '[\"Complete all scheduled meetings\",\"Submit all required reports\",\"Client satisfaction surveys completed and upselling targets tracked\",\"Achieve weekly revenue goal\"]', '[2]', 'Weekly tracking enables rapid course correction and maintains focus on key outcomes.', 'The Weekly milestone is \'Client satisfaction surveys completed and upselling targets tracked.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(1085, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the monthly performance milestone?', '[\"Complete all training requirements\",\"Submit expense reports\",\"Revenue targets achieved and client portfolio health assessed\",\"Update job documentation\"]', '[2]', 'Monthly assessment provides sufficient time to identify trends while allowing corrective action.', 'The Monthly milestone is \'Revenue targets achieved and client portfolio health assessed.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1086, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the quarterly performance milestone?', '[\"Complete annual reviews\",\"Strategic account reviews conducted and expansion plans developed\",\"Update organizational charts\",\"Complete compliance training\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly reviews provide strategic perspective beyond monthly operational focus.', 'The Quarterly milestone is \'Strategic account reviews conducted and expansion plans developed.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1087, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does monthly strategic review involve?', '[\"Budget reviews only\",\"In-depth analysis of client portfolio health and growth opportunities\",\"Team performance evaluations\",\"Market expansion planning\"]', '[1]', 'Portfolio health analysis identifies at-risk clients and expansion opportunities proactively.', 'Monthly Strategic Reviews are described as \'in-depth analysis of client portfolio health and growth opportunities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1088, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is included in quarterly business reviews?', '[\"Financial audits only\",\"Team satisfaction surveys\",\"Comprehensive evaluation including career development planning\",\"Budget planning only\"]', '[2]', 'Including career development in business reviews reinforces the connection between performance and growth.', 'Quarterly Business Reviews are described as \'comprehensive evaluation including career development planning.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1089, 1, 48, 11, 0, NULL, 0, 'Who has full responsibility for assigned client portfolio?', '[\"The Sales Manager\",\"The Delivery Team\",\"The Postsales Executive\",\"The entire sales team collectively\"]', '[2]', 'Full accountability means owning both successes and challenges within the assigned portfolio.', 'Client Accountability specifies \'Full responsibility for assigned client portfolio management and expansion.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 1, '2025-10-08 16:40:08', 0),
(1090, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the reporting authority for the Presales Executive position?', '[\"CEO \\/ Managing Director\",\"Sales Team Lead \\/ Sales Manager\",\"Research Team Lead\",\"Marketing Manager\"]', '[1]', 'Remember the direct reporting line: Presales Executive → Sales Team Lead/Manager.', 'According to the job role document, the Presales Executive position reports directly to the Sales Team Lead or Sales Manager, establishing a clear reporting hierarchy within the sales department.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1091, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which company entity does PhDiZone operate under?', '[\"PhDiZone Solutions Private Limited\",\"Elysium Technology Private Limited\",\"PhDiZone Research Corporation\",\"Elysium Research Services\"]', '[1]', 'PhDiZone is the brand/entity; Elysium Technology is the registered company name.', 'The document clearly states that PhDiZone is the entity name operating under the parent company Elysium Technology Private Limited.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1092, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the grade classification for the Presales Executive position?', '[\"Grade III\",\"Grade IV\",\"Grade V\",\"Grade VI\"]', '[2]', 'Grade V corresponds to Level 2 in the organizational structure.', 'The job role document specifies that the Presales Executive position is classified as Grade V, which indicates its level within the organizational hierarchy.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1093, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What generation classification is assigned to this role?', '[\"Gen 1\",\"Gen 2\",\"Gen 3\",\"Gen 4\"]', '[2]', 'Gen 3 suggests this is an evolved, mature role within the organization\'s structure.', 'The document indicates that the Presales Executive position is categorized as Generation 3 (Gen 3), which likely represents a specific tier or evolution of the role within the company.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1094, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which division does the Presales Executive belong to?', '[\"Sales\",\"Presales\",\"Business Development\",\"Client Services\"]', '[1]', 'Division (Presales) is different from Department (Sales)—note the hierarchical distinction.', 'The document explicitly states that the Presales Executive position belongs to the Presales Division within the Sales Department.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1095, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary function of the Presales Executive according to the job role clarity?', '[\"Managing research projects\",\"Serving as a bridge between potential clients and PhDiZone\'s research services\",\"Handling post-sales customer support\",\"Developing marketing strategies\"]', '[1]', 'Think of the Presales Executive as a translator converting client needs into service solutions.', 'The job role clarity section describes the Presales Executive as \'the critical bridge between potential clients and PhDiZone\'s research services offerings,\' emphasizing the connecting role between prospects and services.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1096, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What level designation is the Presales Executive position?', '[\"Level 1\",\"Level 2\",\"Level 3\",\"Level 4\"]', '[1]', 'Level 2 indicates intermediate responsibility with direct revenue contribution.', 'The document clearly indicates that the Presales Executive is a Level 2, Grade V position, placing it at a specific tier in the organizational hierarchy.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1097, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which services does the role specifically support according to the job clarity section?', '[\"Software development, web design, and app creation\",\"Thesis writing, journal publishing assistance, and statistical analysis\",\"HR consulting, training, and recruitment\",\"Financial planning and investment advisory\"]', '[1]', 'Focus on academic and research-oriented services—this is PhDiZone\'s core offering.', 'The job role clarity explicitly mentions that the Presales Executive supports academic and research services including thesis writing, journal publishing assistance, and statistical analysis.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1098, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What approach is required for understanding client needs?', '[\"Automated approach\",\"Consultative approach\",\"Aggressive sales approach\",\"Passive observation approach\"]', '[1]', 'Consultative selling means listening first, then proposing solutions tailored to needs.', 'The document emphasizes that the position requires a \'consultative approach to understand client research needs,\' indicating a collaborative, advisory style of interaction.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1099, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Presales Executive ensure during client onboarding?', '[\"Immediate payment processing\",\"Seamless client onboarding with high professionalism\",\"Minimal documentation requirements\",\"Automated service delivery\"]', '[1]', 'Seamless onboarding sets the tone for the entire client relationship.', 'The job clarity section states that the Presales Executive \'ensures seamless client onboarding while maintaining high standards of professionalism and service quality.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1100, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What organizational commitment does the Presales Executive\'s role align with?', '[\"Cost reduction\",\"Market expansion\",\"Academic excellence\",\"Technology innovation\"]', '[2]', 'Academic excellence is PhDiZone\'s brand promise—all roles support this commitment.', 'The document states that the role maintains standards \'that align with PhDiZone\'s commitment to academic excellence,\' making this the core value alignment.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1101, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'How does the Level 2, Grade V position contribute to the company?', '[\"Indirect support to operations\",\"Direct revenue generation and customer acquisition\",\"Administrative support only\",\"Technical development\"]', '[1]', 'Presales roles are frontline revenue drivers, not back-office support functions.', 'The document explicitly states this role \'contributes directly to revenue generation and customer acquisition,\' highlighting its business impact.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1102, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What types of professionals does PhDiZone primarily support?', '[\"Corporate executives and managers\",\"Academic professionals and students\",\"Government officials\",\"Healthcare practitioners\"]', '[1]', 'Know your audience: academics and students have unique research support needs.', 'The role clarity mentions supporting \'the company\'s mission to provide comprehensive research support to academic professionals and students.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1103, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which teams does the Presales Executive have matrix relationships with?', '[\"Finance, HR, and Administration\",\"Research Team, Content Team, and Marketing Team\",\"IT, Operations, and Legal\",\"Customer Service, Quality, and Compliance\"]', '[1]', 'Matrix relationships mean cross-functional collaboration beyond direct reporting lines.', 'The reporting hierarchy section specifies \'Regular collaboration with Research Team, Content Team, and Marketing Team\' as matrix relationships.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1104, 1, 32, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of role is the Presales Executive position in terms of client interaction?', '[\"Back-office support role\",\"Direct client-facing role with full accountability\",\"Occasional client contact role\",\"Internal coordination role only\"]', '[1]', 'Client-facing means you\'re the company\'s representative—accountability is personal.', 'The document describes it as a \'Direct client-facing role with full accountability for assigned accounts,\' emphasizing direct interaction and responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1105, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'How are leads classified in the Lead Management system?', '[\"New, Existing, Closed\",\"Hot, Warm, Cold\",\"A, B, C categories\",\"High, Medium, Low\"]', '[1]', 'Hot = urgent + high potential; Warm = interested; Cold = low engagement.', 'The document specifies that leads should be \'Classify[ed] based on urgency and potential (Hot, Warm, Cold)\' as part of lead management responsibilities.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1106, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What channels are monitored for lead generation?', '[\"Email and phone only\",\"Website forms, calls, WhatsApp, social media, walk-ins\",\"Social media exclusively\",\"Referrals only\"]', '[1]', 'Modern lead gen is omnichannel—be prepared to engage across all platforms.', 'The Lead Management section lists monitoring and responding to \'leads from multiple channels (website forms, calls, WhatsApp, social media, walk-ins).\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1107, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What system is used for maintaining accurate lead records?', '[\"Spreadsheet systems\",\"Email tracking\",\"ERP systems\",\"Paper filing\"]', '[2]', 'ERP integration ensures centralized data and prevents leads from falling through cracks.', 'The document states responsibilities include \'Maintain accurate lead records in ERP systems with proper follow-up scheduling.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1108, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What information must be documented during client needs assessment?', '[\"Budget only\",\"Domain, deadlines, budget, and institutional requirements\",\"Contact information only\",\"Service preferences only\"]', '[1]', 'The four D-B-I factors: Domain, Deadlines, Budget, Institutional requirements—memorize these.', 'Client Discovery & Needs Assessment requires documenting \'client needs including domain, deadlines, budget, and institutional requirements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1109, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What document is prepared for internal team validation?', '[\"Client Contract\",\"Needs Documents\",\"Service Agreement\",\"Payment Schedule\"]', '[1]', 'Needs Documents bridge client requirements and internal service delivery teams.', 'The responsibilities include \'Prepare detailed \"Needs Documents\" for internal team validation\' as part of the client discovery process.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1110, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must proposals include according to Proposal Development responsibilities?', '[\"Pricing only\",\"Clear scope, timelines, deliverables, and pricing\",\"Service descriptions only\",\"Company overview only\"]', '[1]', 'STDP framework: Scope, Timelines, Deliverables, Pricing—all four must be clear.', 'The document specifies creating \'customized proposals with clear scope, timelines, deliverables, and pricing\' as a key responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1111, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'With which teams must proposal feasibility be validated?', '[\"Sales and marketing teams\",\"Research and content teams\",\"Finance and HR teams\",\"IT and operations teams\"]', '[1]', 'Always validate proposals internally before client presentation—prevents over-promising.', 'Proposal Development responsibilities include \'Validate proposal feasibility with research and content teams\' to ensure deliverability.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1112, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which types of leads receive systematic follow-up strategies?', '[\"All leads equally\",\"Hot and Warm leads\",\"Cold leads only\",\"New leads only\"]', '[1]', 'Focus energy on Hot/Warm leads—they have higher conversion probability.', 'Follow-Up & Relationship Management specifies \'Execute systematic follow-up strategies for Hot and Warm leads,\' prioritizing high-potential prospects.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1113, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What client concerns must be addressed during relationship management?', '[\"Pricing concerns only\",\"Plagiarism, confidentiality, and quality assurance\",\"Timeline concerns only\",\"Technical issues only\"]', '[1]', 'The three trust pillars for academic services: originality, privacy, and quality.', 'The document lists \'Address client concerns regarding plagiarism, confidentiality, and quality assurance\' as a key relationship management responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1114, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of communication is required to move prospects through the sales pipeline?', '[\"Monthly newsletters\",\"Regular communication\",\"Annual reviews\",\"Quarterly check-ins\"]', '[1]', 'Consistent touchpoints build trust and keep your service top-of-mind.', 'Follow-Up responsibilities include \'Maintain regular communication to move prospects through the sales pipeline,\' emphasizing consistency.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1115, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of assistance is provided during Walk-in Client Service?', '[\"Scheduled appointments only\",\"Immediate assistance to office visitors\",\"Virtual consultations only\",\"Email support only\"]', '[1]', 'Walk-ins are high-intent prospects—immediate, quality service increases conversion.', 'Walk-in Client Service responsibilities include \'Provide immediate assistance to office visitors,\' indicating real-time, in-person support.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1116, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be conducted during walk-in client service?', '[\"Online surveys\",\"Face-to-face consultations and service explanations\",\"Phone interviews\",\"Email exchanges\"]', '[1]', 'Face-to-face builds rapport faster—use this advantage for deeper needs discovery.', 'The document specifies \'Conduct face-to-face consultations and service explanations\' as part of walk-in client service.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1117, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What materials must be delivered effectively during walk-in service?', '[\"Business cards only\",\"Promotional materials and case studies\",\"Price lists only\",\"Contact information only\"]', '[1]', 'Case studies provide social proof—they\'re powerful conversion tools for walk-ins.', 'Walk-in service includes \'Deliver promotional materials and case studies effectively,\' providing tangible takeaways for prospects.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1118, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently must ERP/Excel systems be updated?', '[\"Weekly\",\"Daily\",\"Monthly\",\"As needed\"]', '[1]', 'Daily updates prevent data lag and ensure accurate pipeline visibility.', 'Data Management & Reporting responsibilities require \'Maintain accurate daily updates in ERP/Excel systems,\' emphasizing daily discipline.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1119, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of reports must be generated for management review?', '[\"Financial reports\",\"Comprehensive performance reports\",\"HR reports\",\"Technical reports\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive reports should cover all KRAs and KPIs—quantify your impact.', 'The document states the role must \'Generate comprehensive performance reports for management review\' as a data management responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1120, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be ensured across all client touchpoints?', '[\"Pricing consistency\",\"Data integrity\",\"Staff availability\",\"Technology functionality\"]', '[1]', 'Data integrity means one source of truth—inconsistent data damages credibility.', 'Data Management responsibilities include \'Ensure data integrity across all client touchpoints,\' maintaining accuracy and consistency.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1121, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are part of Continuous Improvement & Market Intelligence?', '[\"Internal training only\",\"Monitor competitor activities and market trends\",\"Social media management\",\"Product development\"]', '[1]', 'Market intelligence informs strategy—stay aware of competitive landscape shifts.', 'The document lists \'Monitor competitor activities and market trends\' as a continuous improvement responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1122, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'How does the Presales Executive contribute to service development?', '[\"Direct product design\",\"Based on client feedback\",\"Through technical coding\",\"By hiring developers\"]', '[1]', 'You\'re the voice of the customer internally—synthesize feedback into improvement ideas.', 'Continuous Improvement responsibilities include \'Contribute to service development based on client feedback,\' making client input actionable.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1123, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What professional activities must the Presales Executive participate in?', '[\"Social events only\",\"Professional development and training initiatives\",\"Client entertainment\",\"Industry conferences only\"]', '[1]', 'Continuous learning keeps your skills sharp and knowledge current in a changing market.', 'The document specifies \'Participate in professional development and training initiatives\' as part of continuous improvement.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1124, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the scheduled time for reviewing overnight leads?', '[\"8:00 AM - 8:30 AM\",\"9:00 AM - 9:30 AM\",\"10:00 AM - 10:30 AM\",\"9:30 AM - 10:00 AM\"]', '[1]', 'Start your day by prioritizing—responding to overnight leads first shows responsiveness.', 'The Daily Activities schedule shows \'9:00 AM - 9:30 AM: Review overnight leads and prioritize daily activities\' as the day\'s first task.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1125, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'During which time slot are initial qualification calls conducted?', '[\"9:00 AM - 11:00 AM\",\"9:30 AM - 11:00 AM\",\"10:00 AM - 12:00 PM\",\"8:30 AM - 10:30 AM\"]', '[1]', 'Morning qualification calls catch prospects when they\'re fresh and responsive.', 'The schedule allocates \'9:30 AM - 11:00 AM: Respond to new leads and conduct initial qualification calls\' for lead response.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1126, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur between 11:00 AM and 12:30 PM?', '[\"Lunch break\",\"Client discovery calls and needs assessment meetings\",\"Administrative tasks\",\"Team meetings\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-morning to lunchtime is prime time for substantive client conversations.', 'The daily schedule shows \'11:00 AM - 12:30 PM: Client discovery calls and needs assessment meetings\' for in-depth client engagement.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
(1127, 1, 40, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'When is proposal preparation scheduled?', '[\"Morning hours\",\"1:30 PM - 3:00 PM\",\"Late afternoon\",\"Early evening\"]', '[1]', 'Afternoon proposal preparation allows you to incorporate morning discovery insights.', 'The schedule allocates \'1:30 PM - 3:00 PM: Proposal preparation and internal team consultations\' for proposal work.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:14', 0),
