(1146, 1, 34, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of the Client Relationship Development KRA?', '[\"Increasing client numbers\",\"Building trust-based relationships through communication and needs understanding\",\"Reducing client complaints\",\"Maximizing transaction speed\"]', '[1]', 'Trust is earned through consistent, authentic communication and delivering on promises.', 'The Client Relationship Development KRA emphasizes \'Build strong, trust-based relationships with potential clients through effective communication and needs understanding.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
