(1157, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'When does Quarterly Goal Setting occur?', '[\"At year-end\",\"Strategic planning and target adjustment sessions\",\"During annual review\",\"On hire date anniversary\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly planning allows for strategic pivots based on market and performance trends.', 'The Performance Review Cycle includes \'Quarterly Goal Setting: Strategic planning and target adjustment sessions.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1158, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What occurs during the Annual Performance Appraisal?', '[\"Salary adjustment only\",\"Comprehensive evaluation and career development planning\",\"Team assignment changes\",\"Job description updates\"]', '[1]', 'Annual reviews are career moments—prepare by documenting your achievements year-round.', 'The document specifies \'Annual Performance Appraisal: Comprehensive evaluation and career development planning.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1159, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What are the immediate goals for the first 0-6 months?', '[\"Revenue maximization\",\"Establishing as trusted advisor, mastering offerings, building pipeline\",\"Team leadership\",\"Market expansion\"]', '[1]', 'First six months: learn, build credibility, and establish consistent performance habits.', 'The document states immediate goals include \'establishing themselves as a trusted advisor,\' \'mastering the company\'s service offerings,\' and \'building a robust lead pipeline.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1160, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the medium-term objective timeframe?', '[\"3-6 months\",\"6-18 months\",\"12-24 months\",\"18-36 months\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term is when you transition from learner to expert contributor.', 'The document identifies medium-term objectives as occurring during the \'6-18 months\' period.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1161, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is expected during the medium-term objectives phase?', '[\"Job change\",\"Evolution into senior presales specialist with deep expertise\",\"Retirement planning\",\"Department transfer\"]', '[1]', 'Become the subject matter expert—deep knowledge differentiates you from competitors.', 'Medium-term objectives include \'Evolution into a senior presales specialist with deep expertise in research methodologies and academic requirements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1162, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What additional responsibility emerges in the medium-term?', '[\"Financial management\",\"Mentoring junior team members\",\"HR responsibilities\",\"Technical development\"]', '[1]', 'Mentoring others solidifies your own expertise and builds leadership skills.', 'Medium-term objectives state \'The role will expand to include mentoring junior team members.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1163, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What timeframe defines the long-term career trajectory?', '[\"12+ months\",\"18+ months\",\"24+ months\",\"36+ months\"]', '[1]', 'Long-term success requires sustained excellence—it\'s a marathon, not a sprint.', 'The document specifies the long-term career trajectory begins at \'18+ months\' in the role.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1164, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is a potential advancement path mentioned in the long-term trajectory?', '[\"HR Manager\",\"Sales Team Lead\",\"Finance Director\",\"Operations Manager\"]', '[1]', 'Sales Team Lead means managing others—develop leadership skills throughout your tenure.', 'Long-term trajectory mentions \'Potential advancement to Sales Team Lead\' as one career path option.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1165, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What specialized role opportunities are mentioned in the long-term trajectory?', '[\"Technical architecture\",\"Business development, key account management, market expansion\",\"Product management\",\"Data analysis\"]', '[1]', 'Specialization paths allow you to leverage your strengths—consider what energizes you.', 'The document mentions \'specialized roles in business development\' with \'opportunities to manage key accounts, lead market expansion initiatives.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1166, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What unique transition opportunity is mentioned in the long-term trajectory?', '[\"Marketing department\",\"Research consulting\",\"Human resources\",\"IT department\"]', '[1]', 'Research consulting combines your sales skills with deep academic knowledge.', 'The long-term trajectory notes a potential to \'transition into research consulting,\' leveraging presales expertise.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1167, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the role provide as a foundation for growth?', '[\"Technical certifications\",\"Foundation for growth within PhDiZone\'s expanding operations\",\"External job opportunities\",\"Academic degrees\"]', '[1]', 'Company growth creates promotion opportunities—your success aligns with organizational success.', 'The document states \'The role provides a foundation for growth within PhDiZone\'s expanding operations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1168, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the strategic importance of the Presales Executive role?', '[\"Cost management\",\"Crucial for PhDiZone\'s growth strategy in academic services market\",\"Technology implementation\",\"Administrative efficiency\"]', '[1]', 'Understanding your strategic importance helps you prioritize high-impact activities.', 'The Strategic Impact section states \'This position is crucial for PhDiZone\'s growth strategy in the academic services market.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1169, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What will the Presales Executive help establish for the company?', '[\"Cost structures\",\"Company reputation\",\"IT systems\",\"HR policies\"]', '[1]', 'Every client interaction shapes reputation—you are a brand ambassador.', 'The document states \'The Presales Executive will play a key role in building the company\'s reputation.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1170, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the role establish through relationship-based selling?', '[\"Cost efficiencies\",\"Sustainable revenue streams\",\"Technology platforms\",\"Training programs\"]', '[1]', 'Relationship-based selling creates recurring revenue—focus on long-term value, not just transactions.', 'The Strategic Impact section mentions \'establishing sustainable revenue streams through relationship-based selling.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1171, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary weekly priority on Mondays?', '[\"Client meetings\",\"Pipeline review and weekly planning session with team lead\",\"Proposal writing\",\"Data entry\"]', '[1]', 'Monday planning sets the week\'s direction—align with your manager on priorities.', 'Weekly Priorities specify \'Monday: Pipeline review and weekly planning session with team lead\' as the week\'s starting activity.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1172, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus during Tuesday-Thursday?', '[\"Administrative work\",\"Focus on client interactions, proposals, and follow-ups\",\"Training sessions\",\"Market research\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-week is prime selling time—protect this time from non-essential meetings.', 'Weekly Priorities state \'Tuesday-Thursday: Focus on client interactions, proposals, and follow-ups\' as core mid-week activities.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1173, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur on Fridays?', '[\"Client presentations only\",\"Administrative tasks, team meetings, and performance analysis\",\"Lead generation only\",\"Training only\"]', '[1]', 'Friday reflection and analysis prepare you for Monday\'s planning—close the loop.', 'Friday priorities include \'Administrative tasks, team meetings, and performance analysis\' to close out the week.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1174, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be maintained continuously throughout the week?', '[\"Email inbox zero\",\"Continuous follow-up schedule and response to urgent client needs\",\"Social media presence\",\"Report templates\"]', '[1]', 'Urgent client needs don\'t follow schedules—build flexibility for reactive work.', 'Weekly Priorities specify \'Throughout Week: Maintain continuous follow-up schedule and respond to urgent client needs.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1175, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Week 1 monthly commitment?', '[\"Revenue planning\",\"Market research and competitor analysis activities\",\"Team building\",\"Process documentation\"]', '[1]', 'Month-start competitive intelligence informs your positioning for the entire month.', 'Monthly Commitments show \'Week 1: Market research and competitor analysis activities\' as the first week\'s focus.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1176, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Week 2 monthly commitment?', '[\"Training\",\"Focus on converting warm leads and closing pending proposals\",\"Reporting\",\"Planning\"]', '[1]', 'Week 2 conversion focus prevents deals from stalling—momentum matters.', 'Week 2 commitment is \'Focus on converting warm leads and closing pending proposals,\' emphasizing conversion.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1177, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Week 3 monthly commitment?', '[\"Vacation planning\",\"Client relationship building and testimonial collection\",\"System upgrades\",\"Budget review\"]', '[1]', 'Testimonials from satisfied clients are powerful sales tools—collect them systematically.', 'Week 3 focuses on \'Client relationship building and testimonial collection\' to strengthen relationships and gather proof.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1178, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the Week 4 monthly commitment?', '[\"Vacation\",\"Performance review preparation, process improvement documentation, and strategic planning\",\"Networking events\",\"Social media campaigns\"]', '[1]', 'Month-end analysis and planning create accountability and continuous improvement.', 'Week 4 includes \'Performance review preparation, process improvement documentation, and strategic planning\' to close the month.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1179, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must occur daily according to Key Milestones?', '[\"Team meetings\",\"All leads responded to within service level agreements\",\"Proposal submissions\",\"Training completion\"]', '[1]', 'Daily SLA compliance builds client trust and prevents lead leakage.', 'Daily milestones require \'All leads responded to within service level agreements\' for consistent responsiveness.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1180, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be completed weekly according to Key Milestones?', '[\"Monthly reports\",\"Pipeline review completed and forecasts updated\",\"Quarterly planning\",\"Annual reviews\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly pipeline reviews catch issues early and improve forecast accuracy.', 'Weekly milestones include \'Pipeline review completed and forecasts updated\' to maintain visibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1181, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What monthly milestone must be achieved?', '[\"100% attendance\",\"Performance targets achieved and comprehensive reporting completed\",\"All training completed\",\"Zero customer complaints\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly target achievement requires daily discipline—track progress continuously.', 'Monthly milestones require \'Performance targets achieved and comprehensive reporting completed\' for accountability.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1182, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What quarterly milestone is specified?', '[\"Vacation planning\",\"Career development discussions and goal refinement sessions\",\"Budget reviews\",\"System audits\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly career discussions ensure your role evolves with your capabilities.', 'Quarterly milestones include \'Career development discussions and goal refinement sessions\' for growth planning.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1183, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'During which months does the role experience increased activity for fall admissions?', '[\"June-July\",\"August-September\",\"October-November\",\"December-January\"]', '[1]', 'Academic calendar drives demand—prepare for peak periods with capacity planning.', 'Peak Activity Periods identifies \'August-September for fall admissions\' as a high-activity timeframe.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1184, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the peak period for spring admissions?', '[\"October-November\",\"December-January\",\"February-March\",\"April-May\"]', '[1]', 'Spring admission season overlaps with holidays—plan for year-end workload balance.', 'The document specifies \'December-January for spring admissions\' as another peak activity period.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1185, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'When is the peak period for summer research programs?', '[\"January-February\",\"March-May\",\"June-August\",\"September-November\"]', '[1]', 'Summer research peaks in spring—students plan ahead for summer work.', 'Peak Activity Periods include \'March-May for summer research programs\' as the third major demand surge.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1186, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'What may be required during peak activity periods?', '[\"Reduced workload\",\"Extended hours and weekend availability\",\"Vacation time\",\"Remote work only\"]', '[1]', 'Peak seasons are revenue opportunities—flexibility during these times maximizes results.', 'The document states \'During these periods, extended hours and weekend availability may be required to meet client demands.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(1187, 1, 48, 12, 0, NULL, 0, 'Why might weekend availability be needed during peak periods?', '[\"Company policy\",\"To capitalize on market opportunities\",\"Reduced weekday hours\",\"Team building\"]', '[1]', 'Market opportunities don\'t wait—availability when clients need you wins deals.', 'The document explains extended availability is needed to \'meet client demands and capitalize on market opportunities\' during peaks.', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 1, '2025-10-08 16:54:15', 0),
(1188, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary entity under which the Project Coordinator position operates?', '[\"PhDiZone\",\"Elysium Technology\",\"Production Division\",\"Research Department\"]', '[0]', 'Remember the distinction between the parent company (Elysium Technology) and the operating entity (PhDiZone).', 'The document clearly states that the entity is PhDiZone, which operates under Elysium Technology Private Limited as the parent company. PhDiZone is the specific business unit where this role exists.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1189, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the hierarchical level of the Project Coordinator position?', '[\"Level 3, Grade II\",\"Level 5, Grade III\",\"Level 4, Grade III\",\"Level 6, Grade IV\"]', '[1]', 'Level 5 and Grade III together indicate senior-level responsibility with significant autonomy and leadership expectations.', 'The document explicitly states the position is Level 5, Grade III, indicating this is a senior leadership position within the organizational hierarchy requiring advanced expertise and decision-making authority.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1190, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'To whom does the Project Coordinator directly report?', '[\"Production Manager\",\"Senior Project Manager only\",\"Project Manager or Senior Project Manager\",\"Department Head\"]', '[2]', 'The slash notation indicates flexibility in reporting structure based on organizational needs.', 'The reporting authority is listed as Project Manager / Senior Project Manager, meaning the position can report to either role depending on organizational structure and project complexity.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1191, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which department and division does this role belong to?', '[\"Research Department, Academic Division\",\"Production Department, Production Division\",\"Operations Department, Service Division\",\"Management Department, Strategic Division\"]', '[1]', 'Both department and division share the same \'Production\' designation, making it easier to remember.', 'The document clearly identifies both the department as Production Department and the division as Production Division, indicating this role focuses on operational delivery and execution.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1192, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What generation classification is assigned to this position?', '[\"Gen 3\",\"Gen 4\",\"Gen 5\",\"Gen 6\"]', '[2]', 'Generation classifications often reflect the evolution and maturity of role definitions within an organization.', 'The position is classified as Gen 5, which typically indicates a mature role with well-established processes and expectations within the organizational evolution framework.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1193, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of teams does the Project Coordinator orchestrate?', '[\"Single-functional specialized teams\",\"Cross-functional teams\",\"External vendor teams only\",\"Management-level teams\"]', '[1]', 'Cross-functional coordination is a core competency requiring the ability to work across different specializations simultaneously.', 'The job clarity section explicitly states the coordinator orchestrates cross-functional teams, which means coordinating across research, writing, technical, and editorial functions for integrated project delivery.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1194, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus of PhDiZone\'s services?', '[\"Corporate consulting services\",\"Research and academic service projects\",\"Technology development\",\"Educational training programs\"]', '[1]', 'Understanding PhDiZone\'s academic and research focus helps contextualize why project coordination requires deep knowledge of research processes.', 'The document consistently refers to PhDiZone\'s complex research and academic service projects, indicating the organization specializes in supporting academic and research endeavors for clients and students.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1195, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of operational leader is the Project Coordinator described as?', '[\"Tactical operational leader\",\"Strategic operational leader\",\"Administrative operational leader\",\"Technical operational leader\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic operational leadership means thinking beyond day-to-day tasks to impact long-term project success and organizational capabilities.', 'The job clarity explicitly identifies the Project Coordinator as a strategic operational leader, emphasizing the role combines strategic thinking with operational execution rather than just tactical task management.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1196, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the role ensure from project initiation through completion?', '[\"Budget adherence\",\"Team satisfaction\",\"Seamless project execution\",\"Technical accuracy\"]', '[2]', 'Seamless execution implies proactive planning and coordination that prevents issues rather than just reacting to them.', 'The document states the role ensures seamless project execution from initiation through completion, emphasizing smooth, integrated coordination throughout the entire project lifecycle without disruptions.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1197, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three key areas does the Project Coordinator maintain PhDiZone\'s standards in?', '[\"Quality, cost, and innovation\",\"Quality, timeliness, and academic excellence\",\"Speed, accuracy, and client relations\",\"Efficiency, compliance, and profitability\"]', '[1]', 'These three standards form the quality triangle for academic research projects: delivering excellent work on time while meeting academic standards.', 'The document explicitly lists quality, timeliness, and academic excellence as the three standards the coordinator maintains, reflecting PhDiZone\'s core values in academic service delivery.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1198, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How does the role impact PhDiZone\'s organizational capabilities?', '[\"By reducing operational costs\",\"By scaling complex academic research support services effectively\",\"By increasing marketing reach\",\"By automating project processes\"]', '[1]', 'Scalability requires creating systems and processes that work consistently as project volume increases.', 'The document emphasizes the role directly impacts the organization\'s ability to scale complex academic research support services effectively, indicating the position is critical for growth and expansion.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1199, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'Who does the Project Coordinator directly supervise?', '[\"Project Managers and Team Leads\",\"Junior Project Coordinators, Research Assistants, and Administrative Assistants\",\"Senior researchers and editors\",\"Client relationship managers\"]', '[1]', 'Direct reports include both coordination roles and support roles, requiring diverse management approaches.', 'The reporting hierarchy clearly lists Junior Project Coordinators, Research Assistants, and Administrative Assistants as direct reports, indicating responsibility for developing and managing support staff.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1200, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of authority does the Project Coordinator have over functional teams?', '[\"Direct line authority\",\"Advisory authority only\",\"Matrix leadership authority\",\"No formal authority\"]', '[2]', 'Matrix authority requires strong influence and coordination skills since you don\'t have direct hierarchical control.', 'The document specifies the role has matrix leadership with strategic coordination authority over Research, Content, Technical, and Editorial Teams for assigned projects, meaning functional influence without direct reporting lines.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1201, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What combines with project management expertise in this senior role?', '[\"Technical research skills\",\"Deep understanding of academic research processes\",\"Financial management expertise\",\"Marketing and sales knowledge\"]', '[1]', 'Success requires being bilingual in both project management methodologies and academic research standards.', 'The job clarity states this role combines advanced project management expertise with deep understanding of academic research processes, making it uniquely suited for academic service coordination.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1202, 1, 32, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What aspect of project coordination does the role emphasize beyond task completion?', '[\"Budget tracking\",\"Risk management and client satisfaction\",\"Documentation only\",\"Team scheduling\"]', '[1]', 'Proactive risk management and client focus differentiate coordinators from administrators who only track tasks.', 'The document emphasizes the coordinator ensures optimal resource utilization, risk management, and client satisfaction through systematic approaches, going beyond basic task completion to strategic outcome management.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1203, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first primary responsibility area listed for the Project Coordinator?', '[\"Client Communication\",\"Strategic Project Planning & Resource Management\",\"Quality Assurance\",\"Team Development\"]', '[1]', 'The order of responsibilities often indicates priority; strategic planning comes before execution activities.', 'Strategic Project Planning & Resource Management is listed as the first primary responsibility, indicating it is the foundational duty from which other responsibilities flow.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1204, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently should the Project Coordinator review project tasks and timelines?', '[\"Weekly\",\"Daily\",\"Monthly\",\"As needed\"]', '[1]', 'Daily review enables quick identification and resolution of issues before they compound.', 'The document explicitly states the coordinator must review and optimize daily project tasks, timelines, and resource allocation, emphasizing the need for constant monitoring and adjustment.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1205, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'On what basis should research and project tasks be allocated among team members?', '[\"Seniority and availability\",\"Expertise and capacity\",\"Random assignment\",\"Personal preference\"]', '[1]', 'Matching tasks to expertise maximizes quality, while considering capacity prevents burnout and missed deadlines.', 'The document specifies tasks should be allocated strategically based on expertise and capacity, ensuring the right person with the right skills and availability handles each task.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1206, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Project Coordinator do with project deadlines?', '[\"Set them once at project start\",\"Monitor them systematically and ensure tasks remain on track\",\"Delegate monitoring to team members\",\"Review them monthly\"]', '[1]', 'Systematic monitoring means having processes and checkpoints that catch delays early.', 'The role requires systematic monitoring of deadlines to ensure all tasks remain on track for successful completion, indicating active, ongoing oversight rather than passive tracking.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1207, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Project Coordinator develop for complex project challenges?', '[\"Escalation procedures\",\"Mitigation strategies\",\"Documentation protocols\",\"Training programs\"]', '[1]', 'Effective mitigation strategies are developed before risks materialize, not after problems occur.', 'The document states coordinators must forecast risks and develop mitigation strategies for complex project challenges, emphasizing proactive problem-solving rather than reactive crisis management.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1208, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which teams must the Project Coordinator coordinate with for integrated project delivery?', '[\"Research and writing teams only\",\"Technical and editorial teams only\",\"Research, writing, technical, and editorial teams\",\"Management and administrative teams\"]', '[2]', 'Remember the four core functional teams by the project workflow: research → writing → technical → editorial.', 'The document explicitly lists coordination with research, writing, technical, and editorial teams for integrated project delivery, covering the full spectrum of academic project needs.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1209, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of daily meetings should the Project Coordinator lead?', '[\"Client status meetings\",\"Stand-ups and project calls\",\"Performance reviews\",\"Training sessions\"]', '[1]', 'Daily stand-ups are brief synchronization meetings, not lengthy status reports; keep them focused and time-boxed.', 'The document specifies leading daily stand-ups and project calls to maintain alignment and momentum, using agile-style brief meetings to keep teams synchronized.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1210, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should the Project Coordinator respond to student and client emails?', '[\"Within 48 hours\",\"Professionally with comprehensive updates and guidance\",\"By forwarding to relevant teams\",\"Only for urgent matters\"]', '[1]', 'Comprehensive responses reduce follow-up questions and build client confidence in your coordination abilities.', 'The responsibility explicitly states responding professionally while providing comprehensive project updates and guidance, emphasizing thorough, helpful communication rather than brief acknowledgments.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1211, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of reports should be provided on project progress?', '[\"Brief status updates\",\"Detailed reports on progress, milestones, and deliverable completion\",\"Financial summaries\",\"Team performance evaluations\"]', '[1]', 'Structure reports around the three key elements: what\'s done, what milestones are hit, and what deliverables are complete.', 'The document requires detailed status reports covering progress, milestones, and deliverable completion, ensuring stakeholders have comprehensive visibility into project status.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1212, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should urgent issues be handled according to the responsibilities?', '[\"Resolved at the coordinator level\",\"Documented for review\",\"Escalated to senior management with strategic recommendations\",\"Delegated to team leads\"]', '[2]', 'Always escalate with recommendations, not just problems; demonstrate strategic thinking in your escalations.', 'The document states urgent issues should be escalated to senior management with strategic recommendations, indicating coordinators should provide solutions-oriented escalations, not just problem reports.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1213, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three types of documentation must the Project Coordinator maintain?', '[\"Budgets, schedules, and contracts\",\"Project logs, task tracking sheets, and deliverable documentation\",\"Emails, reports, and presentations\",\"Training materials, guides, and templates\"]', '[1]', 'Think of these three as past (logs), present (tracking), and future (deliverables) documentation.', 'The quality assurance responsibility lists comprehensive project logs, task tracking sheets, and deliverable documentation as the three core document types that must be maintained.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1214, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be recorded for audit trails and quality assurance?', '[\"Team attendance and hours\",\"Client feedback only\",\"Approvals, revisions, and updates\",\"Budget expenditures\"]', '[2]', 'Audit trails require documentation of decision points, not just outcomes; capture who approved what and when.', 'The document specifies recording approvals, revisions, and updates for audit trails and quality assurance, creating a complete history of project decisions and changes.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1215, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What frequency of project reports should the Project Coordinator prepare for management?', '[\"Daily only\",\"Weekly and monthly\",\"Monthly only\",\"Quarterly\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reports focus on operational progress; monthly reports emphasize strategic trends and overall performance.', 'The performance monitoring responsibility explicitly requires preparing comprehensive weekly and monthly project reports for management and clients, providing both tactical and strategic visibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1216, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Project Coordinator track as key performance indicators?', '[\"Budget and costs only\",\"Submissions, deadlines, and quality metrics\",\"Team satisfaction scores\",\"Client acquisition rates\"]', '[1]', 'These three KPIs answer: What was delivered? Was it on time? Did it meet quality standards?', 'The document states coordinators must track key performance indicators including submissions, deadlines, and quality metrics, covering the three critical dimensions of project success.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1217, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be done with recurring issues identified in projects?', '[\"Document them for future reference\",\"Report them to clients\",\"Analyze them and propose strategic improvements for operational excellence\",\"Assign them to team members\"]', '[2]', 'Transform patterns into process improvements; recurring issues signal systemic opportunities for enhancement.', 'The performance monitoring section requires analyzing recurring issues and proposing strategic improvements for operational excellence, emphasizing continuous improvement rather than just problem documentation.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1218, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What aspect of projects should the coordinator monitor for business optimization?', '[\"Client satisfaction ratings\",\"Project profitability and resource efficiency\",\"Team morale\",\"Documentation completeness\"]', '[1]', 'Resource efficiency and profitability are interconnected; better resource use directly improves project margins.', 'The document requires monitoring project profitability and resource efficiency for business optimization, indicating coordinators must understand and manage the business economics of projects.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1219, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Project Coordinator implement systematically for workflow improvements?', '[\"New software tools only\",\"Systematic enhancements after identifying improvement areas\",\"Training programs\",\"Client feedback systems\"]', '[1]', 'Systematic enhancements are repeatable and scalable; they improve processes for all future projects, not just one.', 'The process improvement responsibility states coordinators should identify areas for workflow improvements and implement systematic enhancements, emphasizing structured, thoughtful improvement rather than ad-hoc changes.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1220, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be standardized to improve operational consistency?', '[\"Client communication schedules\",\"Project templates, documentation, and operational procedures\",\"Team meeting agendas\",\"Performance review criteria\"]', '[1]', 'Standardization reduces variability and errors while making training and onboarding more efficient.', 'The document requires standardizing project templates, documentation, and operational procedures, creating consistent frameworks that ensure quality and efficiency across all projects.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1221, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be encouraged for complex project challenges and academic requirements?', '[\"Following established procedures strictly\",\"Creative solutions\",\"Escalation to management\",\"External consultation\"]', '[1]', 'Complex academic projects often require novel approaches; encourage team creativity while maintaining quality standards.', 'The process improvement section explicitly states coordinators should encourage creative solutions to complex project challenges and academic requirements, fostering innovation rather than rigid adherence to existing processes.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1222, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of training should the Project Coordinator conduct for project teams?', '[\"Technical skills training only\",\"Regular training sessions and knowledge-sharing workshops\",\"Compliance training\",\"Software tutorials\"]', '[1]', 'Regular training builds team capabilities systematically; knowledge-sharing leverages internal expertise effectively.', 'The team development responsibility requires conducting regular training sessions and knowledge-sharing workshops, emphasizing ongoing learning and knowledge transfer within teams.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1223, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should junior coordinators and team members receive from the Project Coordinator?', '[\"Task assignments only\",\"Mentoring in project management best practices\",\"Performance evaluations\",\"Administrative support\"]', '[1]', 'Effective mentoring transfers not just what to do, but why and how to think strategically about project management.', 'The document states coordinators should mentor junior coordinators and team members in project management best practices, indicating a responsibility for developing future project management talent.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1224, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be facilitated to promote collaborative problem-solving?', '[\"Weekly status meetings\",\"Cross-team discussions and collaborative problem-solving sessions\",\"Individual coaching sessions\",\"Client workshops\"]', '[1]', 'Cross-team collaboration surfaces different perspectives and builds relationships that improve future coordination.', 'The team development section requires facilitating cross-team discussions and collaborative problem-solving sessions, breaking down silos and leveraging diverse expertise for better solutions.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1225, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be tracked regarding team skill development?', '[\"Certification completion\",\"Team skill development and adoption of improved processes\",\"Training hours logged\",\"Individual performance scores\"]', '[1]', 'Track both learning and application; skill development isn\'t complete until new capabilities are regularly used.', 'The document requires tracking team skill development and adoption of improved processes, ensuring training translates into actual capability improvement and behavior change.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1226, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the Project Coordinator track to optimize resource utilization?', '[\"Budget expenditures\",\"Team attendance, availability, and productivity\",\"Client satisfaction scores\",\"Project completion dates\"]', '[1]', 'These three metrics together give a complete picture: who\'s here, who\'s free, and how effectively work is being done.', 'The cross-functional team leadership responsibility requires tracking team attendance, availability, and productivity to optimize resource utilization, ensuring people are present, available, and productive.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1227, 1, 40, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How should the Project Coordinator handle complex queries during project execution?', '[\"Escalate to senior management\",\"Resolve them and provide strategic clarifications\",\"Delegate to subject matter experts\",\"Document for later review\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic clarifications connect immediate questions to broader project goals and approaches.', 'The document states coordinators should resolve complex queries and provide strategic clarifications for project execution, demonstrating decision-making authority and expertise in guiding teams.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1228, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many Key Result Areas (KRAs) are defined for the Project Coordinator?', '[\"Three\",\"Five\",\"Seven\",\"Ten\"]', '[1]', 'The five KRAs cover the full scope: delivery, leadership, clients, processes, and performance analytics.', 'The document lists exactly five Key Result Areas: Project Delivery Excellence & Timeline Management, Team Leadership & Cross-Functional Coordination, Client Satisfaction & Stakeholder Management, Process Optimization & Operational Innovation, and Performance Management & Strategic Analytics.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1229, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum on-time delivery rate target for projects?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"90%\",\"100%\"]', '[1]', '98% means only 1 in 50 projects can be late; this requires exceptional planning and monitoring.', 'The KPI for On-Time Delivery Rate explicitly states achieving greater than or equal to 98% on-time project completion across all assigned projects, setting a very high standard for timeline management.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1230, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum project quality score threshold?', '[\"4.5\\/5.0\",\"4.9\\/5.0\",\"4.7\\/5.0\",\"5.0\\/5.0\"]', '[1]', '4.9/5.0 allows minimal margin for error; this requires consistent excellence, not just good performance.', 'The Project Quality Score KPI requires maintaining greater than or equal to 4.9/5.0 average client satisfaction rating for project delivery quality, indicating near-perfect quality expectations.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1231, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum resource utilization efficiency target?', '[\"90%\",\"92%\",\"95%\",\"98%\"]', '[1]', '92% utilization balances efficiency with sustainability; 100% would risk burnout and quality issues.', 'The Resource Utilization Efficiency KPI specifies achieving greater than or equal to 92% optimal resource allocation and team productivity, indicating very high expectations for capacity management.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1232, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of productivity targets should teams achieve?', '[\"100%\",\"105%\",\"110%\",\"115%\"]', '[2]', '110% targets stretch performance beyond minimum expectations, driving continuous improvement.', 'The Team Performance KPI states teams should achieve 110% of productivity targets through effective coordination, indicating expectation to exceed baseline standards consistently.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1233, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum leadership effectiveness rating required?', '[\"4.5\\/5.0\",\"4.8\\/5.0\",\"4.9\\/5.0\",\"5.0\\/5.0\"]', '[1]', 'Leadership ratings come from those you lead; this measures actual impact on team experience, not intentions.', 'The Leadership Effectiveness KPI requires maintaining greater than or equal to 4.8/5.0 team satisfaction rating for leadership and coordination quality, setting high standards for people management.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1234, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What cross-functional collaboration satisfaction rating must be achieved?', '[\"4.5\\/5.0\",\"4.7\\/5.0\",\"4.9\\/5.0\",\"5.0\\/5.0\"]', '[1]', 'Cross-functional ratings are harder to achieve than single-team ratings due to diverse perspectives and priorities.', 'The Cross-Functional Collaboration KPI specifies achieving greater than or equal to 4.7/5.0 satisfaction rating from all collaborating departments, measuring effectiveness across organizational boundaries.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1235, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum client communication quality rating?', '[\"4.7\\/5.0\",\"4.9\\/5.0\",\"4.5\\/5.0\",\"5.0\\/5.0\"]', '[1]', 'Communication quality encompasses clarity, timeliness, completeness, and professionalism in all interactions.', 'The Client Communication Quality KPI requires maintaining greater than or equal to 4.9/5.0 rating for communication effectiveness and responsiveness, emphasizing the critical importance of client interaction quality.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1236, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of client issues must be resolved within 4 hours?', '[\"90%\",\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\"]', '[1]', 'The two-tier timeline (4 hours for 95%, 24 hours for all) recognizes some issues are more complex but still requires fast resolution.', 'The Issue Resolution Time KPI states that 95% of client issues must be resolved within 4 hours, with 100% resolved within 24 hours, setting aggressive responsiveness standards.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1237, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the minimum stakeholder satisfaction target?', '[\"90%\",\"92%\",\"95%\",\"98%\"]', '[2]', 'Stakeholder satisfaction is broader than client satisfaction, including internal teams, management, and external partners.', 'The Stakeholder Satisfaction KPI requires achieving greater than or equal to 95% stakeholder satisfaction across all managed projects, measuring overall project success from all stakeholder perspectives.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1238, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many significant process enhancements must be implemented annually?', '[\"At least 3\",\"At least 5\",\"At least 7\",\"At least 10\"]', '[1]', 'Significant enhancements have measurable impact; this isn\'t about minor tweaks but meaningful improvements.', 'The Process Improvement Impact KPI requires implementing a minimum of 5 significant process enhancements annually, ensuring consistent contribution to operational improvement.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1239, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many new tools, methods, or workflows must be introduced annually?', '[\"Minimum 2\",\"Minimum 3\",\"Minimum 5\",\"Minimum 7\"]', '[1]', 'Innovation contributions should address real problems or opportunities, not innovation for its own sake.', 'The Innovation Contribution KPI specifies introducing a minimum of 3 new tools, methods, or workflows annually, encouraging ongoing innovation in project management approaches.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1240, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What level of accuracy is required in project documentation?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\",\"99%\"]', '[2]', '100% accuracy is achievable through systematic review processes and quality checks before finalization.', 'The Documentation Excellence KPI requires maintaining 100% accuracy in project documentation and compliance standards, indicating zero tolerance for documentation errors.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1241, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What standard must reporting quality achieve?', '[\"Comprehensive and actionable with 95% accuracy\",\"Comprehensive and actionable with 100% accuracy and strategic insights\",\"Timely with 98% accuracy\",\"Detailed with minimal errors\"]', '[1]', 'Great reporting is accurate, comprehensive, actionable, and provides strategic context beyond just data.', 'The Reporting Quality KPI requires delivering comprehensive, actionable reports with 100% accuracy and strategic insights, combining multiple quality dimensions in one standard.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1242, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of assigned KPIs must be met or exceeded monthly?', '[\"90%\",\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\"]', '[3]', 'Meeting 100% of KPIs monthly requires strong planning, monitoring, and course correction capabilities.', 'The KPI Achievement metric requires meeting or exceeding 100% of assigned project performance indicators monthly, setting an expectation for consistent excellence across all measured dimensions.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1243, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many strategic recommendations must be provided annually?', '[\"Minimum 2\",\"Minimum 3\",\"Minimum 4\",\"Minimum 5\"]', '[2]', 'Strategic recommendations should be based on data and insights gathered from managing multiple projects over time.', 'The Strategic Contribution KPI requires providing a minimum of 4 strategic recommendations annually that drive business improvements, ensuring ongoing strategic thinking beyond operational execution.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1244, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first Key Result Area focused on?', '[\"Team development\",\"Project Delivery Excellence & Timeline Management\",\"Client satisfaction\",\"Process improvement\"]', '[1]', 'Project delivery excellence is the foundation; other KRAs support or enhance this primary outcome.', 'Project Delivery Excellence & Timeline Management is listed as the first KRA, emphasizing that successful on-time project delivery is the foundational responsibility of the role.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1245, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Team Leadership & Cross-Functional Coordination KRA emphasize?', '[\"Individual performance management\",\"High-performance team culture and seamless collaboration across functions\",\"Budget management\",\"Technical skill development\"]', '[1]', 'Cross-functional coordination is harder than single-team leadership because it requires influence without direct authority.', 'This KRA explicitly focuses on driving high-performance team culture while facilitating seamless collaboration across research, writing, technical, and editorial functions.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1246, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three elements define the Client Satisfaction & Stakeholder Management KRA?', '[\"Communication, escalation, and reporting\",\"Proactive communication, transparent reporting, and responsive issue resolution\",\"Availability, documentation, and follow-up\",\"Meetings, emails, and status updates\"]', '[1]', 'Proactive communication prevents issues; transparent reporting builds trust; responsive resolution maintains confidence.', 'The document defines this KRA through maintaining superior relationships via proactive communication, transparent reporting, and responsive issue resolution, covering the full spectrum of client interaction.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1247, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Process Optimization & Operational Innovation KRA lead?', '[\"Technology implementation\",\"Continuous improvement initiatives that enhance efficiency, quality, and capabilities\",\"Cost reduction programs\",\"Staff training\"]', '[1]', 'Effective process optimization improves efficiency and quality simultaneously, not one at the expense of the other.', 'This KRA focuses on leading continuous improvement initiatives that enhance project efficiency, quality standards, and organizational capabilities, emphasizing systematic enhancement across multiple dimensions.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1248, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Performance Management & Strategic Analytics KRA provide?', '[\"Financial reports to management\",\"Strategic insights through comprehensive performance analysis for senior management\",\"Team performance reviews\",\"Project status updates\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic analytics transforms data into actionable insights that inform decision-making, not just reporting what happened.', 'This KRA emphasizes providing strategic insights through comprehensive performance analysis and data-driven decision support for senior management, focusing on strategic value rather than just reporting.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1249, 1, 44, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does resource optimization in the first KRA emphasize?', '[\"Cost reduction\",\"Strategic planning, resource optimization, and systematic execution monitoring\",\"Team size management\",\"Budget adherence\"]', '[1]', 'These three elements form a cycle: plan strategically, optimize resources, monitor execution, and repeat.', 'The Project Delivery Excellence KRA explicitly emphasizes ensuring exceptional outcomes through strategic planning, resource optimization, and systematic execution monitoring, covering the full project lifecycle.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1250, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary basis for performance evaluation?', '[\"Client satisfaction scores\",\"Project delivery excellence, leadership effectiveness, and strategic contribution\",\"Number of projects completed\",\"Team productivity metrics\"]', '[1]', 'Performance is judged holistically across outcomes (delivery), people (leadership), and thinking (strategy).', 'The performance measurement framework emphasizes these three areas as the foundation for evaluation, covering operational excellence, people leadership, and strategic thinking.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1251, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'Through what three mechanisms is performance monitored?', '[\"Reports, meetings, and reviews\",\"Project outcomes, team performance metrics, and client satisfaction assessments\",\"KPIs, dashboards, and audits\",\"Feedback, surveys, and interviews\"]', '[1]', 'These three monitoring mechanisms capture what you deliver, how your team performs, and how clients perceive value.', 'The document states the coordinator undergoes comprehensive performance monitoring through project outcomes, team performance metrics, and client satisfaction assessments, providing multiple performance perspectives.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1252, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of reports must be submitted daily?', '[\"Financial summaries\",\"Project progress summaries, resource allocation updates, and critical issue escalations\",\"Team attendance logs\",\"Client feedback reports\"]', '[1]', 'Daily reports focus on current status and urgent issues, not historical analysis or long-term trends.', 'Daily reporting requirements include project progress summaries, resource allocation updates, and critical issue escalations, providing management with current operational visibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1253, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should weekly reports contain?', '[\"Budget variance analysis\",\"Comprehensive project performance analysis, team productivity metrics, and client satisfaction updates\",\"Training completion rates\",\"Process improvement proposals\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reports aggregate daily data into trends, showing patterns in performance, productivity, and satisfaction.', 'Weekly reports require comprehensive project performance analysis, team productivity metrics, and client satisfaction updates, providing tactical-level performance visibility across key dimensions.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1254, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is included in monthly reports?', '[\"Individual performance reviews\",\"Strategic project portfolio analysis, performance trend assessment, and operational improvement recommendations\",\"Budget reconciliation\",\"Training plans\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly reports look at the bigger picture: portfolio health, long-term trends, and strategic recommendations.', 'Monthly reports focus on strategic project portfolio analysis, performance trend assessment, and operational improvement recommendations, providing strategic insights rather than just operational updates.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1255, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What time does the daily project leadership schedule begin?', '[\"8:00 AM\",\"8:30 AM\",\"9:00 AM\",\"9:30 AM\"]', '[1]', 'Starting with strategic review ensures daily activities align with priorities rather than just reacting to incoming requests.', 'The work schedule shows the day begins at 8:30 AM with strategic project review and daily priority setting across the project portfolio, establishing the foundation for the day\'s work.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1256, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur from 9:00 AM to 10:30 AM?', '[\"Client meetings\",\"Project planning, task allocation, and team coordination activities\",\"Quality reviews\",\"Performance analysis\"]', '[1]', 'Morning planning and coordination set teams up for productive execution throughout the rest of the day.', 'The schedule allocates 9:00 AM to 10:30 AM for project planning, task allocation, and team coordination activities, translating morning priorities into concrete assignments.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1257, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'When does client communication and stakeholder management occur?', '[\"9:00 AM - 10:30 AM\",\"10:30 AM - 12:00 PM\",\"1:00 PM - 2:30 PM\",\"4:00 PM - 5:00 PM\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-morning timing allows coordinators to have current information from morning planning before client interactions.', 'The schedule designates 10:30 AM to 12:00 PM for client communication, stakeholder management, and project status updates, ensuring mid-morning focus on external relationships.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1258, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities are scheduled for 1:00 PM to 2:30 PM?', '[\"Team development\",\"Quality assurance activities, deliverable review, and process monitoring\",\"Strategic planning\",\"Performance analysis\"]', '[1]', 'Afternoon quality checks catch issues while there\'s still time in the day to address them if needed.', 'The afternoon slot from 1:00 PM to 2:30 PM is dedicated to quality assurance activities, deliverable review, and process monitoring, ensuring output meets standards before delivery.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1259, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'When does cross-functional coordination occur?', '[\"Morning hours\",\"2:30 PM - 4:00 PM\",\"Late afternoon\",\"Throughout the day\"]', '[1]', 'Dedicated cross-functional time ensures coordination happens proactively, not just when crises emerge.', 'The schedule allocates 2:30 PM to 4:00 PM specifically for cross-functional coordination and issue resolution management, addressing cross-team challenges systematically.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1260, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur from 4:00 PM to 5:00 PM?', '[\"Client follow-ups\",\"Team development activities, mentoring sessions, and strategic planning\",\"Report writing\",\"Administrative tasks\"]', '[1]', 'End-of-day timing for development activities allows reflection on the day\'s lessons for mentoring conversations.', 'The late afternoon slot from 4:00 PM to 5:00 PM focuses on team development, mentoring, and strategic planning, investing in people and future capabilities.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1261, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens in the final work period from 5:00 PM to 5:30 PM?', '[\"Team meetings\",\"Documentation updates, performance analysis, and next-day preparation\",\"Client calls\",\"Process reviews\"]', '[1]', 'End-of-day preparation makes the next morning more productive by starting with clarity rather than chaos.', 'The schedule ends with documentation updates, performance analysis, and next-day preparation from 5:00 PM to 5:30 PM, ensuring closure and readiness for tomorrow.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1262, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is Monday\'s weekly strategic priority?', '[\"Client engagement\",\"Weekly project portfolio review and strategic resource planning with senior management\",\"Process improvement\",\"Team development\"]', '[1]', 'Monday planning with leadership ensures weekly priorities align with organizational objectives and resource availability.', 'Monday is designated for weekly project portfolio review and strategic resource planning with senior management, setting the strategic context for the week ahead.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1263, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities dominate Tuesday and Wednesday?', '[\"Reporting and analysis\",\"Intensive project coordination and client engagement activities\",\"Process improvement\",\"Training and development\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-week intensive coordination leverages full team availability and maintains momentum between Monday planning and Friday review.', 'The schedule designates Tuesday and Wednesday for intensive project coordination and client engagement activities, focusing mid-week energy on core delivery and client work.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1264, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is Thursday\'s focus?', '[\"Client meetings\",\"Cross-departmental collaboration and process improvement initiatives\",\"Performance reviews\",\"Strategic planning\"]', '[1]', 'Thursday timing allows coordinators to identify improvement opportunities from the week\'s work while there\'s still time to plan implementations.', 'Thursday is specifically designated for cross-departmental collaboration and process improvement initiatives, dedicating time to systemic enhancements and organizational integration.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1265, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur on Friday?', '[\"Project planning\",\"Performance analysis, team development, and strategic planning activities\",\"Client onboarding\",\"Quality audits\"]', '[1]', 'Friday analysis and planning close the current week and prepare for the next, creating continuity across weeks.', 'Friday focuses on performance analysis, team development, and strategic planning activities, using end-of-week perspective for reflection, learning, and forward planning.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1266, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens continuously throughout the week?', '[\"Strategic planning\",\"Continuous project monitoring, quality assurance, and stakeholder communication\",\"Training sessions\",\"Process documentation\"]', '[1]', 'Continuous activities require sustained attention throughout each day, integrated with scheduled activities.', 'The schedule notes that project monitoring, quality assurance, and stakeholder communication occur continuously throughout the week, not just in designated time slots.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1267, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens in Week 1 of monthly excellence initiatives?', '[\"Process improvement\",\"Monthly strategic planning and goal setting with comprehensive project portfolio analysis\",\"Team reviews\",\"Client relationship building\"]', '[1]', 'Month-opening strategic planning aligns all subsequent weekly activities with monthly objectives.', 'Week 1 focuses on monthly strategic planning and goal setting with comprehensive project portfolio analysis, establishing monthly direction and priorities.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1268, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the focus of Week 2 in the monthly cycle?', '[\"Strategic planning\",\"Process improvement implementation and operational optimization projects\",\"Performance reviews\",\"Client engagement\"]', '[1]', 'Week 2 timing allows implementation of improvements identified in Week 1 planning while energy and focus remain high.', 'Week 2 is dedicated to process improvement implementation and operational optimization projects, translating improvement ideas into actual implementation.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1269, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens in Week 3 of the monthly schedule?', '[\"Budget reviews\",\"Client relationship management and stakeholder engagement initiatives\",\"Process audits\",\"Technology implementation\"]', '[1]', 'Mid-to-late month timing for client focus allows addressing any issues before month-end while projects are in active phases.', 'Week 3 focuses on client relationship management and stakeholder engagement initiatives, ensuring strong relationships and alignment with external partners.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(1270, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What activities occur in Week 4?', '[\"Project planning\",\"Team development activities, performance reviews, and strategic alignment planning\",\"Client acquisition\",\"Process documentation\"]', '[1]', 'Month-end focus on team development and alignment ensures people are prepared and motivated for the upcoming month.', 'Week 4 concludes the month with team development, performance reviews, and strategic alignment planning, closing the current month and preparing for the next.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1271, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does \'Daily Excellence\' require in the Project Management Excellence Framework?', '[\"Meeting all deadlines\",\"Consistent demonstration of project leadership and operational excellence\",\"Zero errors\",\"Perfect attendance\"]', '[1]', 'Daily excellence means making excellence a habit, not an exception; consistency matters more than peak performance.', 'Daily Excellence is defined as consistent demonstration of project leadership and operational excellence, emphasizing sustained high performance rather than occasional heroics.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1272, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does \'Weekly Innovation\' emphasize?', '[\"New product ideas\",\"Regular implementation of process improvements and strategic initiatives\",\"Technology adoption\",\"Client proposals\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly innovation pace ensures improvements accumulate rapidly without disrupting ongoing operations.', 'Weekly Innovation requires regular implementation of process improvements and strategic initiatives, ensuring continuous enhancement becomes routine practice.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1273, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must Monthly Strategy deliver?', '[\"Budget reports\",\"Comprehensive strategic contribution to business objectives and organizational growth\",\"Training plans\",\"Client presentations\"]', '[1]', 'Monthly strategic contributions should be significant enough to influence organizational direction and capabilities.', 'Monthly Strategy requires comprehensive strategic contribution to business objectives and organizational growth, demonstrating impact beyond operational execution.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1274, 1, 49, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Quarterly Leadership involve?', '[\"Performance reviews\",\"Advanced strategic planning and organizational capability development\",\"Budget planning\",\"Client strategy reviews\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly timeframe allows for substantial strategic initiatives that require time to plan, implement, and realize impact.', 'Quarterly Leadership requires advanced strategic planning and organizational capability development, focusing on longer-term strategic initiatives and building organizational capacity.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1275, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the time horizon for immediate leadership objectives?', '[\"0-3 months\",\"0-6 months\",\"0-9 months\",\"0-12 months\"]', '[1]', 'The first six months establish patterns and capabilities that support all subsequent performance.', 'The job vision section defines immediate leadership objectives as covering the 0-6 month period, focusing on establishing foundational excellence in the role.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1276, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What will the coordinator establish during the first 0-6 months?', '[\"Strategic partnerships\",\"Excellence in multi-project management and advanced capabilities in academic research project coordination\",\"New processes\",\"Client relationships\"]', '[1]', 'First six months balance proving capability in current scope while developing skills for future expansion.', 'Immediate objectives focus on establishing excellence in multi-project management while building advanced capabilities in academic research project coordination, creating a strong foundation.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1277, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three focus areas are emphasized in the first 0-6 months?', '[\"Planning, execution, and reporting\",\"Optimizing workflows, developing team leadership, and implementing systematic approaches to client satisfaction\",\"Hiring, training, and retention\",\"Strategy, operations, and finance\"]', '[1]', 'These three areas create a foundation: efficient processes, strong teams, and satisfied clients.', 'The document specifies three focus areas for immediate objectives: optimizing project workflows, developing team leadership skills, and implementing systematic approaches to client satisfaction and quality delivery.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1278, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the timeframe for medium-term strategic development?', '[\"3-12 months\",\"6-18 months\",\"12-24 months\",\"18-36 months\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term development builds on the foundation established in months 0-6, expanding scope and strategic impact.', 'Medium-term strategic development is defined as occurring over the 6-18 month period, representing the evolution phase beyond initial establishment.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1279, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of specialist will the coordinator evolve into during months 6-18?', '[\"Operations specialist\",\"Senior project management specialist with expertise in complex academic research projects\",\"Client relationship specialist\",\"Process improvement specialist\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term evolution emphasizes deepening specialization in complex academic projects, not broadening into unrelated areas.', 'The medium-term vision describes evolution into a senior project management specialist with expertise in complex academic research projects and cross-functional team leadership.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1280, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three areas expand during medium-term development?', '[\"Budget, staffing, and technology\",\"Strategic planning, advanced client relationship management, and organizational process innovation\",\"Training, documentation, and reporting\",\"Sales, marketing, and operations\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term expansion adds strategic responsibilities while maintaining operational excellence established earlier.', 'The role expands to include strategic planning responsibilities, advanced client relationship management, and leadership in organizational process innovation initiatives during the medium term.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1281, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the timeframe for long-term career advancement?', '[\"12+ months\",\"18+ months\",\"24+ months\",\"36+ months\"]', '[1]', 'The 18+ month timeframe allows full demonstration of capabilities before advancing to senior leadership positions.', 'Long-term career advancement is defined as occurring beyond 18 months, representing the progression to senior leadership roles.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1282, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What are the potential progression opportunities mentioned for long-term advancement?', '[\"Director or VP roles\",\"Project Manager, Operations Manager, or Business Operations Director positions\",\"Department Head or C-level roles\",\"Specialized consulting roles\"]', '[1]', 'These three paths offer choices between deeper project specialization, broader operations scope, or strategic business operations leadership.', 'The document explicitly lists progression opportunities as Project Manager, Operations Manager, or Business Operations Director positions, showing clear advancement paths.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1283, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What foundation does this role provide for future careers?', '[\"Technical expertise\",\"Senior leadership in operations management, business development, or specialized roles in academic services\",\"Client relationship management\",\"Financial management\"]', '[1]', 'The breadth of skills developed creates multiple possible career paths rather than a single predetermined trajectory.', 'The role provides excellent foundation for senior leadership in operations management, business development, or specialized roles in academic services project management and strategic planning.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1284, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'Why is this position crucial to PhDiZone according to Strategic Organizational Impact?', '[\"Revenue generation\",\"Operational excellence and scalability, ensuring quality delivery while building organizational capabilities\",\"Market expansion\",\"Technology innovation\"]', '[1]', 'The role bridges current delivery needs with future growth capacity, making it strategically vital.', 'The position is crucial for PhDiZone\'s operational excellence and scalability, ensuring complex academic projects are delivered with exceptional quality while building organizational capabilities for sustainable growth.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1285, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the role support beyond current project delivery?', '[\"Technology upgrades\",\"Sustainable growth and market leadership in academic research services\",\"Cost reduction\",\"Workforce expansion\"]', '[1]', 'Market leadership requires not just delivering projects but building organizational capabilities that competitors cannot easily replicate.', 'The organizational impact emphasizes this position supports sustainable growth and market leadership in academic research services, contributing to long-term competitive advantage.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1286, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'When does Thesis Season Management require intensive coordination?', '[\"Year-round\",\"During peak thesis writing and submission periods\",\"At semester end only\",\"During academic breaks\"]', '[1]', 'Anticipate thesis season peaks by planning resource capacity and streamlining processes well in advance.', 'Thesis Season Management requires intensive project coordination during peak thesis writing and submission periods, recognizing the cyclical nature of academic work.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1287, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What requires enhanced coordination during Journal Publication Cycles?', '[\"Research data collection\",\"Manuscript preparation and peer review processes\",\"Literature reviews\",\"Citation management\"]', '[1]', 'Journal publication coordination requires understanding academic publishing timelines and managing expectations throughout lengthy review processes.', 'Journal Publication Cycles require enhanced coordination during manuscript preparation and peer review processes, managing the complex interactions between authors, journals, and reviewers.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1288, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What do Conference Preparation Periods focus on?', '[\"Travel arrangements\",\"Focused project management during academic conference abstract and paper preparation\",\"Presentation design\",\"Networking activities\"]', '[1]', 'Conference deadlines are typically non-negotiable, requiring aggressive planning and backup contingencies.', 'Conference Preparation Periods require focused project management during academic conference abstract and paper preparation, coordinating tight deadlines for submission.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1289, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Academic Calendar Alignment optimize?', '[\"Holiday scheduling\",\"Resource utilization during academic peak periods through strategic project planning\",\"Course scheduling\",\"Faculty availability\"]', '[1]', 'Understanding academic calendars allows proactive planning to smooth resource utilization and prevent crisis management.', 'Academic Calendar Alignment requires strategic project planning that optimizes resource utilization during academic peak periods, matching capacity to predictable demand cycles.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1290, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Project Excellence in Leadership Standards demonstrate?', '[\"Technical expertise\",\"Unwavering commitment to on-time, high-quality project delivery that exceeds client expectations\",\"Cost control\",\"Process compliance\"]', '[1]', 'Exceeding expectations requires understanding what clients truly value, not just meeting stated requirements.', 'Project Excellence is defined as unwavering commitment to on-time, high-quality project delivery that exceeds client expectations, setting the highest standard for delivery.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1291, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Team Leadership in Leadership Standards drive?', '[\"Individual productivity\",\"Inspirational leadership that drives team performance and professional development\",\"Process compliance\",\"Cost efficiency\"]', '[1]', 'Inspirational leadership creates intrinsic motivation that sustains high performance beyond external pressures.', 'Team Leadership emphasizes inspirational leadership that drives both team performance and professional development, balancing results with people growth.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1292, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Strategic Innovation focus on developing?', '[\"New products\",\"Proactive development of processes and capabilities that advance PhDiZone\'s competitive position\",\"Marketing strategies\",\"Technology platforms\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic innovation creates sustainable competitive advantages, not just incremental improvements to existing processes.', 'Strategic Innovation requires proactive development of processes and capabilities that advance PhDiZone\'s competitive position, linking innovation to competitive advantage.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1293, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Client Partnership emphasize building?', '[\"Contract value\",\"Long-term relationships that support client success and business growth\",\"Repeat business\",\"Referral networks\"]', '[1]', 'True partnerships align success metrics so client achievement directly drives business growth.', 'Client Partnership emphasizes building long-term relationships that support both client success and business growth, creating mutual value rather than transactional exchanges.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1294, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What framework element demonstrates daily operational excellence?', '[\"Daily Reports\",\"Operational Leadership through daily demonstration of excellence in project coordination\",\"Task completion\",\"Meeting attendance\"]', '[1]', 'Daily operational leadership creates the foundation for all strategic achievements through consistent excellent execution.', 'The Strategic Excellence Framework identifies Operational Leadership as the daily demonstration of excellence in project coordination and team performance management.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1295, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Strategic Execution contribute weekly?', '[\"Status reports\",\"Weekly contribution to business objectives through effective project delivery and client satisfaction\",\"Process documentation\",\"Team meetings\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly strategic execution aggregates daily operational excellence into measurable progress toward business objectives.', 'Strategic Execution requires weekly contribution to business objectives through effective project delivery and client satisfaction, connecting operational work to strategic goals.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1296, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently should Innovation Leadership implement improvements?', '[\"Daily\",\"Weekly\",\"Monthly\",\"Quarterly\"]', '[2]', 'Monthly innovation pace allows time for proper planning, implementation, and stabilization before introducing the next change.', 'Innovation Leadership requires monthly implementation of process improvements and operational innovations, setting a sustainable pace for continuous enhancement.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1297, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does Organizational Development contribute quarterly?', '[\"Training programs\",\"Quarterly contribution to capability building and strategic planning initiatives\",\"Performance reviews\",\"Budget planning\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly contributions allow substantial capability building projects that require longer timeframes to plan and implement effectively.', 'Organizational Development requires quarterly contribution to capability building and strategic planning initiatives, ensuring systematic development of organizational capacity.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1298, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Strategic Excellence Framework require at the daily level?', '[\"Completing all assigned tasks\",\"Demonstrating excellence in coordination and team performance management\",\"Attending all meetings\",\"Responding to all emails\"]', '[1]', 'Daily excellence in leadership means actively guiding teams and managing performance, not just checking off tasks.', 'Operational Leadership at the daily level specifically requires demonstrating excellence in project coordination and team performance management, emphasizing quality of leadership rather than task completion.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1299, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What characterizes the immediate leadership objectives phase?', '[\"Rapid promotion focus\",\"Building foundational excellence while developing advanced academic research coordination capabilities\",\"Client acquisition emphasis\",\"Technology implementation priority\"]', '[1]', 'Strong foundations in the first six months enable all subsequent success; rushing past basics creates future problems.', 'The 0-6 month immediate phase emphasizes establishing foundational excellence in multi-project management while building advanced capabilities specific to academic research project coordination.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1300, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of leadership authority does the matrix structure provide?', '[\"Complete authority over all team decisions\",\"Strategic coordination authority without direct reporting lines\",\"Advisory input only\",\"Financial approval authority\"]', '[1]', 'Matrix authority requires building influence through value delivered and relationships, not positional power.', 'Matrix leadership provides strategic coordination authority over functional teams for assigned projects, meaning influence through expertise and coordination rather than hierarchical control.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1301, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How does the role balance operational and strategic responsibilities?', '[\"Focuses primarily on operations\",\"Combines daily operational excellence with weekly, monthly, and quarterly strategic contributions\",\"Focuses primarily on strategy\",\"Alternates between operational and strategic focus\"]', '[1]', 'Effective coordinators operate at multiple timeframes simultaneously: executing today while building tomorrow\'s capabilities.', 'The Strategic Excellence Framework explicitly structures the role to deliver operational excellence daily while making strategic contributions at weekly, monthly, and quarterly intervals.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1302, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What distinguishes this Level 5 position from lower-level coordinator roles?', '[\"Larger budget authority\",\"Strategic operational leadership combining advanced project management with deep academic research process understanding\",\"More direct reports\",\"Longer tenure requirements\"]', '[1]', 'Level 5 roles require strategic thinking and specialized domain expertise, not just more of what junior coordinators do.', 'The job clarity emphasizes this senior role uniquely combines strategic operational leadership with advanced project management expertise and deep understanding of academic research processes.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1303, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary difference between daily and weekly reports?', '[\"Length and detail\",\"Daily reports focus on current status and urgent issues; weekly reports provide comprehensive performance analysis and trends\",\"Audience level\",\"Format requirements\"]', '[1]', 'Daily reports answer \'what happened today\'; weekly reports answer \'what patterns are emerging and what do they mean\'.', 'Daily reports provide project progress summaries and critical issue escalations for immediate awareness, while weekly reports offer comprehensive performance analysis with team productivity metrics and satisfaction trends.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1304, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'Why are academic calendar cycles important to this role?', '[\"They determine office holidays\",\"They create predictable demand peaks requiring strategic resource planning\",\"They affect client availability\",\"They determine budget cycles\"]', '[1]', 'Proactive planning around academic cycles prevents resource crises and enables consistent quality during peak periods.', 'Academic Calendar Alignment emphasizes strategic project planning that optimizes resource utilization during academic peak periods, recognizing predictable cycles in demand.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1305, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What makes cross-functional coordination particularly challenging?', '[\"Different physical locations\",\"Coordinating research, writing, technical, and editorial teams without direct authority over them\",\"Language barriers\",\"Technology limitations\"]', '[1]', 'Success in matrix coordination depends on building credibility, demonstrating value, and aligning team incentives with project goals.', 'The role requires coordinating effectively with research, writing, technical, and editorial teams for integrated project delivery, using matrix leadership authority rather than direct reporting relationships.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1306, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What progression path emphasizes continued project specialization?', '[\"Business Operations Director\",\"Project Manager with deeper specialization in complex academic projects\",\"Operations Manager\",\"Client Services Director\"]', '[1]', 'Project Manager path suits those who want to become the ultimate expert in managing complex academic research projects.', 'The Project Manager progression opportunity represents deepening specialization in project management and academic services, versus the broader operational or strategic business roles.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1307, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'How do the five KRAs relate to each other?', '[\"They are independent measures\",\"They form an integrated system: delivery excellence depends on team leadership, client satisfaction, process optimization, and performance analytics\",\"They represent sequential phases\",\"They correspond to organizational hierarchy\"]', '[1]', 'Think of KRAs as a system where improving any one area creates positive effects across others.', 'The five KRAs are interconnected: project delivery excellence requires effective team leadership, which depends on client satisfaction maintained through process optimization, all monitored through performance analytics.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1308, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What time period shows transition from establishing capability to expanding scope?', '[\"0-3 months\",\"Around 6 months, transitioning from immediate objectives to medium-term development\",\"12 months\",\"18 months\"]', '[1]', 'Use the six-month transition point to assess readiness for expanded responsibilities before taking them on.', 'The 6-month mark represents the transition from immediate leadership objectives focused on establishing excellence to medium-term strategic development involving scope expansion and advanced responsibilities.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1309, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What makes this role pivotal to PhDiZone\'s operational success?', '[\"Budget management authority\",\"Direct impact on project delivery quality, team productivity, and organizational scaling of complex academic research support\",\"Client acquisition responsibility\",\"Technology decisions\"]', '[1]', 'Pivotal roles are those where performance directly determines organizational success in core strategic areas.', 'The job clarity states this Level 5, Grade III leadership position is pivotal to PhDiZone\'s operational success and client satisfaction, directly impacting project delivery quality, team productivity, and ability to scale effectively.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1310, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the relationship between resource optimization and project quality?', '[\"They are inversely related\",\"They must be balanced; optimal resource allocation enables quality by matching expertise to tasks while maintaining productivity\",\"They are unrelated\",\"Quality always requires maximum resources\"]', '[1]', 'Optimal resource use means right person, right task, right time - not minimum resources or maximum utilization.', 'The role emphasizes ensuring optimal resource utilization alongside maintaining quality standards, indicating that strategic resource allocation based on expertise and capacity actually enables higher quality.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1311, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'Why must 100% of client issues be resolved within 24 hours?', '[\"Company policy requirement\",\"Maintains client confidence and prevents issues from compounding while demonstrating responsive support\",\"Competition requirement\",\"Regulatory compliance\"]', '[1]', 'Fast issue resolution prevents small problems from becoming crises and builds client trust in your reliability.', 'The aggressive 24-hour resolution timeline (with 95% in 4 hours) reflects the need to maintain client confidence and prevent issues from escalating, particularly important in time-sensitive academic projects.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1312, 1, 50, 13, 0, NULL, 0, 'What capability must be built during medium-term development for long-term advancement?', '[\"Technical research skills\",\"Strategic planning, advanced client relationships, and organizational process innovation leadership\",\"Budget management\",\"Staff hiring abilities\"]', '[1]', 'Medium-term capability building in strategy, relationships, and innovation prepares you for director-level responsibilities.', 'Medium-term development specifically expands to include strategic planning responsibilities, advanced client relationship management, and leadership in organizational process innovation - all critical for senior leadership roles.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 1, '2025-10-08 17:04:28', 0),
(1313, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary entity under which the Sales Team Leader position operates?', '[\"PhDiZone\",\"Elysium Technology Private Limited\",\"Sales Department Division\",\"Business Coordination Unit\"]', '[0]', 'Remember that the entity (PhDiZone) is distinct from the parent company (Elysium Technology Private Limited).', 'According to the document, while the company is Elysium Technology Private Limited, the entity specified for this role is PhDiZone, which operates as the business unit within the larger organization.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1314, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the grade level assigned to the Sales Team Leader position?', '[\"Grade III\",\"Grade IV\",\"Grade V\",\"Level 4\"]', '[1]', 'Don\'t confuse Level (4) with Grade (IV) - they represent the same seniority but use different naming conventions.', 'The document explicitly states that the position is Grade IV, which corresponds to Level 4 in the organizational hierarchy, indicating a senior leadership position.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1315, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Who does the Sales Team Leader directly report to?', '[\"Business Development Manager\",\"Sales Director\",\"Sales Manager or Business Coordinator\",\"Chief Executive Officer\"]', '[2]', 'Note the flexibility in reporting structure - this role can report to either position depending on organizational needs.', 'The Reporting Authority section clearly identifies that the Sales Team Leader reports to either the Sales Manager or Business Coordinator, showing dual reporting possibilities.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1316, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which generation classification does this position belong to?', '[\"Gen 2\",\"Gen 3\",\"Gen 4\",\"Gen 5\"]', '[2]', 'Generation classifications often indicate the evolutionary stage or tier of the role within the company\'s structure.', 'The document specifies Generation: Gen 4, which likely represents the fourth tier or generation in the organizational development structure.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1317, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What are the two primary focus areas that define the Sales Team Leader role?', '[\"Marketing and advertising\",\"Direct sales activities and team leadership\",\"Financial planning and budgeting\",\"Product development and quality control\"]', '[1]', 'This dual focus is what distinguishes a Sales Team Leader from either a pure salesperson or a pure manager.', 'The Job Role Clarity section explicitly states that the position requires a dual focus on direct sales activities and team leadership, managing the complete sales cycle while coaching team members.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1318, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which of the following is NOT listed as a direct report to the Sales Team Leader?', '[\"Business Development Executives\",\"Presales Executives\",\"Marketing Executives\",\"Postsales Executives\"]', '[2]', 'The Sales Team Leader manages the sales pipeline team members, not marketing personnel.', 'The Reporting Hierarchy section lists Business Development Executives, Presales Executives, Postsales Executives, and Closing Sales Support Executives as direct reports. Marketing Executives are not mentioned as direct reports.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1319, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of coordination does the Sales Team Leader maintain with other departments?', '[\"Hierarchical relationships\",\"Matrix relationships\",\"Subsidiary relationships\",\"Independent relationships\"]', '[1]', 'Matrix relationships allow for collaboration across departments while maintaining separate reporting structures.', 'The document specifies Matrix Relationships for strategic collaboration with Marketing Head, Delivery Manager, Finance Head, and Operations Team, indicating cross-functional coordination without direct reporting.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1320, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'In what market does PhDiZone primarily operate according to this role description?', '[\"Corporate training services\",\"Academic research services\",\"Healthcare consulting\",\"Technology development\"]', '[1]', 'Understanding the market context helps frame all sales activities around academic and research clientele.', 'The Job Role Clarity section mentions \'exceptional client experiences in the academic research services market,\' clearly defining the primary market focus.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1321, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the fundamental strategic impact of the Sales Team Leader position?', '[\"Managing daily operations only\",\"Translating strategic vision into measurable results\",\"Developing new products\",\"Handling customer complaints\"]', '[1]', 'This role bridges the gap between high-level strategy and on-the-ground execution.', 'The Organizational Strategic Impact section states that the Sales Team Leader \'translates strategic vision into measurable results\' while driving organizational capability building.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1322, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which department does the Sales Team Leader belong to?', '[\"Marketing Department\",\"Sales Department\",\"Business Development Department\",\"Operations Department\"]', '[1]', 'While working closely with business development, the role is organizationally within Sales.', 'The document clearly states Department: Sales Department in the organizational structure section.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1323, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of team does the Sales Team Leader build and lead?', '[\"Marketing team\",\"High-performing business development team\",\"Technical support team\",\"Administrative team\"]', '[1]', 'The focus is on business development excellence, not just sales execution.', 'The Job Role Clarity explicitly mentions building and leading \'a high-performing business development team that delivers exceptional client experiences.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1324, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How does the document describe the Sales Team Leader\'s role in PhDiZone\'s sales operations?', '[\"A supporting role\",\"The driving force\",\"A coordination role\",\"An advisory role\"]', '[1]', 'This indicates the role is proactive and central, not passive or peripheral.', 'The Job Role Clarity section states that \'The Sales Team Leader serves as the driving force behind PhDiZone\'s sales operations,\' emphasizing the central importance of this role.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1325, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What aspect of PhDiZone\'s growth does this position directly impact?', '[\"Product innovation\",\"Market expansion and revenue achievement\",\"Cost reduction\",\"Employee retention\"]', '[1]', 'Connect this role\'s activities to top-line growth objectives.', 'The document states that as a Level 4, Grade IV leadership position, the role is \'critical to PhDiZone\'s market expansion and revenue achievement.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1326, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which of the following best describes the sales cycle responsibility of this role?', '[\"Only lead generation\",\"Only deal closure\",\"Complete sales cycle from lead generation to deal closure\",\"Post-sales support only\"]', '[2]', 'This end-to-end ownership ensures accountability for the entire customer acquisition process.', 'The Job Role Clarity section explicitly states the role manages \'the complete sales cycle from lead generation to deal closure.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1327, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What combination of activities does the role combine according to the job clarity section?', '[\"Marketing and finance\",\"Hands-on sales execution with strategic team leadership\",\"Product development and sales\",\"Customer service and administration\"]', '[1]', 'This dual nature requires both doing and leading - a true working leader role.', 'The document describes the role as \'combining hands-on sales execution with strategic team leadership and operational management.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1328, 1, 51, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of executive role does the Closing Sales Support Executive represent?', '[\"A pre-sales role\",\"A direct report supporting deal finalization\",\"A marketing role\",\"An operations role\"]', '[1]', 'This role helps ensure deals successfully close, completing the sales cycle.', 'Closing Sales Support Executives are listed among the direct reports, indicating they support the final stages of the sales process under the Sales Team Leader\'s supervision.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:02', 0),
(1329, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary purpose of the daily Sunrise Meets?', '[\"Performance reviews\",\"Assign tasks and set priorities for the business development team\",\"Client presentations\",\"Financial reporting\"]', '[1]', 'Think \'Sunrise\' = start of day planning and task assignment.', 'Under Team Leadership & Development responsibilities, the document states that Sunrise Meets are conducted daily to \'assign tasks and set priorities for business development team.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1330, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'When are Sunset Meets conducted and what is their purpose?', '[\"Weekly for strategic planning\",\"Daily to review closures, address challenges, and plan next-day activities\",\"Monthly for performance reviews\",\"Quarterly for goal setting\"]', '[1]', 'Sunset Meets bookend the day - reviewing what happened and preparing for tomorrow.', 'The document specifies leading \'daily Sunset Meets to review closures, address challenges, and plan next-day activities,\' making it an end-of-day reflection and planning session.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1331, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently are individual coaching sessions provided to business development executives?', '[\"Daily\",\"Weekly 1:1 sessions\",\"Monthly\",\"Quarterly\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly 1:1s ensure consistent development without overwhelming the schedule.', 'The Team Leadership & Development section states the role provides \'weekly 1:1 coaching sessions to business development executives.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1332, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How often are performance appraisals conducted for team members?', '[\"Weekly\",\"Bi-weekly\",\"Monthly\",\"Quarterly\"]', '[2]', 'Monthly appraisals allow for regular feedback while giving enough time to assess progress.', 'The document specifies conducting \'monthly performance appraisals and develop individual growth plans\' as a key team leadership responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1333, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of sales opportunities does the Sales Team Leader personally manage?', '[\"All sales opportunities\",\"Only small deals\",\"High-value and complex sales opportunities requiring senior intervention\",\"Only international deals\"]', '[2]', 'The leader handles the most strategic and challenging deals that need senior expertise.', 'Under Direct Sales Execution & Lead Management, the role \'personally manage[s] high-value and complex sales opportunities requiring senior intervention.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1334, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which stage of the sales cycle does the Sales Team Leader execute from start to finish?', '[\"Only lead qualification\",\"Only proposal development\",\"Complete sales cycle from lead qualification through proposal development to closure\",\"Only closure activities\"]', '[2]', 'End-to-end ownership ensures no handoff gaps in the sales process.', 'The Direct Sales Execution responsibility explicitly states executing the \'complete sales cycle from lead qualification through proposal development to closure.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1335, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What types of client negotiations does the Sales Team Leader handle?', '[\"Only pricing negotiations\",\"Strategic client negotiations including pricing, service inclusions, and discount approvals\",\"Only contract terms\",\"Only service level agreements\"]', '[1]', 'Strategic negotiations involve multiple commercial dimensions, not just price.', 'The document specifies handling \'strategic client negotiations including pricing, service inclusions, and discount approvals\' as a direct sales responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1336, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What dual target responsibility does the Sales Team Leader maintain?', '[\"Only team targets\",\"Only personal targets\",\"Personal sales targets while supporting team achievement\",\"Only departmental targets\"]', '[2]', 'This ensures the leader stays connected to the field while building team capacity.', 'The Direct Sales Execution section states the leader must \'maintain personal sales targets while supporting team achievement,\' showing dual accountability.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1337, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How frequently does the Sales Team Leader track revenue performance against targets?', '[\"Only monthly\",\"Only weekly\",\"Daily, weekly, and monthly\",\"Only quarterly\"]', '[2]', 'Multiple time horizons ensure both immediate awareness and trend analysis.', 'Under Revenue Management & Forecasting, the role tracks \'daily, weekly, and monthly revenue performance against established targets.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1338, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Sales Team Leader develop and maintain for forecasting purposes?', '[\"Marketing plans\",\"Accurate sales forecasts and pipeline analysis\",\"Product roadmaps\",\"Budget allocations\"]', '[1]', 'Pipeline analysis helps predict future revenue and identify potential gaps early.', 'Revenue Management responsibilities include developing and maintaining \'accurate sales forecasts and pipeline analysis.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1339, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'To whom does the Sales Team Leader submit comprehensive business development reports?', '[\"The finance team\",\"The marketing team\",\"Senior leadership\",\"The operations team\"]', '[2]', 'Upward reporting keeps leadership informed for strategic decision-making.', 'The Revenue Management section specifies submitting \'comprehensive business development reports to senior leadership.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1340, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Sales Team Leader validate in team member revenue reports?', '[\"Grammar and formatting\",\"Accuracy and strategic alignment\",\"Length and detail\",\"Submission timing\"]', '[1]', 'Validation ensures reports are both correct and support broader business goals.', 'The document states the role validates \'team member revenue reports for accuracy and strategic alignment,\' ensuring quality and consistency.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1341, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How often is competitor and market analysis conducted?', '[\"Daily\",\"Weekly\",\"Monthly\",\"Quarterly\"]', '[2]', 'Monthly analysis balances staying current with market changes without excessive time investment.', 'Strategic Planning & Market Intelligence responsibilities include conducting \'monthly competitor and market analysis to inform pricing and service strategies.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1342, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'With which team does the Sales Team Leader collaborate on campaign development?', '[\"Finance team\",\"Marketing team\",\"Operations team\",\"HR team\"]', '[1]', 'Sales and marketing alignment is crucial for effective demand generation.', 'The Strategic Planning section mentions collaborating \'with marketing on campaign development and ROI optimization.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1343, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Sales Team Leader recommend as part of strategic planning?', '[\"Employee benefits\",\"New service offerings or partnerships based on market opportunities\",\"Office locations\",\"Technology infrastructure\"]', '[1]', 'Leaders should be opportunity scouts, constantly looking for growth vectors.', 'Strategic Planning responsibilities include identifying \'market opportunities and recommend new service offerings or partnerships.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1344, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What strategic initiatives does the Sales Team Leader lead?', '[\"Product development initiatives\",\"Territory expansion and client acquisition initiatives\",\"IT infrastructure initiatives\",\"Financial optimization initiatives\"]', '[1]', 'Geographic and client base growth are key strategic levers for revenue expansion.', 'The document specifies leading \'strategic planning initiatives for territory expansion and client acquisition.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1345, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What types of relationships does the Sales Team Leader establish and maintain?', '[\"Only client relationships\",\"Relationships with universities, institutions, and academic partners\",\"Only vendor relationships\",\"Only internal relationships\"]', '[1]', 'Academic partnerships are central given PhDiZone\'s focus on research services.', 'Partnership Development responsibilities include establishing and maintaining \'relationships with universities, institutions, and academic partners.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1346, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What types of agreements does the Sales Team Leader negotiate and finalize?', '[\"Employment agreements\",\"MOUs, workshops, and collaborative agreements\",\"Lease agreements\",\"Technology licenses\"]', '[1]', 'These formal agreements structure the relationship and define mutual commitments.', 'The Partnership Development section specifies negotiating and finalizing \'MOUs, workshops, and collaborative agreements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1347, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of client relationships require the Sales Team Leader\'s senior-level attention?', '[\"All client relationships\",\"New client relationships only\",\"Key client relationships requiring senior-level attention\",\"Inactive client relationships\"]', '[2]', 'Senior leaders should focus on the highest-value relationships that need their expertise.', 'Partnership Development includes managing \'key client relationships requiring senior-level attention,\' indicating focus on strategic accounts.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1348, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Where does the Sales Team Leader represent PhDiZone externally?', '[\"Only at trade shows\",\"Academic conferences, events, and professional meetings\",\"Only at client offices\",\"Only at internal meetings\"]', '[1]', 'External representation builds brand visibility and creates networking opportunities.', 'The document states representing \'PhDiZone at academic conferences, events, and professional meetings\' as a partnership development responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1349, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Sales Team Leader audit for accuracy and compliance?', '[\"Financial statements\",\"Proposals and Statements of Work\",\"Employee timesheets\",\"Marketing materials\"]', '[1]', 'Quality control at the proposal stage prevents downstream issues and protects reputation.', 'Quality Assurance & Compliance Management includes auditing \'proposals and Statements of Work for accuracy and compliance standards.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1350, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What requirements must all sales activities adhere to according to the Sales Team Leader\'s responsibilities?', '[\"Marketing guidelines\",\"Academic ethics and regulatory requirements\",\"Industry best practices only\",\"Client preferences\"]', '[1]', 'In academic services, ethical compliance is not optional - it\'s foundational.', 'The Quality Assurance section states ensuring \'all sales activities adhere to academic ethics and regulatory requirements.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1351, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of documentation must the Sales Team Leader maintain?', '[\"Personal notes only\",\"Audit-ready documentation and sales process compliance\",\"Marketing materials\",\"Financial records\"]', '[1]', 'Audit-ready means documentation is complete, accurate, and immediately available for review.', 'Quality Assurance responsibilities include maintaining \'audit-ready documentation and sales process compliance.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1352, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What commitments must the Sales Team Leader review and approve?', '[\"Minor administrative tasks\",\"All major client commitments and service agreements\",\"Internal team schedules\",\"Marketing budgets\"]', '[1]', 'Final approval authority ensures senior oversight of significant obligations.', 'The document specifies reviewing and approving \'all major client commitments and service agreements\' as a quality assurance responsibility.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1353, 1, 40, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Sales Team Leader implement and optimize in operations?', '[\"Marketing campaigns\",\"Sales processes for maximum efficiency and effectiveness\",\"HR policies\",\"Financial controls\"]', '[1]', 'Process optimization drives sustainable performance improvement across the team.', 'Operational Excellence & Process Improvement includes implementing and optimizing \'sales processes for maximum efficiency and effectiveness.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(1354, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of monthly revenue targets should the team achieve according to the Team Revenue Achievement KPI?', '[\"100%\",\"105%\",\"110%\",\"115%\"]', '[1]', 'The target exceeds 100% to drive stretch performance and account for potential shortfalls.', 'The Team Performance & Revenue Achievement KRAs specify that Team Revenue Achievement requires leading the team to achieve \'105% of monthly revenue targets.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1355, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the personal sales performance target for the Sales Team Leader?', '[\"100% of individual targets\",\"105% of individual targets\",\"110% of individual revenue targets monthly\",\"115% of individual targets\"]', '[2]', 'The personal target (110%) is higher than the team target (105%), reflecting leadership by example.', 'The Personal Sales Performance KPI explicitly states achieving \'110% of individual revenue targets monthly.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1356, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should the sales pipeline value be maintained at relative to the monthly target?', '[\"1x monthly target\",\"2x monthly target\",\"3x monthly target consistently\",\"5x monthly target\"]', '[2]', 'A 3x pipeline provides buffer for deals that stall or don\'t close, maintaining predictable revenue.', 'The Pipeline Health KPI requires maintaining \'sales pipeline value of 3x monthly target consistently,\' ensuring adequate deal flow.', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1357, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum accuracy rate must be maintained in proposal audits?', '[\"90%\",\"95% or greater\",\"98%\",\"100%\"]', '[1]', 'Above 95% ensures high quality while acknowledging that perfection may be unrealistic.', 'The Proposal Quality Score KPI states maintaining \'≥ 95% accuracy rate in proposal audits.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1358, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'By what percentage should the average sales cycle time be reduced annually?', '[\"5%\",\"10% annually\",\"15%\",\"20%\"]', '[1]', 'Continuous incremental improvement compounds over time for significant efficiency gains.', 'The Sales Cycle Efficiency KPI requires reducing \'average sales cycle time by 10% annually.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1359, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What compliance rate must be achieved in sales process and documentation audits?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100% compliance\",\"At least 90%\"]', '[2]', 'Compliance is binary - there\'s no partial credit, hence the 100% requirement.', 'The Compliance Rate KPI clearly states achieving \'100% compliance in sales process and documentation audits.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1360, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many new institutional partnerships should be established quarterly?', '[\"At least 1\",\"Minimum 2 new institutional partnerships\",\"At least 3\",\"At least 5\"]', '[1]', 'Quarterly targets of 2 partnerships result in 8 annually, supporting sustained growth.', 'The Partnership Acquisition KPI specifies establishing \'minimum 2 new institutional partnerships quarterly.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1361, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of reports must be delivered monthly for market intelligence?', '[\"Financial reports\",\"Comprehensive monthly competitor analysis reports\",\"Marketing reports\",\"Operations reports\"]', '[1]', 'Regular competitive intelligence keeps strategies current and informed.', 'The Market Intelligence Quality KPI requires delivering \'comprehensive monthly competitor analysis reports.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1362, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of assigned strategic projects must be completed on time and budget?', '[\"90%\",\"95%\",\"100% of assigned strategic projects\",\"At least 85%\"]', '[2]', 'Strategic projects are critical, hence the expectation of 100% successful completion.', 'The Strategic Initiative Success KPI states completing \'100% of assigned strategic projects on time and budget.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1363, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage improvement in team productivity metrics should be achieved annually?', '[\"10%\",\"15% improvement annually\",\"20%\",\"25%\"]', '[1]', '15% annual improvement is ambitious but achievable with focused development efforts.', 'The Team Productivity Improvement KPI requires achieving \'15% improvement in team productivity metrics annually.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1364, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What minimum team satisfaction score should be maintained in leadership effectiveness surveys?', '[\"At least 4.0\\/5.0\",\"At least 4.3\\/5.0\",\"At least 4.5\\/5.0 or greater\",\"At least 4.8\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', '4.5/5.0 represents 90% satisfaction, indicating strong but not perfect leadership.', 'The Employee Satisfaction KPI specifies maintaining \'≥ 4.5/5.0 team satisfaction score in leadership effectiveness surveys.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1365, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many training sessions must be conducted monthly with measurable learning outcomes?', '[\"At least 2\",\"At least 3\",\"Minimum 4 training sessions monthly\",\"At least 5\"]', '[2]', 'Monthly training (4 sessions) ensures consistent skill development across the team.', 'The Training Effectiveness KPI requires conducting \'minimum 4 training sessions monthly with measurable learning outcomes.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1366, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What satisfaction rating must be achieved from marketing, delivery, and finance teams?', '[\"At least 4.0\\/5.0\",\"At least 4.5\\/5.0\",\"At least 4.8\\/5.0 or greater\",\"At least 5.0\\/5.0\"]', '[2]', '4.8/5.0 (96%) is higher than internal team satisfaction, reflecting the importance of cross-functional harmony.', 'The Cross-Functional Collaboration KPI states achieving \'≥ 4.8/5.0 satisfaction rating from marketing, delivery, and finance teams.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1367, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many significant process improvements must be implemented annually?', '[\"At least 2\",\"Minimum 3 significant process improvements annually\",\"At least 4\",\"At least 5\"]', '[1]', 'Spreading 3 improvements over a year allows time for proper implementation and assessment.', 'The Process Improvement Impact KPI requires implementing \'minimum 3 significant process improvements annually.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1368, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What accuracy level must be achieved in sales operations and reporting activities?', '[\"95%\",\"96%\",\"98% accuracy\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', '98% acknowledges that minor errors may occur but maintains very high standards.', 'The Operational Efficiency KPI specifies achieving \'98% accuracy in sales operations and reporting activities.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1369, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which KRA focuses on ensuring high-quality sales execution through process optimization?', '[\"Team Performance & Revenue Achievement\",\"Sales Process Excellence & Quality Management\",\"Strategic Market Development\",\"Operational Coordination\"]', '[1]', 'Process excellence is about how work gets done, not just the results achieved.', 'The document defines Sales Process Excellence & Quality Management as ensuring \'high-quality sales execution through process optimization, compliance management, and operational excellence.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1370, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which KRA focuses on expanding market presence and building strategic relationships?', '[\"Team Performance\",\"Sales Process Excellence\",\"Strategic Market Development & Partnership Building\",\"Operational Coordination\"]', '[2]', 'This KRA is about future growth and positioning, not just current performance.', 'Strategic Market Development & Partnership Building is described as expanding \'market presence and build strategic relationships that drive long-term business growth and competitive advantage.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1371, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which KRA focuses on building organizational capability through coaching and training?', '[\"Team Performance\",\"Sales Process Excellence\",\"Strategic Market Development\",\"Team Development & Talent Management\"]', '[3]', 'This KRA invests in people development for long-term organizational strength.', 'Team Development & Talent Management focuses on building \'organizational capability through effective coaching, training, and performance management of sales team members.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1372, 1, 34, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which KRA ensures seamless integration between sales activities and other business functions?', '[\"Team Performance\",\"Sales Process Excellence\",\"Strategic Market Development\",\"Operational Coordination & Cross-Functional Leadership\"]', '[3]', 'Cross-functional coordination prevents silos and ensures smooth customer experiences.', 'Operational Coordination & Cross-Functional Leadership ensures \'seamless integration between sales activities and other business functions for optimal client experience and business efficiency.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1373, 1, 52, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'How often are formal performance reviews conducted with senior management?', '[\"Daily\",\"Weekly\",\"Monthly\",\"Quarterly evaluations\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reviews ensure continuous monitoring, while quarterly evaluations provide deeper assessment.', 'The Performance Measurement Framework states that formal reviews are \'conducted weekly with senior management and comprehensive quarterly evaluations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1374, 1, 52, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What three aspects does the performance evaluation combine?', '[\"Revenue, costs, and profits\",\"Individual sales achievement, team leadership effectiveness, and strategic contribution metrics\",\"Activity, quality, and quantity\",\"Speed, accuracy, and compliance\"]', '[1]', 'The three dimensions ensure balanced assessment of doing, leading, and strategic thinking.', 'The Performance Measurement Framework explicitly states that evaluation \'combines individual sales achievement, team leadership effectiveness, and strategic contribution metrics.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1375, 1, 52, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What must be submitted in Daily Reports?', '[\"Financial statements\",\"Team performance summaries, revenue updates, and critical issue escalations\",\"Marketing plans\",\"Training schedules\"]', '[1]', 'Daily reports keep leadership immediately informed of performance and problems.', 'Reporting Requirements specify that Daily Reports include \'team performance summaries, revenue updates, and critical issue escalations.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
(1376, 1, 52, 14, 0, NULL, 0, 'What content is included in Weekly Reports?', '[\"Only financial data\",\"Comprehensive team performance analysis, pipeline forecasting, and strategic initiative updates\",\"Only training metrics\",\"Only client feedback\"]', '[1]', 'Weekly reports provide analytical depth beyond daily tactical updates.', 'Weekly Reports contain \'comprehensive team performance analysis, pipeline forecasting, and strategic initiative updates.\'', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 1, '2025-10-08 17:14:03', 0),
