(1637, 1, 75, 18, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s on-time delivery completion rate?', '[\"95%\",\"98%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[1]', 'A 98% rate means only 2 out of every 100 projects face timing issues.', 'PhDiZone maintains a 98% on-time completion rate within deadlines, demonstrating strong delivery reliability.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:09:49', 1, '2025-10-09 08:09:49', 0),
