(1643, 1, 75, 18, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many awards and recognitions has PhDiZone received?', '[\"10+ awards and 15 recognitions\",\"15+ awards and 20 recognitions\",\"18+ awards and 25 recognitions\",\"25+ awards and 30 recognitions\"]', '[2]', 'These accolades validate their expertise and service quality in the academic support industry.', 'PhDiZone\'s global recognition includes 18+ awards and 25 recognitions for their academic support services.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:09:49', 1, '2025-10-09 08:09:49', 0),
