(1647, 1, 76, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary focus of PhDiZone\'s Review Paper Writing Service?', '[\"Simple literature compilation for students\",\"High-quality review articles for journal publication\",\"Thesis writing and dissertation support\",\"Grant proposal development\"]', '[1]', 'Remember that PhDiZone focuses on \'review articles\' specifically, not general academic writing - this distinguishes it from broader writing services.', 'The service is specifically designed to help PhD scholars, researchers, and academic professionals develop high-quality review articles for publication in reputed journals. It goes beyond simple literature compilation to provide critical synthesis, analysis, and scholarly discourse.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1648, 1, 76, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'When was PhDiZone established?', '[\"1995\",\"2000\",\"2005\",\"2010\"]', '[2]', 'The \'20+ years of expertise\' mentioned in the document helps you remember the 2005 establishment date.', 'PhDiZone was established in 2005, giving the company over 20 years of expertise in academic support services as of 2025.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1649, 1, 76, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s parent company?', '[\"Academic Solutions Group\",\"Elysium Groups\",\"Scholarly Services International\",\"Research Partners Ltd\"]', '[1]', 'Associate \'Elysium\' with \'elevated academic standards\' to remember the parent company name.', 'PhDiZone operates under the parent company Elysium Groups, which provides the organizational structure and support for its specialized academic services.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1650, 1, 76, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many countries does PhDiZone serve?', '[\"50+ countries\",\"100+ countries\",\"130+ countries\",\"200+ countries\"]', '[2]', 'Think \'130+\' as approximately covering most UN member states for easy recall.', 'PhDiZone has a global reach serving 130+ countries worldwide, demonstrating its international presence and capability to support diverse academic communities.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1651, 1, 76, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s thesis defense success rate?', '[\"85%\",\"90%\",\"95%\",\"97%\"]', '[3]', 'Remember \'97% defense, 98% on-time\' - both are exceptionally high performance metrics in the 90s.', 'PhDiZone boasts a 97% thesis defense success rate, which is one of their key success metrics demonstrating the effectiveness of their guidance and support.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1652, 1, 76, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many scholars does PhDiZone support annually?', '[\"300+ scholars\",\"600+ scholars\",\"1,000+ scholars\",\"2,000+ scholars\"]', '[1]', 'Connect 600 scholars/year with their track record of 30,000+ total scholars to understand their sustained annual capacity.', 'PhDiZone has an annual capacity to support over 600 scholars per year, indicating substantial operational capability while maintaining quality standards.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1653, 1, 76, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which journals are mentioned as quality standards for PhDiZone\'s publications?', '[\"Nature, Science, Cell, PNAS\",\"Scopus, SCI, IEEE, Springer, Elsevier, UGC-Care\",\"JSTOR, ProQuest, Wiley, Taylor & Francis\",\"PubMed, Google Scholar, ResearchGate, Academia\"]', '[1]', 'Think of these as \'indexing databases and major publishers\' rather than individual journal titles.', 'PhDiZone targets high-impact journals indexed in Scopus, SCI, IEEE, and published by reputable publishers like Springer and Elsevier, as well as UGC-Care recognized journals, ensuring quality publication standards.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1654, 1, 76, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s unique value proposition?', '[\"Lowest pricing in the industry\",\"Fastest turnaround time available\",\"Combines domain expertise with publication strategy\",\"Unlimited free revisions\"]', '[2]', 'The combination of \'what to write\' (expertise) and \'how to publish\' (strategy) sets PhDiZone apart.', 'PhDiZone\'s unique value lies in combining deep domain expertise with strategic publication guidance, offering both technical excellence and navigational support through the publication process.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1655, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the word count range for a Standard review article?', '[\"2,000 - 4,000 words\",\"4,000 - 6,000 words\",\"6,000 - 8,000 words\",\"8,000 - 10,000 words\"]', '[1]', 'Standard is 4-6k words; Premium extends to 6-10k words - remember the overlap at 6,000.', 'The Standard Range for review articles is 4,000-6,000 words, which is sufficient for comprehensive coverage while remaining within typical journal requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1656, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many citations are included in the Premium Range package?', '[\"50 - 100 references\",\"80 - 120 references\",\"100 - 150 references\",\"150 - 200 references\"]', '[2]', 'Premium doubles the minimum citation count from Standard (100 vs 50) for more thorough coverage.', 'Premium Range articles include 100-150 references, significantly more than the Standard Range (50-100), allowing for more comprehensive literature coverage and deeper analysis.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1657, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the similarity index threshold for Standard Range articles?', '[\"Less than 5% (Turnitin)\",\"Less than 10% (Turnitin)\",\"Less than 15% (Turnitin)\",\"Less than 20% (Turnitin)\"]', '[1]', 'Standard is <10% Turnitin; Premium is even stricter at <8% iThenticate - lower is better.', 'Standard Range articles maintain a similarity index of less than 10% using Turnitin, ensuring high originality standards that meet most journal requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1658, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many free revision rounds are included in the Premium Range?', '[\"1 free revision\",\"2 free revisions\",\"3 free revisions\",\"Unlimited revisions\"]', '[2]', 'Premium adds one extra revision round (3 vs 2) - think \'premium\' equals \'one more.\'', 'Premium Range includes 3 free revision rounds compared to 2 in Standard Range, providing more flexibility for refinement and client satisfaction.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1659, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of citations should come from the last 5 years according to recency requirements?', '[\"50%\",\"60%\",\"70%\",\"80%\"]', '[2]', 'Use the 70-30 split rule: 70% recent (5 years), 30% semi-recent (10 years).', 'PhDiZone maintains a recency requirement of 70% citations from the last 5 years and 30% from the last 10 years, ensuring the review reflects current research trends and developments.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1660, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which databases are covered for literature search according to PhDiZone standards?', '[\"Only Google Scholar and PubMed\",\"Scopus, Web of Science, PubMed, IEEE Xplore, ScienceDirect\",\"JSTOR, ProQuest, and EBSCOhost only\",\"ResearchGate and Academia.edu\"]', '[1]', 'Remember the major indexed databases: Scopus/WoS for general, PubMed for medical, IEEE for engineering, ScienceDirect for multidisciplinary.', 'PhDiZone ensures comprehensive database coverage including major academic databases: Scopus, Web of Science, PubMed, IEEE Xplore, and ScienceDirect, providing thorough literature coverage across disciplines.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1661, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which citation style is NOT explicitly mentioned as supported by PhDiZone?', '[\"APA\",\"IEEE\",\"Chicago\",\"Vancouver\"]', '[2]', 'Focus on the scientific/technical styles mentioned - APA, IEEE, Vancouver - which are most common in research publications.', 'PhDiZone explicitly supports APA, IEEE, Vancouver, Harvard, Elsevier, and Springer (journal-specific) citation styles. Chicago style is not mentioned in the document, though they may still support it.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1662, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which tool is used for bibliometric analysis according to the document?', '[\"SPSS, SAS, and Stata\",\"VOSviewer, Biblioshiny, R\",\"NVivo, ATLAS.ti, and MAXQDA\",\"Tableau, Power BI, and Excel\"]', '[1]', 'VOSviewer is the gold standard for bibliometric visualization - remember it\'s for mapping research networks.', 'For bibliometric analysis, PhDiZone uses specialized tools including VOSviewer, Biblioshiny, and R, which are designed specifically for citation analysis, co-authorship networks, and research trend visualization.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1663, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What plagiarism detection tools does PhDiZone use?', '[\"Grammarly and Copyscape\",\"Turnitin and iThenticate\",\"PlagScan and Quetext\",\"SafeAssign and Unicheck\"]', '[1]', 'Remember: Turnitin for Standard (<10%), iThenticate for Premium (<8%) - both are from the same company.', 'PhDiZone uses industry-standard plagiarism detection tools Turnitin and iThenticate (mentioned as part of Standard and Premium ranges respectively), which are widely accepted by academic institutions and publishers.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1664, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which tools are used for qualitative analysis?', '[\"R, Python, and MATLAB\",\"NVivo and ATLAS.ti\",\"Tableau and Power BI\",\"SPSS and SAS\"]', '[1]', 'NVivo and ATLAS.ti are the two leading CAQDAS (Computer-Assisted Qualitative Data Analysis Software) tools.', 'For qualitative analysis, PhDiZone employs NVivo and ATLAS.ti, which are specialized software for coding, analyzing, and managing qualitative research data.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1665, 1, 77, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the delivery time for Premium Range articles?', '[\"7-10 business days\",\"10-15 business days\",\"15-20 business days\",\"20-25 business days\"]', '[2]', 'Premium takes approximately 50% longer than Standard (15-20 vs 10-15 days) due to greater depth and complexity.', 'Premium Range articles, being more comprehensive (6,000-10,000 words with 100-150 references), require 15-20 business days for delivery, compared to 10-15 days for Standard Range.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1666, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the typical word count for a Narrative Review?', '[\"2,000-4,000 words\",\"4,000-6,000 words\",\"5,000-7,000 words\",\"6,000-8,000 words\"]', '[1]', 'Narrative reviews are on the shorter end - think \'narrative\' as telling a focused story in 4-6k words.', 'Narrative Reviews typically contain 4,000-6,000 words and provide a comprehensive overview of a topic with thematic organization, requiring 50-80 references.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1667, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which framework must Systematic Reviews comply with?', '[\"CONSORT framework\",\"PRISMA framework\",\"STROBE framework\",\"CARE framework\"]', '[1]', 'PRISMA is the gold standard for systematic reviews - remember \'PRISMA\' = \'systematic structure.\'', 'Systematic Reviews must follow PRISMA (Preferred Reporting Items for Systematic Reviews and Meta-Analyses) framework compliance, ensuring standardized methodology and reporting.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1668, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many references are typically included in a Systematic Review?', '[\"50-80 references\",\"60-100 references\",\"80-120 references\",\"100-150 references\"]', '[2]', 'Systematic reviews need more references (80-120) than narrative (50-80) because they must comprehensively cover all relevant evidence.', 'Systematic Reviews include 80-120 references and span 6,000-8,000 words, reflecting their evidence-based synthesis with rigorous methodology requiring extensive literature coverage.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1669, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the purpose of a Scoping Review?', '[\"Statistical synthesis of quantitative studies\",\"Comprehensive overview of a single topic\",\"Map key concepts and evidence gaps\",\"Quantitative analysis of research trends\"]', '[2]', 'Think \'scoping\' = \'mapping the landscape\' to identify what\'s known and what\'s missing.', 'Scoping Reviews are designed to map key concepts and identify evidence gaps in the literature, using the Arksey & O\'Malley framework with 5,000-7,000 words and 60-100 references.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1670, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many primary studies are typically cited in a Meta-Analysis?', '[\"20-40 primary studies\",\"30-60 primary studies\",\"40-80 primary studies\",\"50-100 primary studies\"]', '[1]', 'Meta-analyses need fewer \'references\' (30-60 studies) but deeper analysis - quality over quantity for statistical synthesis.', 'Meta-Analyses cite 30-60 primary studies for statistical synthesis of quantitative studies, spanning 6,000-8,000 words and including statistical analysis sections with software like R and STATA.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1671, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the word count range for State-of-the-Art/Survey Papers?', '[\"5,000-7,000 words\",\"6,000-8,000 words\",\"8,000-10,000 words\",\"10,000-12,000 words\"]', '[2]', 'State-of-the-art papers are the most comprehensive (8-10k words) - they survey the \'entire art\' of a field.', 'State-of-the-Art/Survey Papers are the longest review type at 8,000-10,000 words with 100-150 references, providing comprehensive domain coverage for emerging fields with technology/methodology focus.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1672, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many papers are typically analyzed in a Bibliometric Review?', '[\"50-100 papers\",\"100-200 papers\",\"200-500 papers\",\"500-1000 papers\"]', '[2]', 'Bibliometric reviews analyze the most papers (200-500) because they\'re doing quantitative trend analysis, not deep reading.', 'Bibliometric Reviews analyze 200-500 papers to provide quantitative analysis of research trends with data-driven insights and visualizations, spanning 5,000-7,000 words and including citation network analysis.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1673, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the recommended word count for the Introduction section of a review article?', '[\"300-500 words\",\"500-800 words\",\"800-1,200 words\",\"1,200-1,500 words\"]', '[2]', 'Introduction is roughly 20% of a standard 4-6k word review - substantial but not dominant.', 'The Introduction section should be 800-1,200 words and must cover research scope and objectives, significance and relevance, and review methodology overview.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1674, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which section is the longest in a standard review article structure?', '[\"Introduction\",\"Search Strategy\",\"Thematic Literature Analysis\",\"Discussion & Future Directions\"]', '[2]', 'The literature analysis is the \'heart\' of the review - expect it to be roughly 50-60% of total word count.', 'The Thematic Literature Analysis section is the longest at 2,500-4,000 words, comprising the bulk of the review with chronological/categorical/thematic organization, critical evaluation, comparative analysis, and trend identification.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1675, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What should be included in the Search Strategy section for systematic reviews?', '[\"Only the databases used\",\"Database selection rationale, search terms, inclusion\\/exclusion criteria, and PRISMA flow diagram\",\"Just the keywords and Boolean operators\",\"Only the number of papers found\"]', '[1]', 'Search strategy must be fully reproducible - another researcher should be able to replicate your exact search.', 'The Search Strategy section (300-500 words) must comprehensively document the database selection rationale, search terms with Boolean operators, inclusion/exclusion criteria, and include a PRISMA flow diagram for systematic reviews.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1676, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many tiers are in PhDiZone\'s quality check process?', '[\"Two-tier\",\"Three-tier\",\"Four-tier\",\"Five-tier\"]', '[1]', 'Think SME-Language-Technical as three progressive layers: content → style → format.', 'PhDiZone employs a three-tier quality check system: (1) Subject Matter Expert Review for content accuracy, (2) Language Editor Review for grammar and style, and (3) Technical Editor Review for formatting and compliance.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1677, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What aspect does the Subject Matter Expert Review focus on?', '[\"Grammar and punctuation\",\"Content accuracy and academic rigor\",\"Citation formatting\",\"Journal-specific guidelines\"]', '[1]', 'Subject Matter Experts verify \'what you say\' is correct; editors verify \'how you say it\' is polished.', 'The first tier, Subject Matter Expert Review, specifically focuses on ensuring content accuracy and academic rigor, verifying the technical correctness and scholarly quality of the research synthesis.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1678, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s language standard requirement?', '[\"International English proficiency\",\"Native English proficiency (UK\\/US variants)\",\"Academic English proficiency\",\"Technical English proficiency\"]', '[1]', 'Native-level English (not just fluent) ensures publication-ready quality that meets international journal standards.', 'PhDiZone maintains a language standard of native English proficiency supporting both UK and US variants, ensuring writing excellence with formal, objective, and scholarly voice.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1679, 1, 78, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'According to PhDiZone\'s synthesis quality standards, findings should be integrated into what type of narrative?', '[\"Chronological narrative\",\"Descriptive narrative\",\"Coherent narrative\",\"Sequential narrative\"]', '[2]', 'Coherent means logically connected - synthesis should tell a unified story, not just summarize separate studies.', 'Synthesis Quality requires integration of findings into a coherent narrative, ensuring that diverse research findings are woven together logically and meaningfully rather than simply listed.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1680, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many PhD holders are in PhDiZone\'s Engineering & Technology expert pool?', '[\"15+ PhD holders\",\"20+ PhD holders\",\"25+ PhD holders\",\"30+ PhD holders\"]', '[2]', 'Engineering has 25+ experts; Computer Science has 30+ - tech domains have the largest expert pools.', 'PhDiZone\'s Engineering & Technology domain has 25+ PhD holders specializing in areas like VLSI, Machine Learning, IoT, Blockchain, Robotics, and Cybersecurity, with focus on AI/ML applications and Industry 4.0.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1681, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which specialization is NOT listed under Life Sciences & Medicine?', '[\"Genetics\",\"Drug Discovery\",\"Bioinformatics\",\"Public Health\"]', '[2]', 'Life Sciences focuses on wet-lab and clinical areas; bioinformatics typically falls under computational biology or computer science.', 'Life Sciences & Medicine specializations include Genetics, Drug Discovery, Clinical Trials, Microbiology, and Public Health. Bioinformatics, while related, is not explicitly listed in the document\'s specialization areas.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1682, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many PhD holders comprise the Social Sciences & Humanities expert pool?', '[\"10+ PhD holders\",\"15+ PhD holders\",\"20+ PhD holders\",\"25+ PhD holders\"]', '[1]', 'Social Sciences has the smallest expert pool (15+) but still covers diverse specializations with qualitative methodology expertise.', 'The Social Sciences & Humanities domain has 15+ PhD holders specializing in Education, Psychology, Economics, Gender Studies, and Political Science, with expertise in mixed-methods research and qualitative analysis.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1683, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the duration of the Client Onboarding phase?', '[\"Day 1\",\"Day 1-2\",\"Day 1-3\",\"Day 1-5\"]', '[1]', 'Onboarding is quick (1-2 days) to match experts and set expectations before research begins on Day 3.', 'Client Onboarding occurs during Day 1-2 and includes initial consultation, domain expert assignment, project planning with timeline definition, and documentation including NDA signing.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1684, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'During which days does the Research Phase take place?', '[\"Day 1-5\",\"Day 3-7\",\"Day 5-10\",\"Day 8-12\"]', '[1]', 'Research (Days 3-7) comes before Writing (Days 8-12) - foundation before construction.', 'The Research Phase spans Day 3-7 and includes literature search, source evaluation, thematic organization, and outline approval, ensuring comprehensive groundwork before writing begins.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1685, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many days are allocated for the Writing Phase?', '[\"3 days\",\"4 days\",\"5 days\",\"7 days\"]', '[2]', 'Writing phase (5 days) is slightly shorter than research phase (5 days) because the groundwork is already laid.', 'The Writing Phase spans 5 days (Day 8-12) and includes first draft development, internal review, client review of the first draft, and revision incorporation based on client feedback.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1686, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens during the Finalization Phase on Day 13-15?', '[\"Initial research and literature review\",\"First draft writing and client feedback\",\"Final edits, quality checks, formatting, and delivery\",\"Publication submission and follow-up\"]', '[2]', 'Finalization is the \'polish and package\' phase - ensuring publication-ready quality before handoff.', 'The Finalization Phase (Day 13-15) involves final edits for language and technical accuracy, quality checks for plagiarism and compliance, journal-specific formatting, and final delivery with supporting documents.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1687, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of support is provided in the Post-Delivery phase?', '[\"Only final manuscript delivery\",\"Publication support, revision support, and follow-up\",\"Additional research for new topics\",\"Translation services\"]', '[1]', 'PhDiZone\'s support doesn\'t end at delivery - they help navigate the entire publication journey.', 'Post-Delivery Support is ongoing and includes assistance with journal submission, help with reviewer comments/revisions, and publication outcome tracking, ensuring continued support beyond manuscript delivery.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1688, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of PhDiZone\'s target market consists of PhD Scholars?', '[\"40%\",\"50%\",\"60%\",\"70%\"]', '[2]', 'PhD scholars are the majority (60%) - remember the 60-25-10-5 distribution across four segments.', 'PhD Scholars represent 60% of PhDiZone\'s target market, being early to mid-stage students who need literature review expertise and face publication pressure, making them the largest client segment.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1689, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the primary pain point for Academic Researchers segment?', '[\"Lack of writing skills\",\"Language barriers\",\"Administrative workload and publication deadlines\",\"Insufficient domain knowledge\"]', '[2]', 'Academic researchers need \'quick turnaround\' and \'professional quality\' - they\'re time-constrained, not skill-constrained.', 'Academic Researchers (25% of market), including postdocs and assistant professors, face administrative workload and publication deadlines as their primary pain points, making time-saving professional quality valuable.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1690, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of the market do International Students represent?', '[\"5%\",\"10%\",\"15%\",\"25%\"]', '[1]', 'International students (10%) need language support more than content expertise - native English writing is their key value.', 'International Students comprise 10% of the target market, being non-native English speakers in PhD programs who need language support and assistance meeting academic writing standards with cultural adaptation.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1691, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s acceptance rate target for first submission?', '[\"Greater than 75%\",\"Greater than 80%\",\"Greater than 85%\",\"Greater than 90%\"]', '[2]', '85%+ acceptance rate shows most manuscripts are publication-ready on first submission - much higher than typical rates.', 'PhDiZone targets greater than 85% first submission acceptance in target journals, demonstrating their high quality standards and understanding of publication requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1692, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the target average citation impact within 2 years of publication?', '[\"10+ citations\",\"15+ citations\",\"20+ citations\",\"25+ citations\"]', '[1]', '15+ citations in 2 years is strong for reviews - shows the work is being recognized and utilized by the research community.', 'PhDiZone aims for an average of 15+ citations per published review within 2 years, indicating the impact and quality of the review articles they help produce.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1693, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s client satisfaction target?', '[\"Greater than 85%\",\"Greater than 90%\",\"Greater than 95%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', '95%+ satisfaction aligns with their 80%+ retention rate - happy clients return for additional services.', 'PhDiZone maintains a client satisfaction target of greater than 95%, reflecting their commitment to quality service delivery and client relationship management.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1694, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the on-time delivery metric for PhDiZone?', '[\"Greater than 90%\",\"Greater than 95%\",\"Greater than 98%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', '98% on-time delivery is near-perfect performance - shows robust processes and buffer management.', 'PhDiZone achieves greater than 98% on-time delivery, demonstrating exceptional project management and reliability in meeting committed timelines.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1695, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s target market share in global academic writing services?', '[\"10% of market\",\"15% of market\",\"20% of market\",\"25% of market\"]', '[1]', '15% market share with 25% revenue growth shows they\'re in growth mode but maintaining quality standards.', 'PhDiZone targets 15% of the global academic writing services market, positioning themselves as a significant but not dominant player focused on quality over volume.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1696, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s client acquisition cost target?', '[\"Less than $100 per client\",\"Less than $150 per client\",\"Less than $200 per client\",\"Less than $250 per client\"]', '[2]', 'CAC under $200 with 80%+ retention means each acquired client generates substantial lifetime value.', 'PhDiZone aims to maintain client acquisition costs below $200 per client, ensuring efficient marketing spend while building a sustainable business model with healthy profit margins.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1697, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s approach to plagiarism prevention?', '[\"Standard detection with manual review\",\"Zero tolerance policy with advanced detection\",\"Client responsibility with guidance\",\"Post-submission checking only\"]', '[1]', 'Zero tolerance means any plagiarism issue results in complete rejection and rework - quality over speed.', 'PhDiZone maintains a zero tolerance policy for plagiarism, using advanced detection tools (Turnitin, iThenticate) and ensuring proper source acknowledgment, paraphrasing quality, and avoidance of content recycling.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1698, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'What geographic region represents PhDiZone\'s largest market?', '[\"North America (40%)\",\"Europe (35%)\",\"India (40%)\",\"Asia-Pacific (30%)\"]', '[2]', 'India (40%) is the home market; international markets (60% combined) show strong global diversification.', 'India represents 40% of PhDiZone\'s market as the domestic base, followed by North America at 25%, Europe at 20%, Asia-Pacific at 10%, and Others at 5%.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1699, 1, 79, 19, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which domain has the largest expert pool at PhDiZone?', '[\"Engineering & Technology\",\"Life Sciences & Medicine\",\"Computer Science & IT\",\"Business & Management\"]', '[2]', 'CS/IT has 30+ experts (largest pool) reflecting high demand for technical review papers in computing fields.', 'Computer Science & Information Technology has 30+ PhD holders, the largest expert pool, specializing in Software Engineering, Data Science, Computer Networks, HCI, and emerging areas like quantum computing.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:12', 0),
(1700, 1, 54, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What year was PhDiZone established?', '[\"2000\",\"2005\",\"2010\",\"2015\"]', '[1]', 'Remember that PhDiZone has been operating for nearly two decades, providing extensive experience in academic research support.', 'PhDiZone was established in 2005 as a subsidiary of Elysium Groups. The service has leveraged over 20 years of research expertise to support PhD scholars in their synopsis development.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1701, 1, 54, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many PhD holders and subject matter experts does PhDiZone employ?', '[\"50+\",\"100+\",\"150+\",\"200+\"]', '[2]', 'The \'150+\' figure emphasizes the depth of expertise available across multiple disciplines.', 'PhDiZone employs over 150 PhD holders and subject matter experts who provide personalized consultation as part of their expert-guided development approach.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1702, 1, 54, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many countries does PhDiZone serve?', '[\"50+\",\"80+\",\"130+\",\"180+\"]', '[2]', 'The service\'s reach spans over 130 countries, demonstrating comprehensive global coverage.', 'PhDiZone provides global accessibility by serving 130+ countries with localized support for regional requirements, making it truly international in scope.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1703, 1, 54, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s primary target audience?', '[\"Undergraduate students\",\"PhD scholars seeking synopsis approval\",\"Research institutions\",\"Journal editors\"]', '[1]', 'While PhDiZone serves secondary and tertiary audiences, PhD scholars remain the core focus.', 'The primary target audience consists of PhD scholars across all disciplines who are seeking synopsis approval from their universities.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1704, 1, 54, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What percentage of citations does PhDiZone recommend from recent publications?', '[\"60%\",\"70%\",\"80%\",\"90%\"]', '[2]', 'Recent literature (last 5 years) should dominate your bibliography to demonstrate awareness of current scholarship.', 'PhDiZone\'s quality assurance metrics include 80% reference recency, meaning citations should predominantly come from the last 5 years to ensure current research integration.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1705, 1, 54, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the maximum plagiarism similarity index allowed by PhDiZone?', '[\"5%\",\"10%\",\"15%\",\"20%\"]', '[1]', 'Always aim for under 10% similarity to meet both PhDiZone\'s standards and most university requirements.', 'PhDiZone maintains strict plagiarism compliance with a maximum similarity index of ≤10%, verified through Turnitin and iThenticate tools.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1706, 1, 54, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which of the following is NOT listed as a core value proposition of PhDiZone?', '[\"Expert-Guided Development\",\"Research Integrity\",\"Affordable Pricing\",\"Global Accessibility\"]', '[2]', 'Focus on the quality-related value propositions rather than pricing when understanding PhDiZone\'s core offerings.', 'The four core value propositions are Expert-Guided Development, University Compliance, Research Integrity, and Global Accessibility. While pricing is discussed separately, it\'s not listed as a core value proposition.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1707, 1, 54, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'Who is PhDiZone\'s secondary target audience?', '[\"PhD scholars\",\"Master\'s students requiring research proposals\",\"Academic institutions\",\"Publishing companies\"]', '[1]', 'The service scales from PhD (primary) to Master\'s (secondary) to institutions (tertiary).', 'Master\'s students who need research proposals constitute the secondary target audience, while PhD scholars are primary and academic institutions are tertiary.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1708, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the typical document length range for a synopsis?', '[\"3-10 pages\",\"5-15 pages\",\"10-20 pages\",\"15-25 pages\"]', '[1]', 'Always check your specific university\'s requirements as length can vary within this range.', 'Synopsis documents typically range from 5-15 pages, though the exact length is university-dependent based on institutional requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1709, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many peer-reviewed sources are typically required in citations?', '[\"10-25\",\"25-50\",\"50-75\",\"75-100\"]', '[1]', 'Quality peer-reviewed sources strengthen your research credibility—aim for the middle of this range as a minimum.', 'PhDiZone\'s citation requirements specify 25-50 peer-reviewed sources to ensure adequate scholarly foundation for the research synopsis.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1710, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which referencing styles does PhDiZone support?', '[\"Only APA and MLA\",\"APA, IEEE, Harvard, MLA, Vancouver\",\"Only IEEE and Chicago\",\"All referencing styles\"]', '[1]', 'Verify your department\'s preferred citation style early in the process to ensure consistency.', 'PhDiZone supports five major referencing styles: APA, IEEE, Harvard, MLA, and Vancouver, covering the most commonly required academic formats.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1711, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What file formats does PhDiZone provide for final deliverables?', '[\"Only PDF\",\"DOCX, PDF, LaTeX (on request)\",\"Only DOCX and PDF\",\"All digital formats\"]', '[1]', 'Request LaTeX format if you\'re in a technical field that requires mathematical typesetting.', 'PhDiZone delivers documents in DOCX and PDF formats as standard, with LaTeX available upon request for technical disciplines.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1712, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the standard delivery timeline for synopsis writing?', '[\"3-5 working days\",\"5-10 working days\",\"10-15 working days\",\"15-20 working days\"]', '[1]', 'Plan ahead and allow extra time for revisions—the initial delivery is just the beginning of the refinement process.', 'The standard turnaround time for synopsis delivery is 5-10 working days, though express and extended options are available based on project complexity.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1713, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many free revisions are included within the project scope?', '[\"1\",\"2\",\"3\",\"Unlimited\"]', '[1]', 'Make your revision requests comprehensive and detailed to maximize the value of your two free revision cycles.', 'PhDiZone includes 2 comprehensive free revisions within the project scope, with additional revisions available at nominal charges if needed.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1714, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What tools does PhDiZone use for plagiarism detection?', '[\"Only Turnitin\",\"Turnitin and iThenticate\",\"Grammarly and Copyscape\",\"Custom internal tools\"]', '[1]', 'These industry-standard tools are also used by most universities, so passing these checks ensures institutional compliance.', 'PhDiZone employs both Turnitin and iThenticate for plagiarism detection to ensure comprehensive originality verification of all content.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1715, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What grammar enhancement tools does PhDiZone utilize?', '[\"Microsoft Word only\",\"Grammarly Premium and Trinka AI\",\"Only Grammarly\",\"Custom AI tools\"]', '[1]', 'Trinka AI is specifically designed for academic writing, making it particularly valuable for technical accuracy.', 'For grammar enhancement, PhDiZone uses Grammarly Premium and Trinka AI, which are specialized tools for academic writing quality.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1716, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What language standard is used for synopsis writing?', '[\"British English only\",\"American English only\",\"Academic English (US\\/UK variants)\",\"International English\"]', '[2]', 'Clarify your university\'s preferred English variant early to maintain consistency throughout the document.', 'PhDiZone employs Academic English with both US and UK variants available, ensuring compliance with different regional and institutional preferences.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1717, 1, 72, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s thesis defense success rate?', '[\"87%\",\"92%\",\"97%\",\"99%\"]', '[2]', 'This high success rate reflects the quality of expert guidance and preparation provided throughout the process.', 'PhDiZone maintains a 97% thesis defense success rate, indicating a high approval rate for scholars they support through the synopsis and defense process.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1718, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the \'SMART\' acronym stand for in objectives formulation?', '[\"Simple, Measurable, Accurate, Relevant, Timely\",\"Specific, Measurable, Achievable, Relevant, Time-bound\",\"Strategic, Meaningful, Actionable, Realistic, Trackable\",\"Structured, Methodical, Analytical, Rigorous, Testable\"]', '[1]', 'Use the SMART framework to evaluate whether your research objectives are properly formulated.', 'SMART objectives in research stand for Specific, Measurable, Achievable, Relevant, and Time-bound goals, ensuring research objectives are well-defined and attainable.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1719, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which section addresses IRB compliance and ethical clearance requirements?', '[\"Objectives formulation\",\"Literature review\",\"Methodology design\",\"Problem statement\"]', '[2]', 'Always address ethical considerations early in methodology planning, especially for clinical or social research.', 'The Methodology Design section includes ethical considerations, covering IRB compliance and ethical clearance requirements essential for research involving human subjects or sensitive data.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1720, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is included in the Title Development & Finalization component?', '[\"Only the research title\",\"Research gap analysis, title optimization, keyword integration, and institutional compliance\",\"Title and abstract only\",\"Title formatting only\"]', '[1]', 'A well-crafted title incorporates keywords for database visibility while remaining clear and focused.', 'Title Development includes comprehensive elements: research gap analysis, title optimization for clarity, keyword integration for searchability, and adherence to institutional title requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1721, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which tools are specified for Engineering & Technology methodology?', '[\"SPSS and R\",\"MATLAB, Python, Simulink, NS2\\/NS3\",\"NVivo and ATLAS.ti\",\"GraphPad and BioStats\"]', '[1]', 'Familiarize yourself with these tools if you\'re in engineering—they\'re industry standards for technical research.', 'For Engineering & Technology disciplines, PhDiZone specifies methodological tools including MATLAB, Python, Simulink, and NS2/NS3 for technical research implementation.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1722, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What statistical tools are used for Management & Commerce research?', '[\"MATLAB and Python\",\"SPSS, SmartPLS, AMOS, R\",\"GraphPad and Epi Info\",\"NVivo and ATLAS.ti\"]', '[1]', 'SPSS and SmartPLS are particularly valuable for survey research and structural equation modeling in business studies.', 'Management and Commerce research utilizes SPSS, SmartPLS, AMOS, and R for statistical analysis, supporting methods like SEM, factor analysis, and regression.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1723, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which qualitative analysis tools does PhDiZone use for Social Sciences?', '[\"MATLAB and Simulink\",\"NVivo and ATLAS.ti\",\"SPSS and AMOS\",\"GraphPad and BioStats\"]', '[1]', 'These tools are essential for coding and analyzing qualitative data like interviews and observations.', 'For Social Sciences & Humanities qualitative research, PhDiZone employs NVivo and ATLAS.ti as specialized tools for analyzing ethnographic, phenomenological, and grounded theory studies.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1724, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Defense Preparation Package include?', '[\"Only presentation slides\",\"Presentation development, question bank, presentation skills coaching, and mock defense sessions\",\"Question bank only\",\"Coaching sessions only\"]', '[1]', 'Mock defense sessions are invaluable—treat them as seriously as the actual defense to identify weak points.', 'The comprehensive Defense Preparation Package includes university-format presentation slides, anticipated question banks with model answers, delivery coaching, and practice sessions with expert feedback.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1725, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is included in the Topic Finalization Report add-on service?', '[\"Only topic recommendations\",\"Comprehensive analysis, feasibility assessment, novelty verification, and justification documentation\",\"Literature review only\",\"Gap analysis only\"]', '[1]', 'This add-on is particularly valuable early in your PhD journey when you\'re still narrowing your research focus.', 'The Topic Finalization Report provides data-driven topic recommendations, resource and time evaluation, research originality verification, and detailed rationale for topic selection.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1726, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What does the Preliminary Data/Pilot Study Design service provide?', '[\"Only sample data\",\"Sample data generation, pilot study framework, feasibility demonstration, and risk assessment\",\"Study framework only\",\"Risk assessment only\"]', '[1]', 'Pilot studies strengthen your proposal by demonstrating methodology viability before full-scale implementation.', 'This add-on includes representative datasets for methodology validation, small-scale testing protocols, proof of concept development, and identification of potential challenges with mitigation strategies.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1727, 1, 80, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many stages of expert review does PhDiZone conduct?', '[\"1 stage\",\"Minimum 2 stages\",\"3 stages\",\"4 stages\"]', '[1]', 'Multiple review stages catch different types of issues—technical errors in early stages, refinement issues in later stages.', 'PhDiZone\'s quality assurance includes a minimum 2-stage expert review by domain specialists to ensure technical accuracy and scholarly quality.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1728, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the first step in PhDiZone\'s standard process flow?', '[\"Draft creation\",\"Initial consultation\",\"Literature review\",\"Expert assignment\"]', '[1]', 'Prepare thoroughly for your initial consultation—clear communication of requirements prevents delays later.', 'The initial consultation on Day 1 involves requirements analysis and expert assignment, establishing the foundation for the entire project.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1729, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How long does the Research & Planning phase typically take?', '[\"1 day\",\"1-2 days\",\"2-3 days\",\"3-4 days\"]', '[1]', 'This planning phase is crucial—rushing it can lead to structural issues that require major revisions later.', 'The Research & Planning phase spans Days 1-2, focusing on literature review and structure development before content creation begins.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1730, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'During which days does draft creation occur in the standard workflow?', '[\"Days 1-3\",\"Days 3-6\",\"Days 5-8\",\"Days 7-10\"]', '[1]', 'The 4-day draft window allows for comprehensive content development—resist the urge to rush this creative phase.', 'Draft creation takes place during Days 3-6, involving actual content development and writing based on the established structure and research.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1731, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What happens during the Quality Review phase (Days 7-8)?', '[\"Client feedback only\",\"Internal assessment and plagiarism check\",\"Final delivery preparation\",\"Revision implementation\"]', '[1]', 'This internal review catches issues before you see the draft, saving time in the overall process.', 'Days 7-8 involve internal quality assessment and plagiarism verification before the document reaches the client for review.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1732, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many working days does Express Delivery take?', '[\"1-2 days\",\"3-5 days\",\"5-7 days\",\"7-10 days\"]', '[1]', 'Express delivery is ideal for urgent deadlines but plan ahead when possible to avoid premium costs.', 'Express Delivery is available in 3-5 working days with premium charges applied for the accelerated timeline.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1733, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the timeline for Extended Timeline projects?', '[\"10-12 days\",\"12-15 days\",\"15-20 days\",\"20-25 days\"]', '[2]', 'Complex projects benefit from extended timelines—quality shouldn\'t be sacrificed for speed in intricate research.', 'Extended Timeline of 15-20 days is available for complex interdisciplinary projects requiring more comprehensive development.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1734, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How much additional time is required per major revision cycle?', '[\"1 day\",\"2-3 days\",\"3-5 days\",\"5-7 days\"]', '[1]', 'Consolidate your revision requests to minimize timeline extensions and maintain project momentum.', 'Each major revision cycle adds 2-3 days to the timeline, allowing proper implementation of substantial changes.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1735, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many scholars has PhDiZone guided globally?', '[\"10,000+\",\"20,000+\",\"30,000+\",\"40,000+\"]', '[2]', 'This large client base provides PhDiZone with diverse experience across multiple disciplines and institutions.', 'PhDiZone has successfully guided over 30,000 scholars across 130+ countries, demonstrating extensive global reach and experience.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1736, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s on-time delivery rate?', '[\"90%\",\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', 'This high rate indicates reliable timeline planning—trust the proposed schedule but communicate any urgent deadlines clearly.', 'PhDiZone maintains a 98% on-time delivery rate, consistently meeting project deadlines and scholar expectations.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1737, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the customer return rate at PhDiZone?', '[\"60%\",\"70%\",\"80%\",\"90%\"]', '[2]', 'High return rates suggest quality service—consider using PhDiZone for multiple phases of your research journey.', 'PhDiZone enjoys an 80% customer return rate, indicating high client satisfaction and repeat business from satisfied scholars.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0);
INSERT INTO `egc_exam_questions` (`sno`, `branch_id`, `section_id`, `bank_id`, `case_study_check`, `case_study`, `option_type`, `question`, `option`, `option_answer`, `tips`, `explanation`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_by`, `updated_at`, `status`) VALUES
(1738, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many verified testimonials has PhDiZone received?', '[\"40K+\",\"60K+\",\"80K+\",\"100K+\"]', '[2]', 'Review testimonials from scholars in your discipline to understand specific expertise areas.', 'PhDiZone has received over 80,000 verified testimonials from satisfied clients, providing extensive feedback validation.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1739, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many research publications have resulted from PhDiZone-supported scholars?', '[\"11K+\",\"16K+\",\"21K+\",\"26K+\"]', '[2]', 'This publication success indicates PhDiZone\'s support extends beyond initial approval to long-term research success.', 'Over 21,000 research publications have resulted from scholars supported by PhDiZone, demonstrating real academic impact beyond synopsis approval.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1740, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many institutional partnerships does PhDiZone maintain?', '[\"13+\",\"18+\",\"23+\",\"28+\"]', '[2]', 'Institutional partnerships indicate PhDiZone\'s recognized expertise and compliance with academic standards.', 'PhDiZone collaborates with 23+ leading research institutes, establishing credibility through institutional partnerships.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1741, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of collaboration platform does PhDiZone use?', '[\"Email only\",\"Secure cloud-based review system\",\"Physical document exchange\",\"Standard file sharing\"]', '[1]', 'Cloud-based systems allow real-time collaboration and version tracking—familiarize yourself with the platform early.', 'PhDiZone employs a secure cloud-based collaboration platform for protected document sharing and review, ensuring confidentiality.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1742, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What support availability does PhDiZone offer?', '[\"Business hours only\",\"12-hour support\",\"24\\/7 support\",\"Weekend support only\"]', '[2]', 'Take advantage of round-the-clock support for urgent questions, especially when working across different time zones.', 'PhDiZone provides 24/7 support through multiple communication channels, ensuring scholars can reach out regardless of time zone or schedule.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1743, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many helpdesk communication options does PhDiZone provide?', '[\"5+\",\"7+\",\"10+\",\"15+\"]', '[2]', 'Choose the communication method that best suits your question\'s complexity—video for detailed discussions, chat for quick queries.', 'PhDiZone offers 10+ helpdesk options including phone, email, chat, and video consultation for flexible communication.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1744, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s project success rate?', '[\"95%\",\"97%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', 'This near-perfect success rate suggests robust quality control processes throughout project execution.', 'PhDiZone maintains a 99% project success rate for successful completion of undertaken projects, indicating high quality and reliability.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1745, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What pricing model does PhDiZone employ?', '[\"Fixed pricing for all projects\",\"Tiered pricing based on complexity, timeline, and requirements\",\"Hourly billing\",\"Subscription-based\"]', '[1]', 'Request a detailed quote early to understand costs—transparency in pricing helps with budget planning.', 'PhDiZone uses tiered pricing that accounts for project complexity, timeline constraints, and specific requirements, ensuring fair and transparent costing.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1746, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many payment options does PhDiZone offer?', '[\"5+\",\"10+\",\"18+\",\"25+\"]', '[2]', 'Flexible payment options are especially valuable for international students—inquire about installment plans if needed.', 'PhDiZone provides 18+ payment options with flexible payment methods and schedules to accommodate diverse scholar needs globally.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1747, 1, 81, 20, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is included in PhDiZone\'s confidentiality guarantee?', '[\"Basic privacy policy\",\"100% confidential with NDA availability\",\"Standard data protection\",\"Verbal agreement only\"]', '[1]', 'Request an NDA if your research involves sensitive or proprietary information for added legal protection.', 'PhDiZone guarantees 100% confidentiality with Non-Disclosure Agreements available, ensuring complete protection of scholar research and personal information.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:30', 0),
(1748, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'When was PhDiZone established?', '[\"2000\",\"2005\",\"2010\",\"2015\"]', '[1]', 'Remember the founding year 2005 by noting that PhDiZone has been serving the academic community for almost 20 years.', 'According to the executive summary, PhDiZone (Elysium Groups) was established in 2005, giving them nearly two decades of experience in academic research support services.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1749, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s thesis defense success rate?', '[\"87%\",\"92%\",\"97%\",\"99%\"]', '[2]', 'The 97% success rate is a key quality metric that distinguishes PhDiZone in the market.', 'PhDiZone boasts a 97% thesis defense success rate, which is highlighted as one of their core value propositions demonstrating their quality and effectiveness in supporting scholars.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1750, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many PhD holders and subject matter experts does PhDiZone have on their team?', '[\"50+\",\"100+\",\"150+\",\"200+\"]', '[2]', 'The 150+ expert count demonstrates the breadth and depth of specialized knowledge available to clients.', 'PhDiZone\'s expert-driven approach is supported by over 150 PhD holders and subject matter experts, ensuring domain expertise across various research fields.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1751, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'In how many countries does PhDiZone have a global presence?', '[\"50+\",\"80+\",\"100+\",\"130+\"]', '[3]', 'The 130+ country presence indicates PhDiZone\'s capability to understand and meet varied international academic standards.', 'PhDiZone operates in over 130 countries worldwide, demonstrating their extensive global reach and ability to serve international scholars across diverse geographic markets.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1752, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which of the following is NOT included in the core service inclusions?', '[\"Two free revisions per chapter\",\"Turnitin plagiarism report\",\"Unlimited revisions for the entire thesis\",\"Chapter-wise milestone delivery\"]', '[2]', 'Focus on the chapter-level revision limit (two per chapter) rather than expecting unlimited thesis-wide revisions.', 'The core service includes two free revisions per chapter, not unlimited revisions for the entire thesis. This structured revision policy helps maintain project timelines while ensuring quality.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1753, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the standard thesis document length range offered by PhDiZone?', '[\"50-150 pages\",\"100-250+ pages\",\"150-300 pages\",\"200-400 pages\"]', '[1]', 'The flexible page range accounts for different disciplines having different thesis length expectations.', 'According to the document parameters, thesis length ranges from 100-250+ pages, with variation depending on the academic discipline and specific university requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1754, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which plagiarism detection tools does PhDiZone use for verification?', '[\"Turnitin only\",\"iThenticate only\",\"Turnitin and iThenticate\",\"Grammarly and Copyscape\"]', '[2]', 'Remember both tools are used to provide thorough plagiarism screening from multiple detection systems.', 'PhDiZone uses both Turnitin and iThenticate for plagiarism detection, ensuring comprehensive originality verification with a maximum threshold of 10% similarity.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1755, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many chapters are included in PhDiZone\'s standard thesis architecture?', '[\"4 chapters\",\"5 chapters\",\"6 chapters\",\"8 chapters\"]', '[2]', 'The standard 6-chapter structure follows traditional dissertation formats used by most universities globally.', 'The standard thesis structure includes 6 chapters: Introduction & Problem Statement, Literature Review, Research Methodology, Data Analysis & Interpretation, Results & Discussion, and Conclusion & Future Work.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1756, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which of the following referencing styles is NOT mentioned as supported by PhDiZone?', '[\"APA\",\"Harvard\",\"Turabian\",\"Chicago\"]', '[2]', 'Focus on the six major citation styles listed; most university requirements will fall within these options.', 'PhDiZone supports APA, IEEE, Harvard, MLA, Vancouver, and Chicago referencing styles. Turabian is not explicitly mentioned in the list of supported formats.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1757, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the maximum plagiarism threshold maintained by PhDiZone?', '[\"5%\",\"10%\",\"15%\",\"20%\"]', '[1]', 'The 10% threshold aligns with most international university requirements for acceptable similarity indices.', 'PhDiZone maintains a strict plagiarism threshold of ≤10% similarity, verified through Turnitin and iThenticate, ensuring high originality standards for all thesis documents.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1758, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which file formats does PhDiZone deliver thesis documents in?', '[\"MS Word only\",\"PDF only\",\"MS Word and PDF only\",\"MS Word, LaTeX, and PDF\"]', '[3]', 'The inclusion of LaTeX shows PhDiZone\'s capability to handle technical and scientific documentation requirements.', 'PhDiZone provides flexibility in file formats by delivering in MS Word (.docx), LaTeX, and PDF formats to accommodate different university submission requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1759, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of English language standard does PhDiZone use?', '[\"American English only\",\"British English only\",\"Native Academic English (US\\/UK variants)\",\"International English\"]', '[2]', 'The dual US/UK variant support allows adaptation to different university preferences across regions.', 'PhDiZone uses native academic English standards with both US and UK variants available, ensuring appropriate language conventions based on the target university\'s requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1760, 1, 82, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which of the following is included in PhDiZone\'s pre-writing services?', '[\"Thesis defense preparation only\",\"Topic selection and research gap analysis\",\"Journal paper extraction only\",\"Statistical analysis only\"]', '[1]', 'Pre-writing services are crucial for ensuring the research topic is viable, original, and academically significant.', 'Pre-writing services include topic selection with research gap analysis, feasibility assessment, and novelty verification, helping scholars establish a strong research foundation before beginning the thesis.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1761, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which statistical analysis software is NOT mentioned in PhDiZone\'s technical stack?', '[\"SPSS\",\"STATA\",\"SAS\",\"SmartPLS\"]', '[2]', 'Focus on the six primary statistical tools listed for data analytics support.', 'PhDiZone\'s statistical analysis tools include SPSS, R, STATA, SmartPLS, AMOS, and Python. SAS is not explicitly mentioned in their technical toolset.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1762, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'For Engineering/Computer Science research, which specialized tool does PhDiZone use?', '[\"NVivo\",\"GraphPad Prism\",\"MATLAB and Python\",\"ATLAS.ti\"]', '[2]', 'MATLAB and Python are versatile tools widely used across engineering and computational research.', 'For Engineering and Computer Science domains, PhDiZone uses MATLAB, Python, NS2/NS3, Simulink, and TensorFlow as specialized tools to support technical research requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1763, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which citation management tools does PhDiZone utilize?', '[\"Mendeley and EndNote only\",\"Zotero and RefWorks only\",\"Mendeley, EndNote, and Zotero\",\"EndNote and Citavi only\"]', '[2]', 'Multiple citation management options ensure compatibility with whatever system the client or university prefers.', 'PhDiZone employs three major citation management tools—Mendeley, EndNote, and Zotero—providing flexibility in reference management based on client preferences.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1764, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What writing platform does PhDiZone use alongside LaTeX?', '[\"Google Docs\",\"MS Word\",\"LibreOffice\",\"Pages\"]', '[1]', 'The combination of MS Word and LaTeX covers both standard and technical academic writing needs.', 'PhDiZone uses MS Word and LaTeX as primary writing platforms, with Grammarly Premium for enhanced language quality control.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1765, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'For Social Sciences research, which specialized tool does PhDiZone employ?', '[\"MATLAB\",\"NVivo\",\"GraphPad Prism\",\"Bioinformatics suite\"]', '[1]', 'NVivo is industry-standard software for qualitative research and thematic analysis in social sciences.', 'PhDiZone uses NVivo, MAXQDA, and ATLAS.ti for social sciences research, which are specialized tools for qualitative data analysis commonly required in this field.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1766, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many quality control phases are in PhDiZone\'s process?', '[\"3 phases\",\"4 phases\",\"5 phases\",\"6 phases\"]', '[3]', 'The multi-layered quality control ensures comprehensive verification at every stage of thesis development.', 'PhDiZone implements a 6-phase quality control process: Initial Assessment, Progressive Review, Technical Validation, Language Audit, Plagiarism Screening, and Final Quality Check.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1767, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the standard for academic quality verification?', '[\"Master\'s level writing\",\"PhD-level writing\",\"Professional writing\",\"Graduate-level writing\"]', '[1]', 'PhD-level writing ensures the thesis meets the highest academic standards expected at doctoral level.', 'The quality metric for academic quality is PhD-level writing, verified through expert review by domain specialists to ensure appropriate academic rigor and sophistication.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1768, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What method is used to verify language proficiency in theses?', '[\"Automated grammar checking\",\"Peer review\",\"Professional editing and proofreading\",\"Machine translation verification\"]', '[2]', 'Professional human editing catches nuances that automated tools miss, ensuring publication-quality language.', 'Language proficiency is verified through professional editing and proofreading by native English experts, ensuring the thesis meets native academic English standards.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1769, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How is technical accuracy verified in PhDiZone\'s quality assurance?', '[\"Single expert review\",\"Automated verification\",\"Multi-level technical review\",\"Peer comparison\"]', '[2]', 'Multiple review layers catch technical errors that might be missed in a single-pass review.', 'Technical accuracy is ensured through multi-level technical review by subject matter experts, verifying that all methodologies, analyses, and technical content are error-free.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1770, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the standard for originality in PhDiZone\'s quality metrics?', '[\"95% original content\",\"98% original content\",\"100% original content\",\"90% original content\"]', '[2]', 'The zero-tolerance policy for plagiarism protects both academic integrity and the client\'s reputation.', 'PhDiZone maintains a standard of 100% original content with zero tolerance for plagiarism, ensuring complete authenticity through Turnitin/iThenticate screening.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1771, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which data visualization tools does PhDiZone use?', '[\"Excel and PowerPoint only\",\"OriginPro and GraphPad only\",\"OriginPro, GraphPad, Tableau, MATLAB, and Python\",\"Tableau and MATLAB only\"]', '[2]', 'Multiple visualization tools ensure the most appropriate and field-specific presentation of research data.', 'PhDiZone employs multiple data visualization tools including OriginPro, GraphPad, Tableau, MATLAB, and Python to create professional, publication-quality visualizations appropriate for different research fields.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1772, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'For Life Sciences research, which tools are specialized for PhDiZone\'s use?', '[\"SPSS and AMOS\",\"Bioinformatics suite, BLAST, and Clustal\",\"NVivo and MAXQDA\",\"Python and TensorFlow\"]', '[1]', 'Domain-specific bioinformatics tools are critical for analyzing biological sequence data and molecular structures.', 'Life Sciences research is supported with specialized bioinformatics tools including bioinformatics suite, BLAST, and Clustal, which are essential for genomic and molecular biology analyses.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1773, 1, 83, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What verification method is used for format compliance?', '[\"Automated formatting check\",\"Formatting checklist verification\",\"Template comparison\",\"Manual page-by-page review\"]', '[1]', 'Checklist-based verification systematically ensures all formatting requirements are met without oversight.', 'Format compliance is verified through a comprehensive formatting checklist that ensures adherence to university-specific formatting guidelines for margins, fonts, spacing, and structure.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1774, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the duration of PhDiZone\'s Standard Package delivery?', '[\"20-30 working days\",\"30-45 working days\",\"45-60 working days\",\"60-90 working days\"]', '[1]', 'Standard delivery of 30-45 days balances quality development with reasonable timeline expectations.', 'The Standard Package is delivered within 30-45 working days and includes a complete thesis with basic add-on services, suitable for scholars with moderate timeline requirements.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1775, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How long is the Development Phase in PhDiZone\'s process workflow?', '[\"Days 1-20\",\"Days 4-35\",\"Days 10-40\",\"Days 15-45\"]', '[1]', 'The month-long development phase allows for iterative improvement through progressive reviews and feedback.', 'The Development Phase spans from day 4 to day 35 and includes chapter-wise writing, progressive reviews, and client feedback integration, representing the core content creation period.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1776, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the response time for PhDiZone\'s 24/7 helpdesk?', '[\"Within 1 hour\",\"Within 4 hours\",\"Immediate\",\"Within 24 hours\"]', '[2]', 'Immediate 24/7 support is crucial for international scholars working across different time zones.', 'PhDiZone\'s 24/7 helpdesk provides immediate, round-the-clock support, ensuring scholars can get assistance whenever needed regardless of time zone differences.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1777, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'During which phase does plagiarism screening occur?', '[\"Development Phase\",\"Consultation Phase\",\"Quality Assurance Phase\",\"Finalization Phase\"]', '[2]', 'Quality assurance occurs after development to comprehensively verify the completed work before finalization.', 'Plagiarism screening is conducted during the Quality Assurance Phase (Days 36-40), along with technical validation and language editing, before final delivery.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1778, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is included in the Consultation Phase?', '[\"Writing and revisions\",\"Requirement analysis, SME assignment, and project planning\",\"Plagiarism screening and editing\",\"Format checking and delivery\"]', '[1]', 'Proper consultation upfront ensures alignment on requirements and prevents misunderstandings later.', 'The Consultation Phase (Days 1-3) includes requirement analysis, Subject Matter Expert assignment, and project planning to establish clear objectives and timelines.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1779, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many payment options does PhDiZone offer?', '[\"5+ options\",\"10+ options\",\"18+ options\",\"25+ options\"]', '[2]', 'Multiple payment options reduce barriers for international clients with varying banking systems.', 'PhDiZone provides 18+ flexible payment options to accommodate diverse client needs and international transaction preferences, demonstrating their global service approach.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1780, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s on-time delivery rate?', '[\"92%\",\"95%\",\"98%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', 'The high on-time delivery rate reflects effective project management and resource allocation.', 'PhDiZone maintains a 98% on-time delivery rate, demonstrating their strong project management and commitment to meeting agreed-upon deadlines.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1781, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the duration of the Advanced Package?', '[\"30 working days\",\"45 working days\",\"60 working days\",\"90 working days\"]', '[2]', 'The extended timeline for the Advanced Package accommodates additional journal paper development work.', 'The Advanced Package requires 60 working days and includes thesis writing plus journal paper preparation, suitable for scholars seeking publication support alongside their thesis.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1782, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the response time for expert consultation appointments?', '[\"Immediate\",\"Within 6 hours\",\"Within 24 hours\",\"Within 48 hours\"]', '[2]', 'The 24-hour window ensures timely access to expertise while allowing for proper expert scheduling.', 'Expert consultation appointments are scheduled with responses provided within 24 hours, allowing scholars to connect with subject matter experts for in-depth discussions.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1783, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'During which days does the Finalization Phase occur?', '[\"Days 30-40\",\"Days 36-45\",\"Days 41-45\",\"Days 45-50\"]', '[2]', 'The final week ensures all elements are publication-ready with proper formatting and documentation.', 'The Finalization Phase occurs during days 41-45 and includes format compliance checking, final review and approval, and delivery with complete documentation.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1784, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What type of payment structure does PhDiZone offer?', '[\"Full payment upfront only\",\"Milestone-based payments\",\"Payment upon completion only\",\"Monthly installments only\"]', '[1]', 'Chapter-wise payments provide transparency and allow clients to verify quality progressively.', 'PhDiZone offers milestone-based payments with chapter-wise payment structure, reducing financial risk for clients by aligning payments with delivered work.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1785, 1, 84, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is the response time for email support?', '[\"1-2 hours\",\"4-6 hours\",\"6-8 hours\",\"24 hours\"]', '[1]', 'The 4-6 hour email response ensures same-business-day replies for most time zones.', 'Email support is available continuously with a response time of 4-6 hours, providing timely assistance for non-urgent queries and documentation requests.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1786, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many scholars has PhDiZone guided globally?', '[\"10,000+\",\"20,000+\",\"30,000+\",\"40,000+\"]', '[2]', 'The 30,000+ scholar count indicates substantial expertise accumulated through real-world project experience.', 'PhDiZone has guided over 30,000 scholars globally, demonstrating extensive experience and proven track record in supporting diverse research projects across multiple disciplines.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1787, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many research papers have been published through PhDiZone\'s support?', '[\"15,000+\",\"18,000+\",\"21,000+\",\"25,000+\"]', '[2]', 'The high publication count demonstrates PhDiZone\'s expertise in meeting rigorous journal standards.', 'PhDiZone has supported the publication of over 21,000 research papers, showcasing their capability in producing publication-quality research content for academic journals.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1788, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s project success rate?', '[\"95%\",\"97%\",\"99%\",\"100%\"]', '[2]', 'The near-perfect success rate reflects rigorous quality control and client-focused service delivery.', 'PhDiZone maintains a 99% project success rate, indicating exceptional quality and client satisfaction across completed thesis projects.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1789, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many completed thesis projects has PhDiZone delivered?', '[\"5,000+\",\"7,000+\",\"9,000+\",\"11,000+\"]', '[2]', 'The 9,000+ completed theses demonstrate proven capability in handling diverse research requirements.', 'PhDiZone has completed over 9,000 thesis projects, representing substantial experience in end-to-end dissertation development across various academic fields.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1790, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What is PhDiZone\'s customer return rate?', '[\"60%\",\"70%\",\"80%\",\"90%\"]', '[2]', 'High return rates signal quality service and successful client relationships beyond single projects.', 'PhDiZone enjoys an 80% customer return rate, indicating high satisfaction and trust that leads clients to return for additional services or recommend to others.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1791, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many years of industry experience does PhDiZone have?', '[\"15+ years\",\"20+ years\",\"24+ years\",\"30+ years\"]', '[2]', 'Nearly quarter-century of experience indicates stability and accumulated expertise in academic services.', 'PhDiZone has 24+ years of industry experience (established 2005), reflecting deep understanding of academic requirements and evolving research standards.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1792, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which of the following is a primary geographic market for PhDiZone?', '[\"United States\",\"India\",\"United Kingdom\",\"China\"]', '[1]', 'Primary markets indicate regions with highest concentration of client base and market focus.', 'India is listed as a primary geographic market along with Nepal, Ethiopia, and South Africa, while Canada, Spain, and Australia are secondary markets.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1793, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many global awards has PhDiZone received?', '[\"10+\",\"15+\",\"18+\",\"20+\"]', '[2]', 'Multiple awards and recognitions indicate third-party validation of service excellence.', 'PhDiZone has received 18+ global awards along with 25 recognitions, validating their service quality and industry leadership in academic support services.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1794, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many research institute partnerships does PhDiZone maintain?', '[\"10+\",\"15+\",\"23+\",\"30+\"]', '[2]', 'Institute partnerships provide legitimacy and access to academic resources for better service delivery.', 'PhDiZone has established 23+ research institute partnerships, demonstrating credibility and collaborative relationships with academic institutions.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1795, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'Which target segment requires \'flexible timeline and expert guidance\'?', '[\"PhD Scholars\",\"Master\'s Students\",\"International Students\",\"Working Professionals\"]', '[3]', 'Working professionals have unique constraints requiring adapted service delivery approaches.', 'Working professionals who are part-time PhD candidates specifically need flexible timelines and expert guidance to balance their professional and academic commitments.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1796, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'What distinguishes PhDiZone\'s expert assignment approach?', '[\"Random assignment\",\"First-available assignment\",\"Domain-specific expert assignment\",\"General expert pool assignment\"]', '[2]', 'Matching experts to research domains ensures deep understanding and appropriate guidance.', 'PhDiZone differentiates itself through domain-specific expert assignment, ensuring each thesis is handled by a subject matter expert with relevant PhD-level expertise.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0),
(1797, 1, 85, 21, 0, NULL, 0, 'How many positive testimonials has PhDiZone received?', '[\"50,000+\",\"60,000+\",\"70,000+\",\"80,000+\"]', '[3]', 'The large testimonial count provides social proof of consistent service quality over time.', 'PhDiZone has accumulated over 80,000 positive testimonials, representing extensive client feedback and validation of their service quality and customer satisfaction.', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 1, '2025-10-09 08:27:45', 0);
